    </node>
    <node id="Yellow Fever">
      <data key="d0">Yellow Fever</data>
      <data key="d1">disease</data>
      <data key="d2">Yellow fever is an endemic disease in Yucatan, affecting both locals and foreigners, especially during epidemics.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow Fever is the disease that attacked Rose Simon during her trip and ultimately led to her death.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a838c08843884c0f3a0816d2b39bddaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-297e2cf3fdd658f56fcb73ec4f707e74</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624317</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Stagnant Waters">
      <data key="d0">Stagnant Waters</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Stagnant waters are bodies of water that contribute to the miasmas causing health issues in Yucatan due to poor drainage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a838c08843884c0f3a0816d2b39bddaf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763619819</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Rainy Season">
      <data key="d0">Rainy Season</data>
      <data key="d1">season</data>
      <data key="d2">The rainy season in Yucatan influences the health landscape, often leading to outbreaks of diseases like smallpox and yellow fever.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a838c08843884c0f3a0816d2b39bddaf</data>
