      <data key="d5">1763619820</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Mayas">
      <data key="d0">Mayas</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mayas are an ancient Mesoamerican civilization known for their advancements in writing, mathematics, and architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mayas are an ancient civilization known for their beliefs regarding the immortality of the soul and reincarnation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mayas are mentioned for their customs, including circumcision and acts of worship similar to those of the Egyptians.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mayas are an ancient civilization noted for their sophisticated number systems and monumental architecture, including mounds and pyramids in Yucatan.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mayas were a powerful ancient civilization known for their high level of cultural and technological accomplishments, spread across various regions with lasting influences.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mayas are an ancient civilization known for their advanced culture, religion, and significant monuments in tropical America.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fa1a6047d3b960e8aa1f1e7a19add07e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f65c2b617b2b75df32a484e145b034fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ba6980ac19f47019ce87374bfbf5be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83c27282913cff5172f6cf0dfa303eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e19091b4b68c6f4b29d836f6d5f11c0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7d407dd88d4f39cbd7f09e60b40325&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0986a653a68c393fd5247a90b35adc69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4a04bbf52d96486efcb2e364d70456</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763619821</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Indians">
      <data key="d0">Indians</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Indians in Yucatan predominantly retain agriculture in the region and possess rich fertile territories.&lt;SEP&gt;Indians refers to the people who uphold the belief in reincarnation and exhibit superstitions related to their ancestors and their environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Indians are a group involved in a struggle against white settlers, facing condemnation and execution during the conflict described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Indians refer to the Southern and Northwestern tribes involved in conflicts with settlers in Kentucky.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fa1a6047d3b960e8aa1f1e7a19add07e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cf3140092a745267effea6e9a53aa65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68a152136647fcdc06015572bf449dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cff61acedefa321376fd295cf6cd5c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416151ab22ab2af93343eed774c95e2c</data>
