    <node id="Maya Language">
      <data key="d0">Maya Language</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maya language is the ancestral language of the Maya people, noted for its historical significance and survival despite external influences.&lt;SEP&gt;Maya language is a language group that includes the languages spoken by the Maya civilization, used in ancient inscriptions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Maya language is referred to in relation to the meanings of certain words interpreted from the biblical context.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-965b5b39cb58a29f56a43495ef18b6ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37549c49b71d3d70c292402a64c108aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a65e48b610f2a391366b1dc455dacc28</data>
