    <node id="Chichen Itza">
      <data key="d0">Chichen Itza</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Chichen Itza is a major archaeological site of the Maya civilization, known for its monumental buildings and inscriptions.&lt;SEP&gt;Chichen Itza is an archaeological site of a large pre-Columbian city built by the Maya civilization, notable for its architectural heritage.&lt;SEP&gt;Chichen Itza is an archaeological site in Yucatan, Mexico, closely associated with the Maya civilization and the cultural narratives linked to Osiris.</data>
