      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tierra de Guerra is a tract of land in Central America where the Itzaes and other tribes preserved their ancient customs and language.&lt;SEP&gt;Tierra de Guerra is a region associated with Yucatan and its indigenous cultures.&lt;SEP&gt;Tierra de Guerra is an area where the natives maintain traditional customs and dress in accordance with ancestral practices.</data>
