      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Cynocephalus is a type of baboon known for its warning role in the narrative context of impending danger.&lt;SEP&gt;Cynocephalus is a type of baboon, representing Thoth in Egyptian mythology and appearing in various artistic representations.</data>
