    <node id="MAYAB">
      <data key="d0">MAYAB</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">MAYAB refers to the region associated with the Maya civilization, mentioned as having historical relations with Asia and Africa.&lt;SEP&gt;MAYAB refers to the region where the hidden written monuments of the Mayas were kept.&lt;SEP&gt;MAYAB is referenced as a country characterized by its soil's porosity, influencing the identity of its inhabitants, the Mayas.&lt;SEP&gt;MAYAB is a locality associated with the Mayas, considered the Mother of the Gods, believed to be significant in their civilization's development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53318967e1e0c7a354ac926405083d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83c27282913cff5172f6cf0dfa303eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4a04bbf52d96486efcb2e364d70456</data>
