    <node id="Magi">
      <data key="d0">Magi</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Magi are described as a learned tribe who once established themselves in Babylon and are linked to Maya traditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Magi refers to the learned men in ancient societies identified as Mayas, known for their roles as architects, mathematicians, and astronomers.&lt;SEP&gt;Magi refers to the learned men among the Chaldees, sharing a conceptual connection with the term Maya in various cultures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-964858730c8a8dc2179e59d3cb07c3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ba6980ac19f47019ce87374bfbf5be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22b4bcd91dd2d8b9fa5db8f58d88ab4</data>
