      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Yucatan">
      <data key="d0">Yucatan</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Yucatan is a peninsula in southeastern Mexico, notable for its flat geography, mangrove forests, and rich biodiversity that supports a variety of wildlife. It serves as a significant geographic division between the Gulf of Mexico and the Caribbean Sea, and is recognized for its unique ecosystems and vegetable productions, particularly its mahogany and cedar forests.

Historically, Yucatan astonished Spanish explorers in 1517 with its impressive monuments and advanced civilization. The region is deeply intertwined with the legacy of the ancient Maya civilization, evident in its numerous archeological findings and ancient structures, which reveal a significant cultural history. Yucatan is also associated with the Mayab name, emphasizing its geological and cultural uniqueness.

Culturally, Yucatan is characterized by various practices observed among its native populations, including traditional worship, dance, and notable customs that share similarities with African tribes. The region's history includes revolutionary movements against political figures such as Dr. Sebastian Lerdo de Tejada. Despite some crumbling monuments, Yucatan remains a vital symbol of Mayan heritage, contributing to its attraction and study in the context of American archaeology.

In summary, Yucatan embodies a rich blend of natural beauty, ecological variety, and profound historical significance, particularly relating to the ancient Maya and the evolving cultural practices of its people.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a838c08843884c0f3a0816d2b39bddaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-965b5b39cb58a29f56a43495ef18b6ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f65c2b617b2b75df32a484e145b034fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cf3140092a745267effea6e9a53aa65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08ffcfc6ec928be11797840c2e48ac2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b75bf9652f1afa0e3e6a35dbcd6728e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53318967e1e0c7a354ac926405083d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-002cf134516b6f6702e5dfec7413096b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0986a653a68c393fd5247a90b35adc69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-469abfadf4d8fb7475eafd715164f218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83c27282913cff5172f6cf0dfa303eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a65e48b610f2a391366b1dc455dacc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b991502e22e90fb761c5591cdca0b88e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eea61287f7c7aac52c315ee2cca003fc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
