    <node id="National Museum of Mexico">
      <data key="d0">National Museum of Mexico</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The National Museum of Mexico is noted for housing one of the best pieces related to the colossal statue discovered during the excavation.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Museum of Mexico oversees archaeological research and was where Dr. Jesus Sanchez is a faculty member.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Museum of Mexico houses precious relics including artifacts related to ancient cultures and histories, such as those associated with Chaacmol.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2f47d3b712e0953b518a70453701f3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5b2f7d138338b628491cb8bacb7fe79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b549627ac943f03650e7d7278845faf</data>
