      <data key="d0">Aac</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Aac is Chaacmol's brother, who kills him out of jealousy over their shared family dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;Aac is a character depicted as being in love with his sister Moo and is bound by the laws of the country regarding marital arrangements.</data>
