    <node id="Gen. Grant">
      <data key="d0">Gen. Grant</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. Grant is mentioned in the context of a visit to Ram Singh, Maharajah of Jeypoor.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Grant was a Union general who played a crucial role in rallying troops and preventing a retreat during the Battle of Shiloh.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Grant was the commander of the Army of the Tennessee during key battles, including Pittsburg Landing.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Grant is a key Union military leader involved in coordinating forces during the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Grant is a military leader who commanded Union forces, providing reports and leading charges during battles.</data>
