      <data key="d2">Plutarch is a historical figure known for his treatise, _De Iside et Osiride_, discussing elements of Egyptian mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;Plutarch is a historical figure who discussed the establishment of ergastula in ancient Rome.</data>
