    <node id="Typho">
      <data key="d0">Typho</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Typho is a mythological figure in Egyptian mythology, known as the brother of Osiris and associated with chaos and destruction.&lt;SEP&gt;Typho is depicted as a gigantic serpent in Egyptian mythology, associated with enmity towards the sun and jealousy towards his brother Osiris.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06e492003a084ec018b849a310a4e995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7dc5cd694c8e04568651d4ad21b8623</data>
