      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Aroeris is a mythological figure in Egyptian mythology, often associated with the elder Horus and the son of Osiris.&lt;SEP&gt;Aroeris is noted in mythology as a brother of Osiris, Isis, and Typho, associated with peacemaking activities.</data>
