      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Nephthis is a mythological figure in Egyptian mythology, the sister of Osiris and associated with the protection of the dead.&lt;SEP&gt;Nephthis is characterized as the sister of Osiris, involved in a love intrigue with Osiris and connected to Typho.</data>
