      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Nile is a significant river in Egypt, often personified in mythology as essential for fertility and agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nile is a historically significant river in Egypt, referenced in the context of discussing famous rivers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nile is described as a significant river with seven mouths that conceals fertile lands.</data>
