    <node id="World Athletics Championship">
      <data key="d0">World Athletics Championship</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The World Athletics Championship is a prestigious global sports competition that showcases the finest athletes in track and field events. This championship attracts top competitors from various countries, creating a highly competitive atmosphere as they strive for excellence in their respective disciplines. The event serves as a platform for athletes to demonstrate their skills and represent their nations on an international stage, thereby promoting the spirit of sportsmanship and competition.

However, it is noteworthy that the term "World Athletics Championship" has also been associated with a solemn feast celebrated in Peru, which honors the dead. This celebration is characterized by lugubrious songs and music, signifying a stark contrast to the athletic competition typically associated with the name. The dual usage of the term highlights the cultural richness and diversity in its meanings, with one interpretation focused on athleticism and the other rooted in cultural and spiritual observance. 

In summary, while the primary recognition of the World Athletics Championship is as a leading global track and field competition, it is essential to acknowledge its alternative cultural significance in the context of Peruvian traditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ed6d0588bb9562256b939c28fa258ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce38d5ecc64e3430779a09866429a260&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-732304afc34a1c4dbb7b84c2c485e530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-386823b9eb1b29a74db42941aa225998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ae911c17e49d755ada12627d0a57c5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b195a27b43ec85da2d0175fa01cef0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0dd004d7bb30cbae402f5f620fd614a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e093e5565d1be13cdd6a32df8d728ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-696f4ed37bc2689c89ed042ecf2ec6d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc505eeb3cd53b0544dd308adf0587ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e7feca07c634684d8111b02a41fcae1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac1ce8602395a115fb7f15acd4fc13c1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763627101</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
