    <node id="Dr. Elsie">
      <data key="d0">Dr. Elsie</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dr. Elsie is a medical practitioner known for her innovative ideas and commitment to providing care to women.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Elsie is a compassionate medical professional who worked from 1903 to 1913 and was known for her sympathetic approach to patients, regardless of their status.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Elsie is a physician known for her self-command, dedication to her profession, and strong connections with her family and friends.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Elsie is a leader and founder of the Scottish Women’s Hospitals, noted for her intuition and judgment of character.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Elsie is a character who faces severe illness and engages in reflective conversations about her experiences before death.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-229b0d933abdd5cd0fec83a0fe5e865e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32f709c5563ea114d4fd6bb560a0d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05ce4cb100ab0508dd550c088c47bb07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfdfb54a79e5b06ab1a40209cf48d325&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b543d0d7b10d0b065afab9c7665867c4</data>
