    <node id="Odessa">
      <data key="d0">Odessa</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Odessa is a city in Ukraine where Dr. Inglis operated during her medical missions.&lt;SEP&gt;Odessa is the city mentioned as a destination during the journey of the travelers.&lt;SEP&gt;Odessa is a city mentioned as the location where the 2nd Division is preparing and where Elsie experienced a warm welcome.&lt;SEP&gt;Odessa is referenced as a location near where Elsie is on an ambulance train during the war.&lt;SEP&gt;Odessa is a city where many wounded soldiers, including Serbians, are evacuated.&lt;SEP&gt;Odessa is mentioned as a place where a severe operation may be conducted for a Cossack.&lt;SEP&gt;Odessa is a city mentioned as a location in the correspondence dated June 24, 1917.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac8e880f6373e1f89db9eba246a0199e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5d2c15127c77eb0e9171d1fb1a5e1e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81ae10df52932fd952fbc03a861bd8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdf24e1910d1ceb68fb8c77bc4b2ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7643380e1b94787722b1984480288f4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-194746348dd5669ff6174d90d8d0118d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbc46a780201b0aee22ebb94b7217e12</data>
