    <node id="Reni">
      <data key="d0">Reni</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Reni is a location mentioned in Elsie's letters where she was stationed during World War I.&lt;SEP&gt;Reni is a village where E. is involved in setting up a hospital for badly wounded soldiers.&lt;SEP&gt;Reni is a town where the narrator describes living and working at a hospital during war.&lt;SEP&gt;Reni is a location where a hospital for sick individuals is mentioned in relation to Nicolai's journey.&lt;SEP&gt;Reni is noted as a location where work was taking place and a hospital was being closed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac8e880f6373e1f89db9eba246a0199e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-628009074c3fae1a257dddf4c7cab6d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdf24e1910d1ceb68fb8c77bc4b2ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7643380e1b94787722b1984480288f4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-194746348dd5669ff6174d90d8d0118d</data>
