      <data key="d2">The British Unit refers to the medical personnel providing assistance in the Serbian military hospital and dealing with the wounded.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Unit refers to a group of personnel that includes soldiers and officers aboard the ship, which requires management of their energy and activities during the voyage.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Unit is a military group discussed as facing challenges but showing resilience in difficult situations during a time of conflict.</data>
