      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Galatz is a location in Rumania where Dr. Inglis performed extensive medical work during a critical time in the retreat.&lt;SEP&gt;Galatz is another location where Elsie worked in a hospital for Russians during the war.&lt;SEP&gt;Galatz is a location referred to as a place where E. and the team brought equipment and engaged in medical activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Galatz is a location where work was carried out by the Scottish Sisters, mentioned in the context of medical operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Galatz is a location mentioned as a destination where the hospitals were ordered to evacuate during wartime operations.</data>
