      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Miss Brown is introduced as a figure in charge of the group of girls, responsible for their education and noted for her sentimental reflections.&lt;SEP&gt;Miss Brown is another trained Sister who helped E. with equipment logistics.&lt;SEP&gt;Miss Brown is noted as a nurse who, along with Miss Borrowman, was instrumental in retrieving the equipment during a chaotic evacuation.</data>
