    <node id="Eva">
      <data key="d0">Eva</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Eva is Elsie's younger sister, noted for being sleepy and contrasting with Elsie's more active personality.&lt;SEP&gt;Eva is Mr. Inglis' daughter who formed a close friendship with Pearly Macmillan during their journey.&lt;SEP&gt;Eva is introduced as Elsie's sister who reports on the events surrounding Elsie's efforts at the school.&lt;SEP&gt;Eva is referenced in relation to instincts regarding nursing, indicating her influence on Elsie's decisions.</data>
