    <node id="Edinburgh">
      <data key="d0">Edinburgh</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Edinburgh is a city in Scotland that holds deep personal significance for the Inglis family, particularly for Dr. Elsie Inglis. It is the intended settlement for the family after their time in Tasmania and is marked by important personal memories for the narrator. Edinburgh serves as a backdrop for significant aspects of Dr. Inglis's life, where she established her medical practice and founded a hospice.

The city is noted for being a place of professional and medical importance, where differing practices in medical care, particularly regarding anaesthetics, are discussed. Additionally, Edinburgh is where Dr. Inglis mobilized the 6th Edinburgh Voluntary Aid Detachment (V.A.D.) at the onset of the war, indicating its role in her medical endeavors. 

Edinburgh is also mentioned in the context of proposed developments, such as a women's college that aims to be built and endowed, as well as a hospital that is planned to be established. It is characterized by social gatherings and discussions, showcasing its dynamic community engagement. Notably, significant events surrounding Elsie Inglis's funeral occurred in this city, which is celebrated for its unique landscape and rich historical heritage. The connections within Edinburgh reflect not only its geographical significance but also its role in the social and medical history tied to the Inglis family and broader societal issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Edinburgh is the city where the narrative mentions the quiet sick-room.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-229b0d933abdd5cd0fec83a0fe5e865e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64db1dd7d0712bd0b11ae20de546f3e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a495d646117c26bb32b54340d258cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2f48309a39e6caff2eadec50cd1045b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b38719c302bfd7a79cb6bf09c381277c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f3cb4d420a1cee0ebcac4aa18485c89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b636798106b589dda0e7e202d80b072&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7c55405418e1856340fa2f62d4600a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563025dcd3d25d4d2626b41bcc0a84e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-774e296946b7616c22302d4e210ec424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dd87c44c3eeac386b02307ff6bf32d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a95ca1798f1fdc6104abc9bed1cf52f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c806b84743a90dfbb4163c33c2229a</data>
