    <node id="Dr. Williams">
      <data key="d0">Dr. Williams</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dr. Williams is noted as a supportive figure who agreed with Dr. Inglis in the correspondence about war-related assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Williams is a character who visits the narrator's wife due to her illness.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Williams is a character who was visited by the narrator but was not at home.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Williams is referenced as a person with whom conversations took place.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Williams is a character who meets with the narrator to discuss legal matters regarding a bond.</data>
