    <node id="Scottish Womens Hospitals">
      <data key="d0">Scottish Womens Hospitals</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Scottish Women's Hospitals is an organization renowned for its significant contributions to medical services during wartime, particularly during World War I. Founded by Dr. Elsie Inglis and supported by various Scottish Suffrage societies, this initiative aimed to provide healthcare and medical aid in conflict zones, with a particular emphasis on serving war-torn regions like Serbia.

The Scottish Women's Hospitals were established by dedicated women who sought to showcase their commitment to medicine at a time when female participation in this field was limited. Dr. Inglis played a pivotal role in leading this initiative, demonstrating her unwavering dedication to healthcare and humanitarian efforts. The organization not only deployed women to serve as medical professionals abroad but also represented a broader movement for women's rights and capabilities in the medical profession.

Throughout its operation, the Scottish Women's Hospitals successfully provided medical assistance during conflicts, contributing to the war effort and advancing the role of women in healthcare. The legacy of this organization highlights the intersection of gender, medicine, and war, underscoring the vital role that women played in supporting military and civilian health during times of crisis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4be564c5fa39fff8a20f1369b2fa02d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32f709c5563ea114d4fd6bb560a0d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b3715e8f3a5074ee835c66b56835395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce963d77a022a25ba3a2d2ad400fa56c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1105db92c26143035157a3a806604b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1f3981fcd4c2dbb0ee85b59b7739f90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-628009074c3fae1a257dddf4c7cab6d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88f6b3f825b0114b7c33343abfedda35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d37436bbfc5c51f8d3f5eadaa7be7704&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-563025dcd3d25d4d2626b41bcc0a84e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9fec82f84d40eb54a3c1a3965739403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbc46a780201b0aee22ebb94b7217e12</data>
