      <data key="d2">Scotland is mentioned in relation to local government discussions and the broader context of the United Kingdom.&lt;SEP&gt;Scotland is the region where Elsie Inglis worked to organize Suffrage societies and promote women's rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Scotland is referenced in relation to the uniform Dr. Inglis wore, reflecting her connection to her heritage.&lt;SEP&gt;Scotland is a country represented by its flag and is linked to Elsie Inglis through her service and heritage.</data>
