      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Salonika is referenced concerning the possibility of moving supplies and personnel, including a thought of it as a safer destination.&lt;SEP&gt;Salonika is the intended destination for Dr. Inglis and her unit, indicating their mission in supporting Serbian forces.</data>
