    </node>
    <node id="Mahratta War">
      <data key="d0">Mahratta War</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mahratta War is a conflict in which David Inglis participated, reflecting his adventurous life in India.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mahratta War was a conflict that took place in 1803, during which David Inglis served and observed firsthand the complexities of military and diplomatic engagements in India.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1f01e511989b4651de0b56333122230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c9efbd12b4170d1e884f967c9273e05</data>
