      <data key="d0">Martha Money</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Martha Money was the wife of David Inglis and the daughter of a business partner in Bombay; they married in 1806.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1f01e511989b4651de0b56333122230</data>
