    <node id="East India Company">
      <data key="d0">East India Company</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The East India Company is the organization that David Inglis worked for as a writer, highlighting his connection to historical trade and colonialism.&lt;SEP&gt;The East India Company was a powerful trading corporation that played a crucial role in British colonial rule in India and employed David Inglis during his time in the region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1f01e511989b4651de0b56333122230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c9efbd12b4170d1e884f967c9273e05</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
