    <node id="Bareilly">
      <data key="d0">Bareilly</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Bareilly is a city in India, mentioned in the context of the pacification of the province of Rohilcund.&lt;SEP&gt;Bareilly is a city in India where John Inglis was involved in the suppression of the Mutiny and served under General Jones.&lt;SEP&gt;Bareilly is the district that Mr. Inglis was responsible for during his time in India.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1f01e511989b4651de0b56333122230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3e67cfa2aae65293abe96f3dae9b1d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9d85bd579f0f4db276bf050b7458944</data>
