    <node id="Letters of David Inglis">
      <data key="d0">Letters of David Inglis</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The letters of David Inglis and his family are noted for their activity and wandering spirit, as well as their strong religious faith and theological discussions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1f01e511989b4651de0b56333122230</data>
