    <node id="Alexander">
      <data key="d0">Alexander</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Alexander is mentioned as a restless relative of David Inglis, known for his turbulent nature and connection to religious discussions.&lt;SEP&gt;Alexander is referenced as a historical figure, likely Alexander the Great, famous for his conquests and the spread of Hellenistic culture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1f01e511989b4651de0b56333122230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-864e2ae03ae6a965282d1c5c276b0b68</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
