    <node id="Dublin">
      <data key="d0">Dublin</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Dublin is the city where the Rotunda hospital is located and where Elsie is studying.&lt;SEP&gt;Dublin is the city where the events are occurring, mentioned several times in the context of the narrator's experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;Dublin is a city mentioned as the location in a letter dated February 1894.</data>
