    <node id="Dr. B.">
      <data key="d0">Dr. B.</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dr. B. is a medical professional known for agreeing with patient recommendations but displaying a humorous demeanor.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. B. is a medical professional who administered chloroform during a surgical operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. B. is a doctor whom an old woman is seeking; he does not go, and Elsie attends in his place.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. B. is a colleague of the narrator who has opposing views regarding women's rights, leading to a notable argument.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f4dc7c9f3044941df1985ca230c24ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1105db92c26143035157a3a806604b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4384d56f7f67884c58051b580bac6f58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7c55405418e1856340fa2f62d4600a0</data>
