      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dr. S. is a physician who is mentioned in relation to the operation and has a connection with Mrs. S.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. S. is a doctor who remains calm during a chloroform scare at the hospital.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f4dc7c9f3044941df1985ca230c24ea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7c55405418e1856340fa2f62d4600a0</data>
