      <data key="d0">New Hospital for Women</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The New Hospital for Women is an establishment in London where Elsie Inglis served as a house-surgeon.&lt;SEP&gt;The New Hospital for Women is a medical facility in which women doctors work and play a significant role in women's healthcare.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8e1105db92c26143035157a3a806604b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dd87c44c3eeac386b02307ff6bf32d8</data>
