      <data key="d1">disease</data>
      <data key="d2">Scarlet fever is a contagious disease that led to the death of Elsie Inglis's mother.&lt;SEP&gt;Scarlet fever is a contagious disease that affected two children of a patient, with Dr. Inglis providing care to prevent its spread.</data>
