    <node id="England">
      <data key="d0">England</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">England is a country that reflects a profound historical and cultural significance, characterized by its strong sense of stability as well as susceptibility to change. The entity is keen on participating in military endeavors, as indicated in contexts involving military operations, where it is portrayed as a formidable presence supporting individuals like Dr. Inglis and her army.

Furthermore, England is depicted as a nation that resists foreign rule, representing a national life that its inhabitants feel is worth preserving. It maintains a distinct cultural identity, particularly noted in discussions surrounding its local food culture and potential foreign surprises. The cultural landscape of England significantly contributes to its character, revealing an interplay of traditional values and contemporary perspectives.

Additionally, England serves as the narrator's native country, enhancing personal connections to its rich history and diverse traditions. The entity has also been linked to the established church and associated with religious critiques that surface in local sermons. Finally, England is mentioned in relation to literary contributions, especially regarding the works of Sterne, with discussions addressing the controversies surrounding his writings and the evolving perspectives toward them in the years following his death.&lt;SEP&gt;England is the home that Cecil plans to return to with Walters.&lt;SEP&gt;England is the country referenced in the context of political discussion and the state affair.&lt;SEP&gt;England is mentioned as the home country of the characters, providing a sense of nostalgia and beauty to their experience.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-628009074c3fae1a257dddf4c7cab6d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69f2e8f5cc7c639af947fe43f6cdc962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94b824e125ccc07ef22224a84ba470f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe66985061e17bec49f1898419196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31da8cb91afdafc694b4c1cdbd4ffa94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32a6a44741e5c0f11276cf06e9f29dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84307003973059440e3b98bafcdbef48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e70d2514d488605a1422b519a75a4fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ccff1ea6ecc4a7b158250715bcedc0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d045712dd6297ccc766194a43dd1e1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0feaae427cf9b154a9a737a238afba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b994957c96ad60e44faa19f24d657e7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79c397e03eded0bedcfd22c948ef8967</data>
