    <node id="Government">
      <data key="d0">Government</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Government refers to the authority that attempts to govern and address the expressed will of the people.&lt;SEP&gt;Government refers to the authoritative system the narrator's father held in high esteem, viewed as essential for maintaining order.&lt;SEP&gt;The Government employs Ganymede, under which he observes managerial inefficiencies and engages in efforts to propagate reformatory views.&lt;SEP&gt;Government is mentioned as the entity that was attacked by the Arabs.</data>
