    <node id="Ruth">
      <data key="d0">Ruth</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ruth is Angeline Stickney's sister who teaches in a district adjoining Angeline's.&lt;SEP&gt;Ruth is Angeline Stickney's sister, who accompanies her on her journey and influences decisions regarding their education.&lt;SEP&gt;Ruth is a character who returns home after one term of college and is later influenced by her sister's ambitions.&lt;SEP&gt;Ruth is described as Angeline Stickney's sister, noted for being marriageable and charming.&lt;SEP&gt;Ruth is Angeline Stickney's sister.&lt;SEP&gt;Ruth is Angeline's sister who expresses feelings of loneliness and concern for Angeline's happiness.&lt;SEP&gt;Ruth is Angeline Hall's sister, whom she corresponded with and visited during family events.</data>
