    <node id="Spring">
      <data key="d0">Spring</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Spring is the season during which Asaph Hall and Angeline Stickney expect to get married.&lt;SEP&gt;Spring is the season in which Young Simon and Roxie Daymon are engaged to be married, symbolizing renewal and new beginnings.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spring is a source of water discovered by Jack Fleming while navigating through the forest.&lt;SEP&gt;The spring is a natural water source mentioned in the text, believed to be where the gold came from.&lt;SEP&gt;The spring is a cold water source located on the mountain side where Ned Bray stops to refresh himself.&lt;SEP&gt;The spring is a natural water source that Bray visits, which has become unremarkable and serves as a focal point for character reflection.</data>
