    <node id="Cambridge">
      <data key="d0">Cambridge</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Cambridge is the city where Asaph and Angeline Hall moved for Asaph's studies and career in astronomy.&lt;SEP&gt;Cambridge is the location of a school mentioned in association with Miss Sarah Waitt and Angeline Hall.&lt;SEP&gt;Cambridge is the location where the Hall family spends time and where Mrs. Hall reflects on her life.&lt;SEP&gt;Cambridge is a city where Mr. Hall's wife and son went to stay during a smallpox outbreak.&lt;SEP&gt;Cambridge is the place where the Kennon and Halls had been neighbors and where Mr. Kennon studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Cambridge is the city where the narrator rode to visit Christ College and King's College chapel.&lt;SEP&gt;Cambridge is a city that Samuel Pepys travels to, indicating his social and professional connections.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4216b02c90231e98e23a232e47e699b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7f5587c120cd6b77ca7604ffa3373d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b7cbaacbda1b565d7c16cf842522b6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15ba2e01ff70de4541cc6b1d7ee24441&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc55b5be1d859abaa2b489bc942a9fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed7144a6153903011bff75ac1d5f586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986db80f0b248cae0ba30adbca747f75</data>
