    <node id="Rodman">
      <data key="d0">Rodman</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Rodman is a town in Jefferson County where Chloe Angeline Stickney was born.&lt;SEP&gt;Rodman is the town referenced in the narrative, providing a context for Angeline’s and her family's experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;Rodman is the location referenced in the letter written by Lady Angeline to her teacher.&lt;SEP&gt;Rodman is a location where Angeline Stickney taught and attended a seminary.&lt;SEP&gt;Rodman is the place where Angeline and Asaph return for a visit and where Angeline wishes to be with her husband.&lt;SEP&gt;Rodman is the place where Angeline Hall's family lived and where she visited relatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Rodman is a location where Asaph Hall's wife was visiting her family during the summer of 1862.</data>
