    <node id="Civil War">
      <data key="d0">Civil War</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Civil War was a significant historical conflict in the United States, taking place from 1861 to 1865, and which had an immense impact on American society and politics. This conflict was marked by key military engagements, including the battles of Gettysburg and Mill Springs, and events like the surrender of Vicksburg, which shaped the course of the nation. It involved not only military struggles but also intense societal upheavals and changes in public sentiment across various regions, including St. Paul, Minnesota.

Prominent figures during the Civil War period included Asaph Hall and Frank Moore, who were notable for their contributions amid the war's challenges. Asaph Hall was associated with the U.S. Naval Observatory and gained prominence during this tumultuous time. Frank Moore volunteered and worked at the Pioneer Press, illustrating the roles individuals played in supporting their communities during the conflict. Angeline Hall’s efforts to provide aid to the poor in Washington highlighted the social dynamics influenced by the Civil War.

The Civil War also had implications on media and public communication, with many newspapers operating under the pressing context of the war. During this time, the number of printers in Minnesota saw significant changes as they adapted to the evolving needs of wartime reporting and information dissemination. Overall, the Civil War stands as a pivotal event in American history that reshaped numerous aspects of life in the nation, from personal lives to the structure of society.&lt;SEP&gt;The Civil War refers to the conflict fought between the northern and southern states of America from 1861 to 1865.&lt;SEP&gt;The civil war that followed Muley Yezeed's death was a conflict for succession among claimants to the Shereefian throne.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ccd32b7ed6773eeb16d88857c35f0af9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e509d5b8e0fa267a06304105affc4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15ba2e01ff70de4541cc6b1d7ee24441&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93cf4b36f5828cc09fb907dbf61daf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d407b1da09abcacef35abc3b6c280f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df4b788ffe5def54bf8b99b261eaf932&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a3ab772f4c7d1211b5007a6c92e23da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b84432ad1a7600b31aab3ee4243129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49b770a2f437d2a1478f52b0f2747ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14003429c48b9d2d45e7222249b39d12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184afd23de097cea7ecadc6dfb1a7139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05ddaddeaf94d2bcd3da95a9c4f85c42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf8943ee8dd238feb8fd1d1ea67c1d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f075dca5ffdfa89a91a9f3f686330e0f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763626548</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
