    <node id="Mary">
      <data key="d0">Mary</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mary is another of Angeline's sisters, sharing sensible name choices within the family lineage.&lt;SEP&gt;Mary is another sister of Angeline Hall, mentioned in the context of family connections.&lt;SEP&gt;Mary is another individual referenced as having passed away and is connected to Nellie.&lt;SEP&gt;Mary Gilman is identified as the daughter of Mrs. Hall’s cousin and is involved in family context.&lt;SEP&gt;Mary is referenced as someone who would be delighted to see the ladies, indicating a personal connection with the group.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ccd32b7ed6773eeb16d88857c35f0af9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-761dc75dfaa658aca91981a9ec83d54c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d483764952d7db72ab6b8abd0b9b597f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385599a16e6adec90c4a4bae922a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9567484ec2e94de37ab803e0df4f01d</data>
