    <node id="Charlotte Ingalls">
      <data key="d0">Charlotte Ingalls</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Charlotte Ingalls is Lady Angeline’s sister with whom she lived after becoming an orphan.&lt;SEP&gt;Charlotte Ingalls is Angeline's sister, whom she anticipated visiting in Wisconsin.&lt;SEP&gt;Charlotte Ingalls is a relative of Angeline Hall who visited during a family reunion and is noted for her presence from the West.&lt;SEP&gt;Charlotte Ingalls is a family member who prospered in Wisconsin and visited her sisters.</data>
