      <data key="d2">Moses Stickney was a soldier in Washington's army, known for his exceptional marksmanship and longevity.&lt;SEP&gt;Moses Stickney is Angeline Hall's grandfather, whose history inspires Angeline's interest in her family's genealogy.</data>
