    <node id="Angelo">
      <data key="d0">Angelo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Angelo is the third child born to Angeline Hall on September 16, 1868.&lt;SEP&gt;Angelo is another of Angeline Hall's children, characterized as a nice and chubby boy.&lt;SEP&gt;Angelo is a family member who assists with chores, like getting milk and cream, and is mentioned to be a student.</data>
