      <data key="d2">Mrs. John R. Eastman is the next-door neighbor of the Halls who interacted with the family during their childhood.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. John R. Eastman was a neighbor who embodied sweetness and was known for her gentle authority and teaching of Christian principles.</data>
