      <data key="d0">Theophilus Stickney</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Theophilus Stickney is a man described as lovable and generous, who faced challenges in his life, including alcoholism.&lt;SEP&gt;Theophilus Stickney was the brother of Mary Stickney, who sought his sister's runaway husband during the War of 1812.&lt;SEP&gt;Theophilus Stickney is a character whose death in February led to the Stickney girls becoming orphans.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eae53fd856d28203afb9cca734e561df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ada5b526daab8bb42bced4bd5ee488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddd5ecb41e87808c4d5b933250c73c2b</data>
