      <data key="d0">Edwin Ingalls</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Edwin Ingalls is Charlotte's husband, who accompanied Lady Angeline during a dark journey and later taught her at school.&lt;SEP&gt;Edwin Ingalls is a person mentioned as having moved to Pleasant Valley around the same time as Angeline Stickney.</data>
