      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sarah Waitt is a Cambridge schoolteacher and a long-time friend of Angeline Hall who commented on Mrs. Hall's happy marriage.&lt;SEP&gt;Miss Sarah Waitt is a friend of Mr. Hall's wife, who hosted them in Cambridge.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarah Waitt is identified as a friend who accompanied the subject on a mountain excursion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7f5587c120cd6b77ca7604ffa3373d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75cbd757758ebd60747dadb03eddfded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b7cbaacbda1b565d7c16cf842522b6c</data>
