      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Union Troops are military forces that arrived to secure the area and displace Confederate forces during a conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Union troops refer to the soldiers of the Union army during the American Civil War who arrived to drive away Early.&lt;SEP&gt;Union troops refer to the American soldiers aligned with the Union during the Civil War, who faced Confederate forces in various battles.&lt;SEP&gt;Union Troops are the military forces fighting for the Union in the battle against the rebel forces, suffering significant losses.</data>
