    <node id="Asaph Hall">
      <data key="d0">Asaph Hall</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Asaph Hall is a multifaceted individual known for his contributions as both a carpenter and an astronomer, stemming from a distinguished family background and playing a significant role in historical events. His early life is marked by strong physical capabilities and intellectual prowess, traits that enabled him to make an impact in the fields of carpentry and academics within his community.

Hall’s professional journey includes significant achievements in the realm of astronomy. He gained prominence during the American Civil War and became associated with the U.S. Naval Observatory, where he navigated financial challenges while pursuing his studies at Cambridge. His dedication to science led him to secure a notable career with the U.S. Government, ultimately contributing to the advancement of astronomical knowledge.

In addition to his academic and professional pursuits, Asaph Hall is depicted as a fair-minded individual, remembered for his interactions with others, including assisting Phillips in navigating crowds. His personal life is intertwined with that of Angeline Stickney, whom he married despite their differing religious beliefs, highlighting his ability to bridge divides in both his personal and professional endeavors. 

Overall, Asaph Hall’s life encapsulates a blend of craftsmanship, scholarly achievement, and impactful social engagement, making him a noteworthy figure in both historical and scientific contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d00c65bf79fd492a5b18e73d5714807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4216b02c90231e98e23a232e47e699b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccd32b7ed6773eeb16d88857c35f0af9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7f5587c120cd6b77ca7604ffa3373d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23711e6a6e44b422911f2bdf57475a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e509d5b8e0fa267a06304105affc4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3573c74971fb594d0887556481e6476&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ae8a29bf4f3c8add60aa8ad2364f52c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b7cbaacbda1b565d7c16cf842522b6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc55b5be1d859abaa2b489bc942a9fa</data>
