      <data key="d2">Apples are also mentioned as part of the package sent from Sister Mary.&lt;SEP&gt;Apples are the raw fruit processed into cider, which are cleaned and sorted during the production stages.&lt;SEP&gt;Apples are depicted as a delicious fruit that the travelers find irresistible, symbolizing the abundance of the harvest season.</data>
