      <data key="d2">Slaves are individuals held in bondage, described in the text as suffering under harsh conditions and mistreatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Slaves in Roman society had a specific diet and were subjected to treatment that varied widely based on context.&lt;SEP&gt;The slaves assist Ly-Chee during the procession, carrying gold and cleaning equipment in his honor.</data>
