    <node id="Hinze">
      <data key="d0">Hinze</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hinze is described as the superlatively deferential man, who engages in conversation with wonder and admiration towards others.&lt;SEP&gt;Hinze is depicted as a listener who shows reverent wonder and eagerness to engage in deep discussions, often with an overacted deference.&lt;SEP&gt;Hinze is a character described as striving for recognition and characterized by an inability to express genuine admiration, often relying on superficial opinions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hinze is a character who exhibits over-acted deference and seeks the opinions of others without expecting personal gain.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b32192ddb2993846ee52feb248ad5d6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a58074ce5d0928649a811c3e3309c9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83194c35add0e85f1e77faa43fd6d5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f81cfeed72c9cc766e8d6605bb4860f2</data>
