      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tulpian is mentioned as a person of considerable interest, frequently consulted on various subjects.&lt;SEP&gt;Tulpian is a person of considerable interest, whose opinions are highly regarded and often sought after.</data>
