    <node id="Felicia">
      <data key="d0">Felicia</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Felicia is a clever woman who sometimes expresses her own thoughts during conversations, contributing to discussions without a desire to showcase her cleverness.&lt;SEP&gt;Felicia is described as a refined and well-educated woman who engages in polite conversation and hosting gatherings with her husband.&lt;SEP&gt;Felicia is mentioned in relation to Hinze but with no specific attributes or actions described in the text.</data>
