    <node id="Sir Gavial Mantrap">
      <data key="d0">Sir Gavial Mantrap</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sir Gavial Mantrap is portrayed as a man who is considered moral but engages in unscrupulous financial dealings that affect others negatively.&lt;SEP&gt;Sir Gavial Mantrap is a titled gentleman whose conduct related to the Eocene Mines led to disgrace and obscurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Sir Gavial Mantrap is a figure referenced in the context of morality and the societal perceptions of good morals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d98dca421f9ad7bdbf89c28e679535b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b35cd39246570e8cc51cc541f1b742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625804364e635f703f6cec4378f9af4f</data>
