    <node id="Melissa">
      <data key="d0">Melissa</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Melissa is a character engaged in a discussion regarding Sir Gavial Mantrap and expresses opinions about morality and disgrace.&lt;SEP&gt;Melissa expresses her opinions on morality and fairness regarding the behavior of men like Sir Gavial and Mr. Barabbas.&lt;SEP&gt;Melissa is a character mentioned in relation to expressing pity for Sir Gavial Mantrap based on his morals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d98dca421f9ad7bdbf89c28e679535b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b35cd39246570e8cc51cc541f1b742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625804364e635f703f6cec4378f9af4f</data>
