    <node id="Morality">
      <data key="d0">Morality</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Morality refers to principles concerning the distinction between right and wrong or good and bad behavior, with various interpretations in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Morality is a term that encompasses the duties of man to man but is criticized for being misused and narrow in its true implications on societal wellbeing.&lt;SEP&gt;Morality refers to the principles governing right and wrong behavior that are often misused in social discourse.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d98dca421f9ad7bdbf89c28e679535b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b35cd39246570e8cc51cc541f1b742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9481c4e9169907102e1a6a63fadb365</data>
