    <node id="Pepin">
      <data key="d0">Pepin</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Pepin is depicted as a figure reflecting the author's early youth and eagerness to present philosophical ideas to others.&lt;SEP&gt;Pepin is depicted as a young, industrious writer who reflects on themes of originality and the consequences of early publication.&lt;SEP&gt;Pepin is characterized as a writer whose perceptions have been dulled by his preoccupation with writing and publishing.&lt;SEP&gt;Pepin is described as a writer whose works are criticized for their moral aspects, which are viewed negatively in personal relations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ead820aa22844313f5dfed6efdc81ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56385ec11929562aa21bb4172c7d269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8097b697295ffa657cb5d930fa4eacab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acfc1025b8597e65b15cde8ed542d9bd</data>
