    <node id="Pumpiter">
      <data key="d0">Pumpiter</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Pumpiter is a location where the narrator has friends and occasionally visits.&lt;SEP&gt;Pumpiter is described as a considerable provincial town that houses its own newspaper press and has a vibrant literary community.&lt;SEP&gt;Pumpiter is the place from where the narrator is expected to return the marked copy of Vorticella's book.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ead820aa22844313f5dfed6efdc81ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fee473d0cd24b2b054fd03b290013c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b0a545773b8336ab8625e557443eba8</data>
