      <data key="d0">Madness</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Madness is referenced as an extreme outcome in the spectrum of disorders that may afflict authors due to the stress of their vocation.&lt;SEP&gt;Madness is referenced as a troop that follows alongside themes of love and desire, indicating the chaotic aspects of passion.</data>
