      <data key="d0">Delectable Mountain</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Delectable Mountain symbolizes an idealized viewpoint or philosophical state where perspectives are less affected by personal biases.&lt;SEP&gt;Delectable Mountain symbolizes an ideal perspective or state of understanding that one strives for in philosophical contemplation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f446ee07dbe03b9bff0d1c4a66490f12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2131d24a8dbb5fbb7841a0c8eb97f9f7</data>
