    <node id="Julia">
      <data key="d0">Julia</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Julia is Merman's wife, who recounts the event that marks the beginning of Merman's troubles.&lt;SEP&gt;Julia is Merman's wife, who shows resilience and resourcefulness while managing household needs and supporting her husband's pursuits despite financial struggles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0caba7a3455a33871464a9439e236182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80c276cf271abccc0fa5724fbb4d01b5</data>
