    <node id="Magicodumbras">
      <data key="d0">Magicodumbras</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Magicodumbras are referenced as a subject of intellectual debate that Merman believes Grampus misrepresents in his work.&lt;SEP&gt;Magicodumbras are referenced as subsidiary elements in Grampus's intellectual system, associated with Merman's arguments.&lt;SEP&gt;Magicodumbras refers to a subject of theoretical exploration that is discussed by both Grampus and Merman, central to their academic disagreement.&lt;SEP&gt;Magicodumbras refers to a topic of Merman's controversial theories which he believes are significant yet misunderstood by others.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0caba7a3455a33871464a9439e236182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51fbf078c5fa58ff6dbd05d3e173932f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15731bb06f5468be78ed2b36a5ef8f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f5219425f0dd684e1c14ee102afdc4b</data>
