    </node>
    <node id="Zuzumotzis">
      <data key="d0">Zuzumotzis</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Zuzumotzis are mentioned alongside the Magicodumbras as a critical topic in Merman's discussions about historical perspectives.&lt;SEP&gt;Zuzumotzis are also cited as part of the discourse between Merman and Grampus, contributing to the themes of the argument.&lt;SEP&gt;Zuzumotzis is another theoretical subject referenced in the dispute between Grampus and Merman, highlighting differing views on this topic.&lt;SEP&gt;Zuzumotzis is another subject of Merman's theories that he feels strongly about and believes deserve attention and recognition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0caba7a3455a33871464a9439e236182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51fbf078c5fa58ff6dbd05d3e173932f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15731bb06f5468be78ed2b36a5ef8f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f5219425f0dd684e1c14ee102afdc4b</data>
