    <node id="Sermons">
      <data key="d0">Sermons</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Sermons are speeches delivered by the father to his parishioners, reflecting his views and teachings, marked by his own composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Sermons are delivered by Merman under the guise of critique against those who overreach in intellectual pursuits, highlighting themes of failure and humility.&lt;SEP&gt;The sermons published by Laurence Sterne were delivered on significant occasions and contributed to his local recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;Sermons are discourse pieces written by Sterne that lacked popularity compared to his novels, noted for their whimsical style.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0caba7a3455a33871464a9439e236182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184fcee92f8ae5f8c3132b64ac949ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3812c4b261af1d683ef95145417d255b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-483dfdb84cf847447a77aecaac7cb8a5</data>
