    <node id="Touchwood">
      <data key="d0">Touchwood</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Touchwood is depicted as a complex character who exhibits both honorable qualities and a bad temper, leading to contradictory behavior in social interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Touchwood is a character who experiences fluctuating moods, often displaying bad temper and a complicated emotional response towards others.&lt;SEP&gt;Touchwood is a character depicted as having great abilities yet struggles with inconsistency and bad temper, leading to poor judgments.</data>
