      <data key="d0">Parliament</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Parliament represents a governing body and is mentioned in the context of the character Touchwood's potential future involvement in public service.&lt;SEP&gt;Parliament is referenced as a political institution where Touchwood could potentially serve but is advised against due to his temperament.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-022b8d49df0a9b3198a3827e7ca1f148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e8555ae56f6e9ad9e155334b3a6e24c</data>
