    <node id="Spike">
      <data key="d0">Spike</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Spike is illustrated as an elector who voted for Progress without being formally attached to its ideology.&lt;SEP&gt;Spike is an elector who identifies with Progress and has a peculiar personality marked by preoccupations with cleanliness and abstraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Spike is a character who represents class-needs and objects to certain legislation that affects trade, evolving from selfish interests to public-spirited actions due to shared trade concerns with neighbors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-022b8d49df0a9b3198a3827e7ca1f148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9127f659e1e3f554bc81f7f22a98021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c758b05fea17517273fd6e6c9e13af42</data>
