    <node id="Political Molecule">
      <data key="d0">Political Molecule</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Political Molecule refers to individuals within a political context who contribute to larger societal goals, often without conscious awareness of their impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Political molecule is a term used to describe Spike's classification as a political entity with a gentleman-like demeanor and influence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-022b8d49df0a9b3198a3827e7ca1f148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c758b05fea17517273fd6e6c9e13af42</data>
