    <node id="Temper">
      <data key="d0">Temper</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Temper refers to the habitual state or tendency of an individual's emotional responses, particularly in relation to their behavior and reactions to situations.&lt;SEP&gt;Temper is a characteristic affecting Touchwood's behavior, influencing his judgments and social interactions negatively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-022b8d49df0a9b3198a3827e7ca1f148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83194c35add0e85f1e77faa43fd6d5a7</data>
