    <node id="George Eliot">
      <data key="d0">George Eliot</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">George Eliot is the author of "Impressions of Theophrastus Such," known for her significant contributions to literature.&lt;SEP&gt;George Eliot is the author of "Impressions of Theophrastus Such," an insightful exploration of human relationships and well-being.</data>
