    <node id="Lentulus">
      <data key="d0">Lentulus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lentulus is mentioned in an obituary, noted for his reserved nature and lack of overt rivalry, prompting reflection on societal perceptions of ambition.&lt;SEP&gt;Lentulus is a character who reflects on the concepts of motive and cause, believing in the reformative power of ideas while considering societal confusion around them.&lt;SEP&gt;Lentulus is a character who engages in discussions about poetry and philosophy, demonstrating a unique perspective on artistic expression and intellectual thought.&lt;SEP&gt;Lentulus is a thinker who engages in conversations about poetry, philosophy, and the nature of knowledge, and reflects a unique perspective on various subjects.</data>
