    <node id="Jews">
      <data key="d0">Jews</data>
      <data key="d1">ethnicgroup</data>
      <data key="d2">Jews are a distinct ethnoreligious group characterized by both cultural and religious dimensions, often identified through their shared history, cultural contributions, and experiences of oppression. This group, originating from the ancient Hebrews, has maintained its identity through a rich tapestry of cultural and spiritual heritage, even in the face of adversity and discrimination.

Historically, Jews have encountered significant challenges, including isolation and persecution, which have influenced their communal identity. They are recognized for their steadfast observance of traditions and practices associated with Judaism. This ethnoreligious identity has frequently been a focal point of societal perceptions and prejudices, leading to a widespread experience of anti-Semitic attitudes throughout history.

Additionally, Jews have significantly contributed to various aspects of human culture, including language and the arts. However, their portrayal has not always been positive; narratives from certain periods depict Jews in degrading contexts, highlighting experiences of servility and oppression, such as during slavery. 

In contemporary contexts, Jewish communities can be found around the world, including specific populations in cities like Fez, where they are situated primarily in the new city area. The discourse surrounding Jews encompasses their role in shaping not only their own narratives but also broader cultural and historical developments, including their significant role in the birth of Christianity. Overall, the identity of Jews is multifaceted, reflecting a complex interplay of cultural, religious, and historical factors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96c97616301428800d67230455b99e05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6ec6b33bad7d855f63b027ce155c41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32a6a44741e5c0f11276cf06e9f29dfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf1500eca47c9a930e310cc4b31eb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a032a23ccb5ee9bb45879a8d6dba2c2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f749f37b5c1af95239cafc0a0a74ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45af3d0999432adf74bdb708ed276f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d3ba708724915d4c95066561027635&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a3a39ae3aa8492d1ce85349e33fe6e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86994d5a5ba62d67eaecd5aaeeb5aab4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
