    <node id="Ezra">
      <data key="d0">Ezra</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ezra is a historical figure noted for leading the return of the Jews to Jerusalem from Babylon and is significant in Jewish history.&lt;SEP&gt;Ezra is cited as a historical figure who led a return from exile, symbolizing hope for the Jewish people.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96c97616301428800d67230455b99e05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a032a23ccb5ee9bb45879a8d6dba2c2d</data>
