    </node>
    <node id="Maccabees">
      <data key="d0">Maccabees</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maccabees refer to a group of Jewish rebel warriors who led a successful revolt against the Seleucid Empire, embodying the struggle for national independence.&lt;SEP&gt;Maccabees are referenced as figures of historic significance known for their resistance and leadership within Jewish history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96c97616301428800d67230455b99e05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a032a23ccb5ee9bb45879a8d6dba2c2d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
