    <node id="Christianity">
      <data key="d0">Christianity</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Christianity is presented as a belief system that the protagonist considers in the context of commercial relationships and societal discourse.&lt;SEP&gt;Christianity is referenced as a secretly working influence in the narrative structure proposed by Pepin for his romance.&lt;SEP&gt;Christianity is portrayed as a religion that has historically oppressed Jews and is associated with hostility towards them in this context.&lt;SEP&gt;Christianity is a major world religion that originated from the Jewish tradition and is centered on the life and teachings of Jesus Christ.&lt;SEP&gt;Christianity is discussed in the context of its origins and relation to Jewish heritage, particularly regarding prophetic fulfillment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96c97616301428800d67230455b99e05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8097b697295ffa657cb5d930fa4eacab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389b8ee79aa909c057f01fc6f9637036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6ec6b33bad7d855f63b027ce155c41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f749f37b5c1af95239cafc0a0a74ff</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
