      <data key="d0">Modern Apostles</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Modern apostles are contemporary advocates for Christianity, often using updated expressions and interpretations of ancient beliefs.&lt;SEP&gt;Modern apostles are referenced in connection to their differing perspectives and expressions of Christianity compared to historical views.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96c97616301428800d67230455b99e05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f749f37b5c1af95239cafc0a0a74ff</data>
