    <node id="Poetry">
      <data key="d0">Poetry</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Poetry is described as an artistic form that uses artificial language to express emotions and ideas, differing in significance and style according to various perspectives, including that of Lentulus.&lt;SEP&gt;Poetry is discussed as a possible form of expression that Lentulus conceives could emerge differently in the future.</data>
