      <data key="d0">Shaksperian Motto</data>
      <data key="d1">phrase</data>
      <data key="d2">The Shaksperian motto refers to a well-known saying that encapsulates the dichotomy of morality and immorality: "Fair is foul and foul is fair."</data>
