      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sophocles is a renowned ancient Greek playwright, whose works are often lauded for their moral and artistic qualities.&lt;SEP&gt;Sophocles is mentioned as a tragic playwright whose works are destined to exist perpetually.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3b35cd39246570e8cc51cc541f1b742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c781927a13f05b8bf3cc68dedd0ed839</data>
