    <node id="Trost">
      <data key="d0">Trost</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Trost is a character who expresses a pessimistic view about the state of the universe but maintains hope for a better future and encourages the narrator.&lt;SEP&gt;Trost is a friend mentioned in relation to his views on the state of the universe and hope for the future.&lt;SEP&gt;Trost is a character who argues the potential of machines to enhance human thinking processes and takes a critical stance on the idea of humanity being outpaced by technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Trost is a character who expresses skepticism about logical suppositions presented in the discussion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3b35cd39246570e8cc51cc541f1b742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90fd9a36fae91000a3e050e11afb101c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f3f0b75db9dc9dc4dff7faa45e9f25b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f5df96639b73ae94749ba10e9d2c87</data>
