      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The non-resident, jovial clergy represent a criticism of the church's role in English society, associated with historical practices of governance and community.&lt;SEP&gt;The Clergy is criticized for their high status and controversial practices, leading to public discontent.</data>
