    <node id="English">
      <data key="d0">English</data>
      <data key="d1">language</data>
      <data key="d2">English is the language in which Pepin's characters would express themselves, representing the discourse of powerful minds.&lt;SEP&gt;The English are described as the ancestors of the narrator's nation, known for their historical conquests and traditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The English are presented as the native population facing the challenges of immigration and cultural integration.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8097b697295ffa657cb5d930fa4eacab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d6d693b5da179ac238c1380743ccaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa5e1a83155f3287dd6529a44afe4517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07</data>
