      <data key="d2">The Duke of Wellington is recognized as a good ruler in England, whose actions might have stirred controversy regarding the emancipation of Catholics.&lt;SEP&gt;The Duke of Wellington is mentioned as a political figure who supported the opposition against Durham's handling of the rebellion.</data>
