      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Judaism is a monotheistic religion encompassing a wide body of texts, practices, and beliefs, historically associated with the Jewish people.&lt;SEP&gt;Judaism is a religion characterized by a belief in one God and a culture and tradition that has been shaped by a long history of persecution and resilience.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e6ad7b1efc102b531e61eabc7cf14aea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf1500eca47c9a930e310cc4b31eb6</data>
