    <node id="Calvary">
      <data key="d0">Calvary</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Calvary is referenced as a historical and religious event that was parodied by medieval Jews in a commentary on societal behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Calvary is traditionally regarded as the site of Jesus's crucifixion, an essential element in the Christian narrative.</data>
