    <node id="Koran">
      <data key="d0">Koran</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Koran is an ancient text notable for its literary and religious significance, often discussed in relation to its complexity, authorship, and influence on various literary figures. It has been the subject of analysis by prominent critics like Behmer, who examines its authenticity and its connections to noted authors such as Laurence Sterne. Behmer's critiques address the Koran’s recognized status among some scholars, while also delving into debates about its authenticity, especially in relation to Sterne and his literary style.

The Koran is not just a religious manuscript; it has been seen as a source of inspiration for literary figures like Johann Wolfgang von Goethe. It is believed that Goethe referenced the Koran during his later years, and sentiments and sayings from this text may have influenced his writing. Furthermore, the text has been involved in discussions about translations and reprints, indicating its broad impact across linguistic and cultural contexts.

In summary, the Koran serves as a vital literary work intertwined with themes of authenticity and influence, especially concerning its relationship to authors such as Sterne and Goethe. Scholars continue to debate its authorship and significance, marking it as a complex entity worthy of ongoing discourse in literary and religious studies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Koran is described as the foundational religious text of Islam, prohibiting certain practices related to slavery.&lt;SEP&gt;The Koran is discussed in relation to its teachings on the abolition of slavery, representing a religious framework of the subject.&lt;SEP&gt;The Koran is a sacred text in Islam, referenced by Ben Oris to discuss freedom and its spiritual implications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Koran is referenced in the context of a quote regarding the freeing of individuals and its importance in Islamic teachings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a58074ce5d0928649a811c3e3309c9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58d87bc060205995efa9baf4bddb1a07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-096d82a8b687771312b327300d1f1171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302bb08717ae1ac7bbe814edbfc98875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12e58d009015748875e7d97f6b72f688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073c32eb7cfcec94cf8952d9901d1c9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c29ec3cd76c13c7da9bd30bfc253b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-458f12b07f966802c9353e65d5abc548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea440613a1c400f54c6088d2b80f02cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39746a374c565c0e58462818e02e77f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67661a5e143ad1775de09087e2149acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c94d80ebde4b68648f96bb92f8d0e2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
