    <node id="Hamburgischer Unpartheyischer Correspondent">
      <data key="d0">Hamburgischer Unpartheyischer Correspondent</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Hamburgischer Unpartheyischer Correspondent is the publication where a relevant review of Sterne's work appeared.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hamburgischer Unpartheyischer Correspondent is a journal that mentioned Laurence Sterne's departure for Paris and his eventual recognition in Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hamburgischer Unpartheyischer Correspondent is a publication that reviewed Sterne's book, marking an early mention of it in literary journals.&lt;SEP&gt;Hamburgischer Unpartheyischer Correspondent is a publication that received the observations of Matthias Claudius and contributed to his reception in Hamburg.&lt;SEP&gt;Hamburgischer Unpartheyischer Correspondent is a publication mentioned in the text, noted for its contributions to literary discussion.</data>
