    <node id="Deutsches Museum">
      <data key="d0">Deutsches Museum</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Deutsches Museum is a publication mentioned in references about mathematical works and literary analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Deutsches Museum is a historical institution referenced in the context of literary correspondence regarding Matthias Claudius.&lt;SEP&gt;The _Deutsches Museum_ is a publication that includes references to Sterne in the context of physiognomy.&lt;SEP&gt;Deutsches Museum is a publication to which Sturz contributed a letter and several works regarding fashion and literature.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsches Museum is a historical publication where Sturz printed a poem in 1776 discussing the theme of fashion.&lt;SEP&gt;Deutsches Museum is a historical institution noted for its works and publications cited within the text.</data>
