    <node id="Sentimental Journey">
      <data key="d0">Sentimental Journey</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Sentimental Journey is a notable literary work by Laurence Sterne, published shortly before his death. It explores themes of sentimentality, human emotions, and travel, which contribute significantly to his literary fame. The work garnered enthusiasm upon its publication and became more popular in Germany than Sterne's earlier work, Tristram Shandy. This popularity was enhanced by a German translation undertaken by Bode, which not only created competition with Zückert's translation but also greatly influenced the reception of English literature in Germany.

Sentimental Journey is frequently referenced in discussions surrounding Sterne's literary influence, particularly in its impact on the narrative style and themes adopted by other authors, such as Schummel and Bock. The text has been celebrated for its exploration of complex character perceptions, notably that of Yorick, and its unique blend of sentiment and humor. The work has led to further adaptations and imitations, reflecting its significant legacy within literary history.

The impact of Sentimental Journey extends beyond its initial reception, as it has been a subject of critique, particularly concerning its sentimental elements, and has inspired various literary critiques and scholarly discussions. Moreover, it is mentioned alongside Sterne's other writings in evaluations that underline its importance in the broader context of 18th-century literature. Its narrative structure and thematic depth have made it a model for other literary works, contributing to the ongoing discourse on sentiment in literature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b1ddd79524e91ba84eecbc707c7a2b7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42f3a2f0a754041c29f091e82271385c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb9f823daea4acf22b2dce0ec0b834ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e7f1d14d418ffd32ee04aefb91e7331&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3633c2240cf930228d1d94b3be682bf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77f5d39cb0cceb82bc5a1d37faf560f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4c3f247ede6e2e4cbb7778c1b56fd58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302bb08717ae1ac7bbe814edbfc98875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb3d3d51e372c48bb1c3585adf76c5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e42cef61a79d34e5bcf885a966963554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23201d16810e4a370ffadc0b018cb013&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163ef765f849b1375848fc7b21a3b35c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fffe095b624cf5296e4dd35470f940d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b57f8b57daf11b165b8852ab7e62eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98dcb2da270a1bb0417354dcf23b9656&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7be859800282f20899485aabb0c91c80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-573f9ee936a1b21e04721d34c3cc59f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9eb63434ade7863dbb529206940c54f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84307003973059440e3b98bafcdbef48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95bd5a42403a89f556cf4ccd4b82fd6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb6830a00197a03b02eae670e7f2e9ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c29ec3cd76c13c7da9bd30bfc253b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bed52ff145a82972c1126c22e4c660b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c9c0013c86c9a2d0424cec3204472c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f99047222f973cdfa74a4aaa41bc1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7eb91ef19d9479c183ea94881f5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-458f12b07f966802c9353e65d5abc548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f84f8d10490e85138ed83f5d3bbf9fa</data>
