    <node id="Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften">
      <data key="d0">Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a periodical that reviewed the Zückert translation of Tristram Shandy and acknowledged Sterne’s literary merit.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is noted for reviewing literary works and contributing to literary criticism.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a German publication that evaluates literary works and expresses skepticism about authenticity.&lt;SEP&gt;The "Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften" is a publication mentioned in the context of literary works and criticism.&lt;SEP&gt;Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a publication that favored works influenced by Sterne and reviewed his "Winterreise" without critical evaluations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deutsche Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a literary review that critiques Bock's writing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-10af28895017a86626bcf11657f1ec8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a99d58be4f096b2bbc3dd443af69754&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbc3db960625e360803e71c625147d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-573f9ee936a1b21e04721d34c3cc59f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9eb63434ade7863dbb529206940c54f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-458f12b07f966802c9353e65d5abc548</data>
