    <node id="Allgemeine deutsche Bibliothek">
      <data key="d0">Allgemeine deutsche Bibliothek</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Allgemeine deutsche Bibliothek is mentioned as a literary repository founded in 1765.&lt;SEP&gt;Allgemeine deutsche Bibliothek is a publication that reviewed “Winterreise,” praising Sterne's ability to reveal goodness in commonplace matters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Allgemeine deutsche Bibliothek is a literary journal that published reviews of Schummel's work, reflecting varying opinions on the author's style and effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Allgemeine deutsche Bibliothek reviewed Timme's work positively, acknowledging its satirical significance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-10af28895017a86626bcf11657f1ec8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9c0367c62a6ef1f6fa6379da0c02c96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a362f2b4122dbc620cf476357f1ece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fffe095b624cf5296e4dd35470f940d</data>
