      <data key="d2">Böttiger is referenced as a critic and translator, known for his comments on translations of Sterne's works.&lt;SEP&gt;Böttiger is a commentator who discusses Sterne's literary practices and comments critically on Ferriar's treatment of Sterne.&lt;SEP&gt;Böttiger is mentioned as having an opinion on Schink's work, viewing it as a reworking of Stevenson’s continuation.&lt;SEP&gt;Böttiger is a person who hints at certain complexities in a literary context.&lt;SEP&gt;Böttiger is mentioned in the index with multiple page references.</data>
