      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Siegwart is a book published in 1776, considered influential in furthering the sentimental movement and its expression.&lt;SEP&gt;Siegwart is referenced in the context of sentimentality and as a target of critique in the characters’ discussions on literary themes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c22d20d40b43b3d2c1dbb21d56b7f2c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef7a5904617eb5f54e94c5ea84fd0b1f</data>
