    <node id="Sentimentalism">
      <data key="d0">Sentimentalism</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Sentimentalism is a literary style or movement discussed in relation to Sterne and the criticisms that arose against its forms.&lt;SEP&gt;Sentimentalism is a cultural movement characterized by exaggerated emotions and expressions, which plays a significant role in shaping the narrative and characters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f9c229a6071bf66e32276d62d67abee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4d01e530f294f930479d90da05382af</data>
