    <node id="Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften">
      <data key="d0">Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The "Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften" is a publication that discussed themes related to German literature and compares it with English influences, as mentioned in an article entitled "Ueber die Laune."&lt;SEP&gt;Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a literary periodical that mentions Sterne and discusses themes related to humor and literature.&lt;SEP&gt;The Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften is a publication that reviewed Sterne's work but delayed a full critique until after translation.&lt;SEP&gt;The _Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften_ is a publication that reviewed a collection of letters, raising questions about the nature of relationships described within.&lt;SEP&gt;The _Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften_ is a publication that reviewed Ferriar's book on literary theft.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-573f9ee936a1b21e04721d34c3cc59f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84307003973059440e3b98bafcdbef48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb6830a00197a03b02eae670e7f2e9ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-931aa8f5a62ee9ae96e93069b67b84fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-757a7ae57a284fa20e40220b7c7af037</data>
