      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Möser is a figure who advises against epidemic sentimentalism and promotes genuine emotion through practical advice.&lt;SEP&gt;Möser is an author who provides advice on genuine emotion in his work “Patriotische Phantasien.”</data>
