      <data key="d0">Düntzer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Düntzer studied Kaufmann’s attempts and described them as self-promotional.&lt;SEP&gt;Düntzer is an editor involved in "Herder's Briefwechsel" between 1771 and 1773.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-003097ce0b9615e69c58849744d9a337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8429a197795773b69fd79fc5921e1e</data>
