      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Magazin der deutschen Critik was edited by Gottlob Benedict Schirach and published in Halle from 1772-1776.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b00bff87303bf89315a4f5f9c478e3b5</data>
