      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Johann Georg Meusel published several works including "Das gelehrte Deutschland" and "Lexicon der von 1750 bis 1800 verstorbenen teutschen Schriftsteller," running from 1796-1806 and 1802-1816 respectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b00bff87303bf89315a4f5f9c478e3b5</data>
