      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Neue Allgemeine deutsche Bibliothek was edited by Bohn in Kiel from 1793-1800 and by Nicolai in Berlin und Stettin from 1801-1805.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b00bff87303bf89315a4f5f9c478e3b5</data>
