      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Neue Bibliothek der schönen Wissenschaften und der freyen Künste was published in Leipzig from 1765-1806 and edited first by Chr. Felix Weisse and later by Dyk.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b00bff87303bf89315a4f5f9c478e3b5</data>
