      <data key="d0">Neue Critische Nachrichten</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Neue Critische Nachrichten is a publication that reviews Bode's translation and discusses its relation to Shakespeare and the literary qualities of "Sentimental Journey."&lt;SEP&gt;Neue Critische Nachrichten was published in Greifswald from 1750-1807, with Georg Peter Möller being the editor from 1779.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b00bff87303bf89315a4f5f9c478e3b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bed52ff145a82972c1126c22e4c660b</data>
