      <data key="d0">Teutscher Mercur</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Teutscher Mercur was published in Weimar from 1773-89 and the Neuer deutscher Merkur from 1790-1810, with involvement from Wieland, Reinhold, and Böttiger.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b00bff87303bf89315a4f5f9c478e3b5</data>
