      <data key="d0">Wandsbecker Bothe</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Wandsbecker Bothe is a publication that praised Bode's translation and highlighted its superiority over others.&lt;SEP&gt;Wandsbecker Bothe was edited by Matthias Claudius and published in Wandsbeck from 1771-75.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b00bff87303bf89315a4f5f9c478e3b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba9616c39c6806c71b17146575a3dbfb</data>
