      <data key="d1">literarycharacter</data>
      <data key="d2">Robinson Crusoe is a notable English novel that combines extraordinary and everyday elements, influencing German literary interests.&lt;SEP&gt;Robinson Crusoe is referred to in the context of a tiny fish's residence, connecting to the themes of solitude and survival from literature.</data>
