    <node id="House of Commons">
      <data key="d0">House of Commons</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The House of Commons is the elected lower house of Parliament in the United Kingdom, where significant resolutions regarding Canada were discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;The House of Commons is the lower house of the Parliament of the United Kingdom, which played a role in the legislative discussions concerning Lower Canada.&lt;SEP&gt;The House of Commons is mentioned as a parliamentary body where Lord John Russell defended Durham's actions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d3c806038738c5cf824708ed3cfff5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac7fb6c5e874c886dbb8df30d7d6fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0359fb0e1dc5215c33545ffddcd78876</data>
