    <node id="Lord Gosford">
      <data key="d0">Lord Gosford</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lord Gosford was appointed as the governor and chief royal commissioner for Canada during a period of unrest.&lt;SEP&gt;Lord Gosford is the governor who proposed numerous policies to address grievances and promote reconciliation between French and English Canadians.&lt;SEP&gt;Lord Gosford was the governor of the colony who faced challenges in managing political disputes and governance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f63400d8188502b67eda00c561659eb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0359fb0e1dc5215c33545ffddcd78876&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ae911c17e49d755ada12627d0a57c5f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
