      <data key="d0">Burgundy</data>
      <data key="d1">product</data>
      <data key="d2">Burgundy is referenced as a type of wine consumed during social interactions among the characters in the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f63400d8188502b67eda00c561659eb8</data>
