    <node id="Great Britain">
      <data key="d0">Great Britain</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Great Britain is a country referenced in relation to the institutions and governance of the Canadas.&lt;SEP&gt;Great Britain is referenced regarding its conciliatory policy towards French-Canadian loyalty during political unrest.&lt;SEP&gt;Great Britain is noted for its political treaties and historical relations with the Empire of Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Great Britain is referenced in the context of capturing Gibraltar and its influence in the region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fa1b94cc88676d252f09238e9d2fcd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52a624a7e98a490d86c7ae612749e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67661a5e143ad1775de09087e2149acd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
