      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lord Goderich was responsible for attempting to resolve the financial difficulties by instructing a governor on revenue control.&lt;SEP&gt;Lord Goderich presented financial proposals in 1830, which were met with resistance by Papineau.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2b1afd400ed63eed6be44317b9ae3f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da749e17a56c35554061ac541d67d08c</data>
