    <node id="Chateau Clique">
      <data key="d0">Chateau Clique</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Chateau Clique refers to the political faction that opposed Papineau and his friends, often benefiting from a privileged position in governance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chateau Clique is an elite political group opposed to the Patriotes and is part of the historical conflict in Canada.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chateau Clique is a political faction associated with power struggles against the Patriotes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chateau Clique refers to a political faction in Lower Canada opposing the Patriotes, involved in significant historical conflicts.</data>
