      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Quebec Act of 1774 restored French laws in Canada, serving as a foundational policy affecting the status of the French language.&lt;SEP&gt;The Quebec Act was legislation passed by the British Parliament granting rights to the French Canadians and altering governance in Canada.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41f4557b5a58dc496c18ce0c8f8f2c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-353f63fa013a00ee4a62ffebc8c022a9</data>
