      <data key="d2">St Charles is a village in Canada where skirmishes occurred during tumultuous historical events.&lt;SEP&gt;St Charles is another village involved in the resistance movement against the British troops.&lt;SEP&gt;St Charles is the destination for Lieutenant-Colonel Wetherall's forces to engage with the rebels.&lt;SEP&gt;St Charles is the location where the defeat of the rebels effectively ended the rebellion in the Richelieu area.&lt;SEP&gt;St Charles is a location where insurgents faced defeat, impacting the morale of the rebels at St Eustache.&lt;SEP&gt;St Charles is one of the places where rebels gathered during the planned insurrection.</data>
