    <node id="Vicksburg">
      <data key="d0">Vicksburg</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Vicksburg refers to a significant surrender that occurred during the Civil War on the same day as the battle of Gettysburg.&lt;SEP&gt;Vicksburg is a city where a significant event described in the text takes place.&lt;SEP&gt;Vicksburg is one of the places noted by the narrator where significant life experiences occurred.&lt;SEP&gt;Vicksburg is a city that Phelps defied, indicating a place of conflict or law.</data>
