    <node id="The Press">
      <data key="d0">The Press</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Press is a competing newspaper in St. Paul that published details of major Union victories during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;The Press is a publication from which Earle S. Goodrich made a request regarding typesetting.&lt;SEP&gt;The Press is the newspaper organization where Gallegher works and entertains the staff with his antics.&lt;SEP&gt;The Press is the newspaper that Mr. Dwyer represents, seeking exclusive information regarding the arrest of Hade.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d407b1da09abcacef35abc3b6c280f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4861f1f36dbc583ebdad31a4a80a0aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0</data>
