      <data key="d0">Other Day</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Other Day is an educated Indian who helped guide a group of refugees to safety during the outbreak.&lt;SEP&gt;Other Day is a Dakota Indian who experienced a change of heart, adopting civilized habits, and has been a member of the church for several years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54b8fd90d2cdfb38f2203aba48e470d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b84432ad1a7600b31aab3ee4243129</data>
