    <node id="Fort Ridgely">
      <data key="d0">Fort Ridgely</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Fort Ridgely is a military fort that was besieged by Sioux Indians during the Indian conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Fort Ridgely serves as a base from which Gen. Sibley organizes rescue efforts during the outbreak.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54b8fd90d2cdfb38f2203aba48e470d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49dd4de896cb4d1aa7c0c3db3861fcd1</data>
