    <node id="Gen. Sibley">
      <data key="d0">Gen. Sibley</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. Sibley is the commanding officer leading troops assembled at St. Peter to respond to the Indian outbreak.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Sibley is a commanding general who led troops in response to the situation involving Indians and made decisions regarding their surrender.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Sibley is a general who arrives at Fort Ridgely and commands relief operations for the wounded and deceased.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54b8fd90d2cdfb38f2203aba48e470d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7096033ca5d17f317a3de07c28f9b0bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49dd4de896cb4d1aa7c0c3db3861fcd1</data>
