    <node id="Mankato">
      <data key="d0">Mankato</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mankato is the location to which Judge Flandrau and the residents evacuated after the siege of New Ulm.&lt;SEP&gt;Mankato is a significant location mentioned where a strong guard was set during the legal proceedings against the condemned Indians.&lt;SEP&gt;Mankato is the city where the condemned prisoners were taken and confined in a newly constructed jail.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54b8fd90d2cdfb38f2203aba48e470d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7096033ca5d17f317a3de07c28f9b0bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68a152136647fcdc06015572bf449dc8</data>
