      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Company A of the Sixth Regiment is a military unit commanded by Capt. H.P. Grant, which responded to the siege at Fort Ridgely.&lt;SEP&gt;Company A of the Sixth Regiment is a unit that participates in burying the dead and seeking the wounded under Capt. H.P. Grant's command.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54b8fd90d2cdfb38f2203aba48e470d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49dd4de896cb4d1aa7c0c3db3861fcd1</data>
