      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cullen Guards is a military unit consisting of seventy members commanded by Capt. Jo Anderson.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cullen Guards is a military unit consisting of seventy members commanded by Capt. Jo Anderson during the outbreak.</data>
