      <data key="d0">Ingersoll Hall</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Ingersoll Hall is the venue where Other Day addressed a large audience for organizing a company of home guards.&lt;SEP&gt;Ingersoll Hall is the venue where the Ladies Aid Society held meetings to support wounded soldiers.</data>
