    <node id="Gov. Sibley">
      <data key="d0">Gov. Sibley</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gov. Sibley is the legal governor of Minnesota, involved in the issuance of bonds, and criticized by Dr. Foster for his lack of sincerity.&lt;SEP&gt;Gov. Sibley was the governor who dealt with the railroad companies regarding bond issuance after the passage of the Five Million Loan amendment.&lt;SEP&gt;Gov. Sibley is the governor who appealed for support to aid sick and wounded soldiers during the conflict.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-13efecfdb402b12d9a005785fb5d0e8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40ca577fc1aab8ffff670ab327655dda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d6821bdddaee230e47cab021a16e7da</data>
