      <data key="d0">Judge Flandrau</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Judge Flandrau is a dissenting judge whose opinions could have improved the state's financial reputation.&lt;SEP&gt;Judge Flandrau dissented from the majority opinion regarding the governor’s handling of the bond issuance.&lt;SEP&gt;Judge Flandrau is a commanding officer leading a gallant force during a historical outbreak event.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-13efecfdb402b12d9a005785fb5d0e8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49dd4de896cb4d1aa7c0c3db3861fcd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d6821bdddaee230e47cab021a16e7da</data>
