    <node id="Dr. Foster">
      <data key="d0">Dr. Foster</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dr. Foster was the editor of the Minnesotian known for his vigorous writing and involvement in the Republican party.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Foster is a critic of Gov. Sibley, believing he is insincere in protecting the interests of the state, and has a history of denouncing him.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Foster was the editor of the Minnesotian and involved in the rivalry with the Times.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Foster was associated with the Minnesotian and had to concede to the St. Paul Daily Press.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-13efecfdb402b12d9a005785fb5d0e8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a3ab772f4c7d1211b5007a6c92e23da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009fdf8cbf7983837bf283e7b7bb7b52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46289654522dd0ee1ffdeb77be06722d</data>
