      <data key="d2">John P. Owens was a partner of George W. Moore in the publication of the Minnesotian.&lt;SEP&gt;John P. Owens was the first editor of the Minnesotian and was also a printer.&lt;SEP&gt;John P. Owens is the first editor of the Minnesotian.</data>
