      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Bridge Square is a location in the city where events surrounding the news distribution took place.&lt;SEP&gt;Bridge Square is a location where the Wide Awakes met the Little Giants after a march.&lt;SEP&gt;Bridge Square is the site of a building that was remodeled into a hotel after a bank moved out.&lt;SEP&gt;Bridge Square is the original location from which the Press removed in 1869.</data>
