    <node id="Second Minnesota">
      <data key="d0">Second Minnesota</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Second Minnesota is a Union regiment that participated actively in the battle and faced heavy enemy fire.&lt;SEP&gt;The Second Minnesota is a regiment formed at the outbreak of the Civil War, noted for its active volunteerism and combat engagements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Second Minnesota is a regiment praised for its valor and participation in the Civil War.</data>
