      <data key="d0">Fort Snelling</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Fort Snelling is the location where Little Six and Medicine Bottle were tried and executed.&lt;SEP&gt;Fort Snelling is a military post where Capt. Shelly's company received reinforcements during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Fort Snelling served as the headquarters for the Second Minnesota regiment under Colonel H.P. Van Cleve.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68a152136647fcdc06015572bf449dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-501e774a64f7a58c082acf7597c0a211</data>
