      <data key="d0">Gen. W.T. Sherman</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. W.T. Sherman was in command of the Department of the Cumberland, overseeing the Second Minnesota regiment.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. W.T. Sherman was a friend of Gen. Grant who advised him against resigning his commission.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858</data>
