    <node id="Gen. Buell">
      <data key="d0">Gen. Buell</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. Buell is a Union general whose forces were aided by the actions of Capt. Shelly's company to avoid obstruction on the march.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Buell assumed command of all volunteers in the vicinity of Louisville and organized them into divisions and brigades.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Buell commanded the Army of the Cumberland and was noted for his delayed junction with Grant.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b435924602432e6d898c0d4eced2d0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-501e774a64f7a58c082acf7597c0a211&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02b249095455416ac52a060862c213f2</data>
