    <node id="Times">
      <data key="d0">Times</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Times is a newspaper that competed with the Minnesotian and published both genuine and bogus news following a significant event.&lt;SEP&gt;The Times is a newspaper that was also in competition with the Pioneer and Minnesotian to publish important news.&lt;SEP&gt;The Times is a Republican paper that contended with the Minnesotian for state printer patronage and accused each other of shortcomings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-253bf03f6503d8e5da2098445ef9b630&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009fdf8cbf7983837bf283e7b7bb7b52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49b770a2f437d2a1478f52b0f2747ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be8b49c919bf06f613da48187833e98b</data>
