    <node id="Pioneer Press">
      <data key="d0">Pioneer Press</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Pioneer Press is one of the leading newspapers in Minnesota that printed the proceedings of the Democratic convention during the 1857 election.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pioneer Press is a publication that reported on fire alarms and the activities of fire companies in St. Paul during the 19th century.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pioneer Press was a newspaper to which Louis E. Fisher contributed as an editor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pioneer Press is a newspaper with which Mr. Moore has been affiliated, known for its historical significance in the Northwest and its mergers over time.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pioneer Press is a newspaper with which Frank Moore has been associated for fifty years, celebrating his anniversary of connection with the paper.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-df4b788ffe5def54bf8b99b261eaf932&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76d1f3d2ebc06daa6cb0430b984dadc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14003429c48b9d2d45e7222249b39d12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05ddaddeaf94d2bcd3da95a9c4f85c42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4d3267de3b8b12b0a038535bf2353c</data>
