    <node id="George W. Moore">
      <data key="d0">George W. Moore</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">George W. Moore was associated with Dr. Foster in the publication of the Minnesotian prior to its consolidation.&lt;SEP&gt;George W. Moore served as collector of the port of St. Paul for over twenty years.&lt;SEP&gt;George W. Moore was a printer who became the collector of the port of St. Paul after publishing the Minnesotian.&lt;SEP&gt;George W. Moore is the brother of Frank Moore, who helped bring him to St. Paul and was one of the owners and managers of the Minnesotian.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-df4b788ffe5def54bf8b99b261eaf932&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a3ab772f4c7d1211b5007a6c92e23da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009fdf8cbf7983837bf283e7b7bb7b52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05ddaddeaf94d2bcd3da95a9c4f85c42</data>
