      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Abraham Lincoln was the president of the United States who was assassinated by Booth, deeply affecting the nation.&lt;SEP&gt;Abraham Lincoln was the President of the United States whose assassination deeply affected the nation and particularly St. Paul.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9cb7dc890f79266a4c27289acbd4e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-259cd15d2a822dcb52e2f16a8974a319</data>
