      <data key="d2">The Voyageur is a solitary traveler who encounters the paleface and dusky maiden while journeying to deliver a message of peace.&lt;SEP&gt;The Voyageur is a character who returns from a philanthropic visit and observes the changes in the landscape and society over the years.</data>
