    <node id="Sioux">
      <data key="d0">Sioux</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sioux are a Native American tribe involved in conflicts during a significant outbreak referenced in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sioux were Native Americans who sold their lands in Minnesota, leading to major conflicts and discontent during this period.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sioux are portrayed as hostile warriors attacking the command during their encampment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sioux are a Native American tribe involved in a conflict contributing to the historical context described in the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5b84432ad1a7600b31aab3ee4243129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40ca577fc1aab8ffff670ab327655dda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49dd4de896cb4d1aa7c0c3db3861fcd1</data>
