      <data key="d0">Max Irwin</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Max Irwin is a performer known for an innovative act during a performance, which became the talk of the town.&lt;SEP&gt;Max Irwin was a performer in the minstrel company at Irvine Hall known for his comedic acts.</data>
