      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dan Emmet was a minstrel and a brother of a chief justice, known for his musical contributions, especially the song "Dixie."&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Emmet had a minstrel company that performed at Irvine Hall during 1857-1858.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fec55d764089631728870dee42955975&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b75c5f4f7c0385a783e34fd555b4a0f</data>
