      <data key="d0">Hutchinson Family</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Hutchinson Family was a patriotic musical family known for their performances during the Civil War and their own compositions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hutchinson family was notably prominent in the past, especially in the context of concert performances and social causes like temperance.</data>
