      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Gen. Pope is the military officer in command of the department of the Northwest during the Indian war, who communicated with the war department.&lt;SEP&gt;Gen. Pope was a military leader involved in the Second Battle of Bull Run, claiming information about Gen. Porter.</data>
