      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cosmopolitan Hotel was a hotel that experienced a significant fire while fully booked with lodgers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cosmopolitan hotel was established by Bechtner &amp; Kottman after Mackubin &amp; Edgerton's bank moved out.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a3b2fb8cc8d028b5cd15ca31eb42884f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbf9f440f0bef7a0809b533af91c73a</data>
