      <data key="d0">Miss Rosa Larpenteur</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Miss Rosa Larpenteur represented Queen Victoria in the parade and is notable for being the first child born of white parents in St. Paul.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d26c30cc3102d9679f3880d6b7c95b61</data>
