    <node id="Pittsburg Landing">
      <data key="d0">Pittsburg Landing</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Pittsburg Landing is the location where Gen. Buell arrived to support Gen. Grant during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburg Landing is a notable location associated with a significant battle during the American Civil War, sometimes referred to as the Battle of Shiloh.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburg Landing was the site of a significant battle involving Gen. Grant and the Army of the Tennessee.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburg Landing is a site of a significant battle during the American Civil War where the First Minnesota Battery fought.&lt;SEP&gt;Pittsburg Landing is the location where the First Minnesota Battery arrived in late February 1862 and participated in battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-def2b4a56449fc02586417ac8569c46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078fa88c408ca99e058ba3c5129a1858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35fcfac76ba65831deb07fd3f5b55dac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0c0360f449394f658f3f74f407457c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-501e774a64f7a58c082acf7597c0a211</data>
