    <node id="Battle of Shiloh">
      <data key="d0">Battle of Shiloh</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Battle of Shiloh, also known as the Battle of Pittsburg Landing, was a major battle in the American Civil War involving intense combat between Union and Confederate forces.&lt;SEP&gt;The Battle of Shiloh was a significant battle in which Union forces, including Gen. Grant, were engaged.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-def2b4a56449fc02586417ac8569c46f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0c0360f449394f658f3f74f407457c</data>
