      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Union Forces were the military factions fighting for the North during the American Civil War, specifically involved in the Battle of Shiloh.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union Forces were engaged in battles during the civil war and faced significant losses due to various factors mentioned in the text.</data>
