      <data key="d2">The First Minnesota Battery demonstrated gallant actions during the Battle of Pittsburg Landing.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Minnesota Battery is a light artillery organization that participated in crucial battles during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Minnesota Battery is a light artillery unit that was organized during the American Civil War and engaged in significant battles.</data>
