    <node id="Kentucky">
      <data key="d0">Kentucky</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2440d11a9db0e7c5ec428e134dc47e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71098a84f862320370cd4b30b1083858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c11f042f8e301d4f16b51e506f72228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416151ab22ab2af93343eed774c95e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab396e5290a1af8b37332288d9ad1b47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e347c91e271c6caaede3cd9a43e87b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c437983d26451567a1e6bf0d1cd6f13e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6f58deafd0050a97f32d1b33594ea60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb9da5c2b7a4ec99cfef1dba35a808b</data>
      <data key="d2">Kentucky is a U.S. state located in the eastern south-central region of the United States. Throughout its history, Kentucky has experienced significant turmoil, including during the Civil War, when individuals like Morgan acted as Confederate marauders, which contributed to widespread destruction in the area. This period of conflict is part of the state's complex narrative, which also includes early struggles between white settlers and Native Americans.

In contemporary times, Kentucky demonstrates moderate growth in the establishment of farms, reflecting its agricultural significance. The state serves as a backdrop for various personal narratives, such as that of Tom Fairfield, who resides in Kentucky and engages in activities including planting and boating. Additionally, it is the setting where Don Carlo purchases a small farm, leading him to reflect on his bachelorhood and personal life.

The culture and society in Kentucky have also been characterized as refined and elegant, forming a notable aspect of its identity. Moreover, Kentucky has been referenced in literature as the presumed birthplace of characters, further embedding its significance in cultural narratives. The state is also noted as a destination for characters like Cousin Cæsar, who travels there to seek assistance, highlighting its role in broader stories and interactions.

Overall, Kentucky's rich history, cultural significance, and ongoing development make it a unique and essential state within the United States.&lt;SEP&gt;Kentucky is the state associated with Henry Boone Jallinger, indicating the family's origin.</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625225</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Europe">
      <data key="d0">Europe</data>
