      <data key="d0">Eurotas</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Eurotas is referenced as a river associated with the backdrop of Greek mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;Eurotas is a river mentioned in the text, symbolizing distance and separation in relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;Eurotas is the river that flowed past the walls of Sparta and is mentioned in association with Helen.</data>
