      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Metamorphoses is a narrative work that includes various mythological transformations, referenced in the context of the story of Cephalus and Procris.&lt;SEP&gt;Metamorphoses is a narrative poem by Ovid that details the transformation of figures from mythology and history.&lt;SEP&gt;The Metamorphoses is a narrative poem by Ovid that includes stories of various figures from mythology, including Atalanta.&lt;SEP&gt;The Metamorphoses is a narrative poem by Ovid, which includes stories and transformations of various characters.&lt;SEP&gt;Metamorphoses is a literary work by Ovid that discusses transformations and references various characters from mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;The Metamorphoses is a narrative poem by Ovid that includes various myths including transformations and legendary heroes.&lt;SEP&gt;Metamorphoses is a narrative poem by Ovid that details transformations and myths.</data>
