    <node id="Fasti">
      <data key="d0">Fasti</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Fasti is a work that includes references to notable customs and events from Roman history, specifically highlighted in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fasti is a historical work referenced for recounting events in Roman mythology and religious practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasti is a literary work referenced for its historical context regarding Roman customs and practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasti refers to a historical text that details the Roman calendar and significant events, including games.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasti is a poetic work that details Roman religious festivals and is referenced in connection with the procession and athletic events mentioned in mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasti is a work by Ovid that includes references to dates and religious observances in ancient Rome.</data>
