      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cybele is an ancient Mother Goddess associated with nature and fertility, often worshiped alongside Isis.&lt;SEP&gt;Cybele is mentioned as the wife of Jupiter, adding a familial connection in mythological narratives.</data>
