      <data key="d2">Inachus is another river in Greek mythology, similar to Acheloüs, associated with themes of love and mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;Inachus is mentioned as a river god said to have flowed pale with love for Melie, illustrating themes of love and longing.&lt;SEP&gt;Inachus is referenced as a river in Argolis, adding to the geographical landscape discussed in the text.</data>
