      <data key="d0">Andromeda</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Andromeda is a character referenced in the Metamorphoses, daughter of Cepheus, exposed to a sea monster.&lt;SEP&gt;Andromeda is a character in mythology who was rescued from a sea monster by Perseus.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a0dd004d7bb30cbae402f5f620fd614a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2ae1d708e454e0e6bf3e72d6ca49fad</data>
