      <data key="d0">Cepheus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cepheus is referenced as the father of a virgin daughter who was commanded to die for her mother.&lt;SEP&gt;Cepheus is a character mentioned in the context of Andromeda's story, known as her father.</data>
