      <data key="d0">Neptune</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Neptune is the god of the sea, saluted for his dominion over the waters despite the speaker’s preference for land.&lt;SEP&gt;Neptune is identified as the Roman god who rescued Amymone from an attack by a Satyr.&lt;SEP&gt;Neptune is the Roman god of the sea, often saluted during ceremonies, signifying importance in cultural and religious practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Neptune is a mythological figure said to have taken the form of a river and is associated with the fatherhood of Pelias and Neleus.</data>
