      <data key="d2">Danaë is referenced in the context of mythology, specifically as a mother of a child by Jove, indicating a connection to themes of desire and tragedy.&lt;SEP&gt;Danaë is referenced in the context of a hero possessing wings, relating to themes of longing and escape in mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;Danaë is a character referenced in the context of a story that alludes to the corrupting influence of money.&lt;SEP&gt;Danaë is a character who is alluded to in a narrative concerning a damsel.</data>
