      <data key="d2">Milanion is a character known for his longing to touch the ancles of Atalanta, symbolizing desire and admiration.&lt;SEP&gt;Milanion is often mentioned in connection with Atalanta, as he is the youth who was said to have loved her and defeated her in a race.</data>
