    <node id="Circus Maximus">
      <data key="d0">Circus Maximus</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Circus Maximus is an ancient Roman chariot racing stadium, serving as a setting for the described events, including races and gatherings.&lt;SEP&gt;Circus Maximus is an ancient Roman chariot racing stadium referenced in relation to the Circensian games.&lt;SEP&gt;Circus Maximus is an ancient Roman chariot racing stadium that hosted the Magni games and underwent restoration during Trajan's reign.&lt;SEP&gt;The Circus Maximus is an ancient Roman chariot racing stadium and mass entertainment venue, where events and processions took place.</data>
