    </node>
    <node id="Muses">
      <data key="d0">Muses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Muses are figures from mythology representing artistic inspiration and creativity, referenced in the context of poetic endeavor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Muses are invoked as the goddesses of inspiration in poetry and the arts, which Noah Carter serves.&lt;SEP&gt;The Muses are divine figures in Greek mythology that inspire creativity and the arts, referenced in relation to poetic expression.</data>
