    <node id="Cow">
      <data key="d0">Cow</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The white cow represents a symbol of beauty and allure, embodying themes of desire and envy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cow is characterized as large and unable to live inside the house, discussed in terms of companionship by Toto and the Raccoon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03db9ea051409884799c6fabae5a4d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-218b41b3055def40ede38f5d844e91d4</data>
