    <node id="Crow">
      <data key="d0">Crow</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The crow symbolizes envy and temptation, pecking at the cow, representing the challenges of fidelity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Crow is a character who expresses concern for his sick master and seeks help for him.&lt;SEP&gt;Crow is a faithful companion of the hermit who comes to assist in the moments of distress.&lt;SEP&gt;The Crow is mentioned as having been taught the game of backgammon by the Hermit but did not succeed in playing effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;The Crow is a character that is perched on Toto's shoulder, but no further details about its personality are provided.&lt;SEP&gt;The Crow is a bird that accompanies the Hermit, perched on his shoulder.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03db9ea051409884799c6fabae5a4d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a12948208c13074a50572b428e264d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89037da3a2e5920f7e8990667d3b252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01e6b02f461263b84f5b3f2aada29ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c686441b3937cff685f4451d4cd9685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51c0ae512a1dc43eac54573c59477cb0</data>
