    <node id="River">
      <data key="d0">River</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The river obstructs the character's passage to his mistress, symbolizing obstacles in love and desire.&lt;SEP&gt;The river is described as having a wide, savage sunlight reflecting on it, creating a painful brightness, and is part of the surrounding landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;The river serves as a geographic setting where various events and interactions happen.&lt;SEP&gt;The river is a central geographical feature influencing the group's escape and the movement of boats.</data>
