    <node id="Rome">
      <data key="d0">Rome</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Rome is mentioned as a significant city that symbolizes power and enduring legacy in the context of poetry.&lt;SEP&gt;Rome is referenced as the historical context for the characters and their relationships, particularly in terms of fidelity and beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;Rome is a historical city mentioned as a contrasting reference to Corcyra in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Rome is a city referenced as being safe and has historical significance, discussed by Wutzler in the context of fortification.&lt;SEP&gt;Rome is a historical city where Alexander Alexandrinus showcased his musical talent, creating a significant impact.</data>
