    <node id="Romulus">
      <data key="d0">Romulus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Romulus is not explicitly mentioned in the text but can be inferred as a historical figure related to the origins of Rome.&lt;SEP&gt;Romulus is a significant figure in Roman mythology, known for founding Rome and representing the themes of power and leadership.&lt;SEP&gt;Romulus is a mythical figure identified as the founder of Rome, referenced in texts concerning his mother Ilia.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03db9ea051409884799c6fabae5a4d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c781927a13f05b8bf3cc68dedd0ed839&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19630553a201da235d9c697d18820ca5</data>
