    <node id="Gods">
      <data key="d0">Gods</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Gods are invoked, representing a higher power in the context of desires and tribulations in life and love.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gods are referenced in relation to granting wishes and influencing love, representing divine powerful figures in mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gods are divine beings referenced as having influence over mortals and beauty, allowing deception among the fair.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gods are invoked in the speaker's lamentations regarding love and deceit, symbolizing divine oversight in matters of affection and morality.</data>
