      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Caesar is referred to as a recent figure with a temple, signifying his historical importance and role in leadership.&lt;SEP&gt;Caesar is mentioned as a notable figure in history whose exploits are compared to the speaker's own experiences and feelings regarding love.&lt;SEP&gt;Caesar is a historical figure referenced in the context of poetry and artistic expression.&lt;SEP&gt;Julius Caesar is noted for being assassinated and for a historical anecdote involving a 'stylus.'</data>
