    <node id="Pelops">
      <data key="d0">Pelops</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Pelops is a character in Greek mythology who is mentioned as a victor in a chariot race, linked to the themes of competition and love indicated by his relationship with Hippodamia.&lt;SEP&gt;Pelops is a legendary character known for his winning race against Onomaüs, where he bribed the charioteer Myrtilus.</data>
