    <node id="Delia">
      <data key="d0">Delia</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Delia is a character who expresses love and sorrow upon Tibullus's death, with whom she shares a romantic past.&lt;SEP&gt;Delia is referenced as a damsel celebrated by Tibullus, connected to themes of charm and beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;Delia is depicted as a former love of Tibullus, involved in themes of grief and mourning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1c9d540a7609b6ba4c69dd1651e5329e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29eddb27a800eedb331c3ac515bfc570&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4315ba5dfb6f6d19c3b64e08d29cdc1d</data>
