      <data key="d0">Eryx</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Eryx is a location mentioned in connection to a character who expresses grief.&lt;SEP&gt;Eryx refers to a mountain in Sicily, associated with the temple of Venus and alluded to in context of Tibullus's themes.</data>
