      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lais is mentioned as a beloved figure associated with many heroes, noted for her beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;Lais is a beloved figure referenced by many heroes, associated with themes of beauty and desire.&lt;SEP&gt;Lais is a name associated with two famous courtesans known for their beauty and high demands for their favors.</data>
