      <data key="d2">The Porter is a character described as holding a door shut, representing obstacles faced by the speaker in pursuing love.&lt;SEP&gt;Porter is addressed in the text and represents a figure who stands at the threshold, embodying the emotional conflict faced by the speaker.</data>
