      <data key="d1">time</data>
      <data key="d2">Night is depicted as a significant time for lovers, filled with silence and potential, yet also presents challenges for communication.&lt;SEP&gt;Night is depicted as a sinister time in the maze of alleys where various activities occur, reflecting a continuous cycle of life.&lt;SEP&gt;The night is the time setting of the escape, characterized by rain and sleet, influencing the atmosphere of Gallegher's adventure.</data>
