      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lucifer is referenced in the text as moving wheels beset with rime, suggesting a connection to light or morning.&lt;SEP&gt;Lucifer is referred to as the most brilliant figure in the lofty skies, symbolizing a figure associated with light and ambition.&lt;SEP&gt;Lucifer is mentioned as a celestial figure associated with guidance and speed in bringing forth desired outcomes in the context of longing.</data>
