      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cassandra is noted as having fallen in a temple, linked to themes of prophecy and misfortune.&lt;SEP&gt;Cassandra is a prophetess in Greek mythology, known for her curse of being disbelieved despite telling the truth.&lt;SEP&gt;Cassandra is alluded to as a prophetic figure in Greek mythology, known for being inspired by the prophetic spirit.</data>
