      <data key="d2">The Parian Mountains are mentioned in the context of marble and are the source of comparison for pale and bloodless features.&lt;SEP&gt;The Parian Mountains are referenced symbolically to compare the beauty and expression of a character's features.&lt;SEP&gt;Parian Mountains refer to the location famed for its marble, especially in relation to its extreme whiteness.</data>
