      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sun is referenced in the poem, representing celestial power and continuity in poetic imagery.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sun is a celestial body referenced in the story that the boys looked at.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sun is a celestial body whose nature intrigues Short-Tail Comet No. 73, who expresses a desire to learn more about it.</data>
