    <node id="Elegy">
      <data key="d0">Elegy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Elegy is a poetic form that the Poet considers for his work, representing themes of love and reflection on loss.&lt;SEP&gt;The Elegy referenced is a form of poetic expression that conveys sorrow and reflection, mentioned in the context of tablets and their qualities.&lt;SEP&gt;Elegy is a poetic form characterized by themes of mourning or loss, and is personified in Ovid's works.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d64ce64b0a51b17a08eb9a938fb755d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5208b8728c96888e457d542e0fba49b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc0c02df8cb82b091fb73a066662a32</data>
