    <node id="Chok Chung">
      <data key="d0">Chok Chung</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Chok Chung is a merchant involved in a lawsuit and is associated with the Christian faith, according to Heywood.&lt;SEP&gt;Chok Chung is described as a merchant facing legal consequences, characterized as plump and Christian.&lt;SEP&gt;Chok Chung is a Christian merchant whose trial has prompted concerns about riots and violence against foreigners.&lt;SEP&gt;Chok Chung is introduced as a Christian swimmer whose fate elicits panic and curiosity among onlookers.&lt;SEP&gt;Chok Chung is a character associated with a case that the magistrate avoided discussing due to its unpleasant nature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-409131abbfafd74396f07aa2c2df7b16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df25ca25a175761aaaa6532ccedf415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-941c4d13af541f7963a27e1494bf443b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e25d7dbcb1a555cabb7403e803731d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f96b34bd53c8d7d5209e1c87e5d7fe</data>
