    <node id="Rudolph">
      <data key="d0">Rudolph</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Rudolph is a complex character who navigates a range of emotional experiences and relationships throughout the narrative. He often exhibits deep emotions, reflecting on his interactions particularly with significant figures such as Mrs. Forrester, Miss Forrester, and Heywood. His exchanges often leave him feeling bewildered and confused, signaling his struggles to comprehend the situations he finds himself in during events like conversations, journeys, and chaotic encounters.

As a central character, Rudolph is portrayed as somewhat isolated and burdened, grappling with a sense of responsibility and the emotional weight of his experiences. His journey includes moments of introspection where he reflects on his feelings, often displaying a longing for comfort amid discomforting environments. He navigates through various scenarios, including encounters with bootblacks, discussions about philosophical beliefs, and interactions steeped in emotional intensity.

Rudolph's character development is marked by transformations that reflect confusion, guilt, and a longing for connection. He experiences significant emotional turmoil while trying to establish awareness of his surroundings and the people around him. His involvement in tense situations, such as conflicts and action sequences, juxtaposes moments of vulnerability with a display of determination and resolve.

Rudolph is depicted in a variety of situations that test his physical and emotional limits, such as his experiences near fire, during tumultuous events, and amidst feelings of fear and helplessness while on missions. His dynamic with others, including his friendship with Heywood, grows deeper through these challenges, revealing a complex bond characterized by shared experiences and support in dire circumstances.

Overall, Rudolph's narrative arc is rich with themes of isolation, emotional conflict, and the quest for understanding, leading to a layered portrayal of a character caught in the ebb and flow of personal trials and relationships, often reflecting on both past memories and future uncertainties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cc8fec9426618ca64578c6884dce2474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c3e181a56877f38400ce12e934ff548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409131abbfafd74396f07aa2c2df7b16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a49d7094c02854d26171d0a710baa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389101049259102fc576c6e995467682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfccb23dd43d27cfb79137b943a1e1f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df25ca25a175761aaaa6532ccedf415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feaab40fd1e6e5870b9322a9a5d595b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa2a11d0d00386af1ab3eca8d4d59492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac3dbacd92a1b10ced2bf57a2033bac4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f11361a750eadd8a4749bae2438fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1876f424b05897dac23b01553cb7070&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb115037ebf479e3fa9826264e2a73f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08520ccf9b52dbf3bddee7747c3f0808&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-202e89533c336da3f2eea8f8ae060d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f06afe6acd299e703bd0c0fadd159c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17752cd66181b87dbe6d4ea9fb2bff3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a3b55e49144523635ef63eec5d81eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-941c4d13af541f7963a27e1494bf443b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd506e2b4ab4403262e3cf611653609b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98178951b721b54d0b8775fe61e1ad7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a95861dd3ba9f9981eefca991e59eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d338a477bdce675ba495c45901f2f4f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f2c3ab9f6fe4aa540535b1858e6332&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95a4351613d57b076f8450fdf6a8558e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f8de23f34a0e649239c33f671c88fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfe3a458e44f6e2041ed190afdf2aa9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-433a9385de00773d19f337dec628ece3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cddefae4082fc01755e5d4102df7a0fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9daa3871f67ca2a76be04df2501cf1e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c2cc3543d4fe4e05c57903e7ad2413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-352ce84475cbb0fa86ecc70e31f802e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdb39b7084327904c70015ce550cbdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d49a7c7c613ebfca15907de30ca994f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ada7fef83d071fd0a8e9265ecd1549&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d03004a9213b673458ba0acafe4309f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd990ec3d60f1ee71ebfb13a84ee7393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f76d58d4ab3a913092d955df41ac90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2e10ee922efbc450e8141eaec0afb8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efad2dc71a14