    <node id="Ah Pat">
      <data key="d0">Ah Pat</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ah Pat is a compradore introduced by Heywood, described as a small, amiable Chinaman.&lt;SEP&gt;Ah Pat is a compradore who shows a calm demeanor while directing Rudolph regarding the location of two women.</data>
