    <node id="Captain Kneebone">
      <data key="d0">Captain Kneebone</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Captain Kneebone is a multifaceted character referenced in a narrative context, recognized for both his jovial and authoritative traits. He is introduced with a lively demeanor, recently returned to port after an extended absence. His exuberance is highlighted as he boasts about potential lottery winnings and speaks humorously, bringing with him a considerable supply of food and drink for a dinner event he hosts on his ship. During this dinner, he displays a jovial personality, sharing news of his wealth while also raising a glass, indicative of his celebratory spirit.

However, Captain Kneebone is not only characterized by his mirth but also by his leadership qualities and critical observations in more serious contexts. He assumes command during crises, displaying authority when signaling for a retreat and overseeing the preparation to depart, while also expressing annoyance with the group. His character reveals complexity as he balances authority with moments of vulnerability and stress, especially during tumultuous situations such as an attack on the river. Furthermore, he influences the sentiments of other characters, including Rudolph, by providing feedback on exploits, thus showcasing the impact of his observations and strategic thinking. 

Overall, Captain Kneebone embodies a dynamic blend of levity and command, making him a pivotal presence in the narrative, capable of navigating both joyous occasions and critical situations with a distinct personality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1c3e181a56877f38400ce12e934ff548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68888bb43a75a4c144e123dadcb3dd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b83639d85d5ff658efd25e868955e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa2a11d0d00386af1ab3eca8d4d59492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-202e89533c336da3f2eea8f8ae060d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f06afe6acd299e703bd0c0fadd159c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cddefae4082fc01755e5d4102df7a0fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c2cc3543d4fe4e05c57903e7ad2413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd990ec3d60f1ee71ebfb13a84ee7393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d909fd9c6be9d88c390751dd33c4cecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d3556fcfa716131536c6e47022294b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce0acb7c7df540cd62c4ae48d32a1de</data>
