    <node id="Club">
      <data key="d0">Club</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The club is a social venue where characters gather, filled with European attendees and serving as a backdrop for interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Club is a social setting where the characters play cards and interact with each other.&lt;SEP&gt;The Club is a place that Rudolph visits, characterized as hot and dimly lit, where characters engage in playing cards.</data>
