    <node id="Wutzler">
      <data key="d0">Wutzler</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wutzler is a multifaceted character who is depicted as being in a state of distress, anxiousness, and emotional turmoil. He is often portrayed as timorous and shrinking, surrounded by a group of rats, which symbolizes his vulnerable situation. His absence is noted as a cause for concern among other characters, highlighting his significance within the narrative.

Wutzler's character exhibits a blend of cultural traits and is marked by his hospitality towards Heywood and his companions. Despite his anxious disposition, he brings food and tries to create a welcoming environment. Wutzler often engages in incoherent speech and displays excitement about topics linked to Rome and history. His age and demeanor indicate that he is part of a card-playing group but is likely affected by alcohol, leading to bouts of incoherence.

Throughout the story, Wutzler's nervousness surfaces in response to uncertain situations, where he often likens his feelings to foreboding events. This tendency towards anxiety establishes him as an outcast within the Triad, a group he belongs to, and he serves as a crucial source of information regarding secret societies and his associated fears. His arguments hold considerable weight, influencing Heywood's decisions and actions, signifying his role as a pivotal character in the plot.

Wutzler also acts as a messenger, conveying important information to Heywood about military supplies, which underlines his importance in the storyline. Additionally, he assists Rudolph in various capacities, providing both physical support and emotional relief during tense moments. His actions include supplying brandy, guiding Rudolph away from danger, and diverting threat through the use of a firearm. 

Wutzler's character is multifaceted, characterized by his nervous energy, hospitality, and involvement in critical plot developments, while also participating in activities such as scavenging and adopting disguises, which further illustrate his adaptability and resourcefulness amidst challenges.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ed286dbd9b809c997105de9ceafc3e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feaab40fd1e6e5870b9322a9a5d595b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb115037ebf479e3fa9826264e2a73f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08520ccf9b52dbf3bddee7747c3f0808&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98178951b721b54d0b8775fe61e1ad7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95a4351613d57b076f8450fdf6a8558e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f8de23f34a0e649239c33f671c88fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cddefae4082fc01755e5d4102df7a0fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65d20f2fc345a27feee36101dbed8ea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc78f4a3c3f7c6ab435cf6a4fa08544e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8d52ee83d66c8a9b6a9d3fe6389a2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d909fd9c6be9d88c390751dd33c4cecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95655b5452af14c44b8141fca01f2f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55920e580ffbe8f30568a68484ac0df2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f96b34bd53c8d7d5209e1c87e5d7fe</data>
