    <node id="Beer">
      <data key="d0">Beer</data>
      <data key="d1">beverage</data>
      <data key="d2">Beer is another drink served alongside curry, contributing to Rudolph's meal experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Beer is an alcoholic drink made from grains, whose starch is converted into sugar for fermentation, similar to the processes described for wine and cider.&lt;SEP&gt;Beer is an alcoholic beverage made from malted barley, hops, yeast, and water.&lt;SEP&gt;Beer is a fermented alcoholic beverage made from barley, hops, and water, which also has a relatively low alcohol content.&lt;SEP&gt;Beer is an alcoholic beverage often mistakenly thought to enhance strength, but the fermentation process reduces its nutritional value.</data>
