    <node id="Sturgeon">
      <data key="d0">Sturgeon</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sturgeon is a character who displays enthusiasm upon hearing news about Mrs. Gilly's return, signifying excitement in the group.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Sturgeon is mentioned as someone who could assist a friend the following morning.&lt;SEP&gt;Sturgeon is a dejected character who waits with a long parcel, displaying a gloomy demeanor.&lt;SEP&gt;Sturgeon assists Rudolph by unwinding bandages and tending to his wound after the mishap during practice.&lt;SEP&gt;Sturgeon is another spectator to the duel, characterized by his shaking head in disapproval.&lt;SEP&gt;Sturgeon is part of the council and participates in the conversations regarding their housing and defense plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Sturgeon is described as a character telling long tales to other guests at the nunnery.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08520ccf9b52dbf3bddee7747c3f0808&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-202e89533c336da3f2eea8f8ae060d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a3b55e49144523635ef63eec5d81eb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce8decdd14fcac24539dbd5c797ec474&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9daa3871f67ca2a76be04df2501cf1e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d49a7c7c613ebfca15907de30ca994f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-056576ea60bd0b171586a0c122f845b3</data>
