    <node id="Tank">
      <data key="d0">Tank</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The tank is located on the roof and is filled using a force pump, utilized for washing machinery.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tank is a structure within the mill designed to store cider during the processing stages.</data>
