      <data key="d2">The grape bag is an invention to protect fruit and improve ripening, featuring a curved glass component.&lt;SEP&gt;The Grape Bag is a device designed to warm and protect grapes from scorching sunlight, utilizing a convex glass front and a layer of air for insulation.</data>
