      <data key="d0">Apple Jelly</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Apple jelly is mentioned regarding its manufacture in the context of agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;Apple jelly is a product manufactured from apples and is being produced in several factories located in Oswego County.</data>
