    <node id="Coal">
      <data key="d0">Coal</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Coal is a fuel used in traditional heating methods, the consumption of which is reduced by the described new method in steel manufacturing.&lt;SEP&gt;Coal is a type of fuel referenced in the context of engine operation costs, particularly its consumption rates and pricing.&lt;SEP&gt;Coal is a fossil fuel used as an energy source in the kiln, necessary for burning limestone to produce lime.&lt;SEP&gt;Coal is used by King Sligo in a plan to reveal the guilty party by staining the thief's hands black.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d66e0ae119d056e73d6977a3aa757057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8158e0db68586c52c3a94ca3b5a762c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ae48c64d3b36581a7e6806915748d3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f95c6e33fe89f14cf74854d84f63b54</data>
