      <data key="d0">Cotton Seed Oil</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Cotton seed oil is a vegetable oil that can be used to produce high-quality laundry soap.&lt;SEP&gt;Cotton seed oil is an alternative to olive oil, used in manufacturing products like lead plaster and liniments.</data>
