    <node id="Ohio">
      <data key="d0">Ohio</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Ohio is a state in the United States that is dependent on eastern supplies for agricultural limestone.&lt;SEP&gt;Ohio produces light gray colored sandstone from various towns.&lt;SEP&gt;Ohio is one of the States considered fully settled and has experienced significant agricultural growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Ohio is mentioned as the bank where old heroes wished to be buried, associated with the river's beauty and boatmen's songs.&lt;SEP&gt;Ohio is described as the birthplace of the narrator in the first scene of the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio is mentioned as a river bank where certain significant events occur during the narrative.</data>
