      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maidenhair Tree, known as _Gingkgo biloba_, is an ornamental deciduous tree with fan-shaped leaves and a history dating back to the coal period, now primarily found around temples in Japan and China.</data>
