      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Tempering by Compression is a metal treatment method involving heating, compressing, and cooling metals, particularly steel, to enhance their hardness and molecular structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Tempering by compression is a method of treating metals, particularly steel, to achieve hardness through heating and maintaining pressure until cooling.</data>
