    <node id="True Meridian">
      <data key="d0">True Meridian</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The True Meridian is the accurate line of longitude that is determined through observations, particularly involving celestial navigation.&lt;SEP&gt;The true meridian is a precise line of reference for observing celestial objects in relation to their transit.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eee9c14e4874d5edaebe46bb34bc7c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38361c9228288e8fce93f69ba0277336</data>
