      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Latitude is the measure of how far north or south a point is from the Equator and is essential for geographical and navigational purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Latitude is a geographic coordinate that specifies the north-south position of a point on the Earth's surface.&lt;SEP&gt;Latitude is the angular distance north or south of the equator, essential for astronomical observations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac7ddc2e019049a9912f840df02ad08a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1573d79bcfed29e4fb110ec5c56a26fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38361c9228288e8fce93f69ba0277336</data>
