    <node id="Don Carlo">
      <data key="d0">Don Carlo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Don Carlo is a proprietor of a wood yard and is characterized by his silent and contemplative nature, often concerned about his brother's status.&lt;SEP&gt;Don Carlo, known as the “Hero of Shirt-Tail Bend,” is a man whose apparently lifeless body is carried to the halfway castle.&lt;SEP&gt;Don Carlo is a character prepared to confront Brindle Bill in defense of his rights, characterized by bravery and resourcefulness.&lt;SEP&gt;Don Carlo is portrayed as a central character, who is recovering from an accident and desires to meet the lady who saved his life.&lt;SEP&gt;Don Carlo is a character who is infatuated and reflects on relationships and emotions.&lt;SEP&gt;Don Carlo is referred to as the hero of Shirt-Tail Bend, an ancestor of Cliff Carlo.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ddd4a502deaa5a3c805ab90de493f313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-029587962a0e769bf41beb4d2b181466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416151ab22ab2af93343eed774c95e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9652a353e171cb5644db94f8db65753c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e347c91e271c6caaede3cd9a43e87b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624319</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Suza Fairfield">
      <data key="d0">Suza Fairfield</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Suza Fairfield is an eleven-year-old girl who is perceived as potentially inheriting Aunt Katy's estate upon her death.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza Fairfield is an eleven-year-old orphan girl who escapes from captivity and travels toward Port William while sharing stories about her abusive captor, Aunt Katy.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza Fairfield is the foster child of Aunt Katy and the only person privy to Aunt Katy's financial secrets.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza Fairfield is characterized as the belle of Port William, notable for her beauty and relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza Fairfield is identified as the belle of Port William and is part of the family related to Cliff Carlo.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ddd4a502deaa5a3c805ab90de493f313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-308dc1f4e23e0e8a33feabd4ae43b18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80c6d1a10302d97782b2bc50d63133d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e347c91e271c6caaede3cd9a43e87b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624319</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Aunt Katy Demitt">
      <data key="d0">Aunt Katy Demitt</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Aunt Katy Demitt is the full name of the old woman who is superficially referred to as Aunt Katy, portrayed as Suza Fairfield's captor.&lt;SEP&gt;Aunt Katy Demitt is Suza Fairfield's guardian, who raised and educated her.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ddd4a502deaa5a3c805ab90de493f313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80c6d1a10302d97782b2bc50d63133d</data>
