      <data key="d0">General Holmes</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">General Holmes is mentioned as a military leader who unsuccessfully attempted to hold positions during battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b703ad46fc561ded805fade2af40be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ec4f8e1bbc32532d2dfcca778eb43e1</data>
