    <node id="The Southern Soldiers">
      <data key="d0">The Southern Soldiers</data>
      <data key="d1">group</data>
      <data key="d2">The Southern soldiers are described as weary and outnumbered, ultimately laying down their arms signaling the end of the war.</data>
