    <node id="President Lincoln">
      <data key="d0">President Lincoln</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">President Lincoln is noted for proclaiming freedom, impacting the status of slaves on the Simon plantations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b703ad46fc561ded805fade2af40be0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624321</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Simon Plantations">
      <data key="d0">Simon Plantations</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Simon Plantations is a location where Young Simon and Cousin Cæsar boarded the boat during their travel.&lt;SEP&gt;The Simon Plantations is a location mentioned in connection with cotton production and the estate being discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Simon plantations are identified as the property where slaves were affected by President Lincoln's proclamation of freedom.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b703ad46fc561ded805fade2af40be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c11f042f8e301d4f16b51e506f72228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-668c616fe700fcefe866c088d1613f74</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624321</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Governor Morock">
      <data key="d0">Governor Morock</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Governor Morock is a character who informs Roxie Daymon about a dire financial situation and offers questionable assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is a legal figure who advises Cousin Cæsar regarding Simon's will and estate.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is a character who has made decisions impacting Cousin Cæsar's case.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is a political figure who discusses legal strategies regarding the Simon estate with Roxie Daymon.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is depicted as a fashionable lawyer who interacts with Roxie regarding the arrangement of cotton and the deceased estate.&lt;SEP&gt;Governor Morock is portrayed as a figure who has fallen into disrepute, engaging in questionable work for low wages.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b703ad46fc561ded805fade2af40be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c11f042f8e301d4f16b51e506f72228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1788abe5b20f786a0ee4558b6fb02743&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789d217af2b17a7981ff4341de893334&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58817a44207e082297ea3faa165db2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624321</data>
