    <node id="Cliff Carlo">
      <data key="d0">Cliff Carlo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cliff Carlo is described as the oldest son and representative of a family, and is sought for help by Cousin Cæsar regarding the case.&lt;SEP&gt;Cliff Carlo is a character who communicates with Governor Morock about the value of the Simon estate and participates in the war effort in Kentucky.&lt;SEP&gt;Cliff Carlo is characterized as a prosperous farmer in Kentucky and a subscriber of THE ROUGH DIAMOND.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b703ad46fc561ded805fade2af40be0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c11f042f8e301d4f16b51e506f72228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b</data>
