    <node id="Roxie">
      <data key="d0">Roxie</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Roxie is the eldest daughter of Tom Fairfield who helped care for her siblings during their time of trouble.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie is Daymon's companion who reflects on her past and engages in a discussion about social status and family.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie is the eldest of the sisters and is characterized as capable of performing family duties; her journey to womanhood is highlighted.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie is a character who dies from cholera, leaving behind an only daughter and is disconnected from her sister's fate.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie is a character who is involved in a conversation about arranging testimony and shows contemplation of a deceased person's estate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08b9d6f937baa20d8292bac71db403dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c11f042f8e301d4f16b51e506f72228&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5978182ffc54131ad703e871e79dc392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab396e5290a1af8b37332288d9ad1b47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d6ba5697f9f6ac8decb2198a361839d</data>
