    <node id="Suza">
      <data key="d0">Suza</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Suza is the youngest daughter of Tom Fairfield, being cared for by her sisters during their difficult circumstances.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza is a baby who is being cared for by her sister Roxie and is affected by the cold conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Suza is the youngest sister described as a baby who captures Aunt Katy's affections and is to remain with her.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08b9d6f937baa20d8292bac71db403dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ac45ec6721641ae16ac8fcb28ed74f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab396e5290a1af8b37332288d9ad1b47</data>
