    <node id="Ohio River">
      <data key="d0">Ohio River</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ohio River is a prominent river mentioned as the location where Beargrass Creek flows into.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio River is a river bordering Kentucky and is mentioned as part of the state's geography.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio River is mentioned as the resting place for many victims of the steamboat disaster.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio River is a major river that Tom Fairfield moved to after facing difficulties in Kentucky.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio River is mentioned in the context of its banks from where the school furniture was made from driftwood.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ohio River is a river that Suza Fairfield sees upon nearing her destination, described as broad and beautiful.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08b9d6f937baa20d8292bac71db403dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80c6d1a10302d97782b2bc50d63133d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416151ab22ab2af93343eed774c95e2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de2fcc61f99e91491ef81fa40580ae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab396e5290a1af8b37332288d9ad1b47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9652a353e171cb5644db94f8db65753c</data>
