    <node id="Daymon">
      <data key="d0">Daymon</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Daymon is a laborer and boat hand known for his abusive behavior towards his wife, who has gone missing.&lt;SEP&gt;Daymon is a day laborer who worked in the infant city and experienced growth in wealth due to the development of Chicago.&lt;SEP&gt;Daymon is Roxie's husband, who resolved to reform despite facing hardships and is connected to a legal trial.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08b9d6f937baa20d8292bac71db403dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5978182ffc54131ad703e871e79dc392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de2fcc61f99e91491ef81fa40580ae4</data>
