    <node id="Roxie Fairfield">
      <data key="d0">Roxie Fairfield</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Roxie Fairfield is a child who is concerned for her baby sister, Suza, and ventures out into the cold weather to seek help.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Fairfield is identified as the heroine of the snowstorm and is significant in the context of her family's story and personal development.&lt;SEP&gt;Roxie Fairfield is another name for Roxie Daymon, mentioned in connection with her daughter and historical context.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-08b9d6f937baa20d8292bac71db403dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ac45ec6721641ae16ac8fcb28ed74f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58817a44207e082297ea3faa165db2bf</data>
