    <node id="Cherokee Indian">
      <data key="d0">Cherokee Indian</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cherokee Indian is a camp follower in the army of General McCulloch who assists Steve Brindle in treating Cousin Cæsar.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cherokee Indian assisted Cousin Cæsar by applying ashes to his wound during the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cherokee Indian is associated with Steve and is credited with saving Cæsar Simon's life at Springfield.</data>
