      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Federal Army refers to the military forces representing the Union during the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;The Federal Army is mentioned as the opposing military force during the battle involving Confederate troops.&lt;SEP&gt;The Federal Army represents the Union forces during the Civil War and is involved in conflicts against southern troops.</data>
