      <data key="d2">Helena is referenced as the location near where the narrator attends races.&lt;SEP&gt;Helena is a fortified point on the west bank of the Mississippi River, attacked by General Holmes.&lt;SEP&gt;Helena is the destination city mentioned by the burglar, where he intends to reunite with his family.</data>
