    <node id="Cousin Cæsar">
      <data key="d0">Cousin Cæsar</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cousin Cæsar is associated with Young Simon, knowledgeable about family matters and circumstances concerning Roxie Daymon's inheritance.&lt;SEP&gt;Cousin Cæsar is a relative of Simon, who has acted as his caretaker and is involved in managing Simon's estate.&lt;SEP&gt;Cousin Cæsar is a character who seeks assistance regarding a significant case and is involved in the events of the Civil War.&lt;SEP&gt;Cousin Cæsar is a soldier who was wounded and saved by Steve Brindle and the Cherokee Indian, reflecting on his past.&lt;SEP&gt;Cousin Cæsar is a soldier characterized by bravery on the battlefield and a desire for southern victory, despite his selfish disposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Cousin Cæsar is a military figure who reflects on issues of trust and betrayal during the Civil War, along with the challenges of leadership in battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ec4f8e1bbc32532d2dfcca778eb43e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-668c616fe700fcefe866c088d1613f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1788abe5b20f786a0ee4558b6fb02743&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db12a2e534724a0be9ade4aa8ff10a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789d217af2b17a7981ff4341de893334&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb007a78a7e771d39efbeb580b179f2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c11f042f8e301d4f16b51e506f72228</data>
