    <node id="Tom Ditamus">
      <data key="d0">Tom Ditamus</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tom Ditamus is depicted as a reluctant and unsatisfactory character, planning to return to his old home with his family.&lt;SEP&gt;Tom Ditamus is a thirty-five-year-old man who is involved with Suza's captivity and is depicted as being deceived by Suza's cunningness during her escape.&lt;SEP&gt;Tom Ditamus is characterized as someone who is indifferent about Suza's departure and focuses on his own financial interests.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-308dc1f4e23e0e8a33feabd4ae43b18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80c6d1a10302d97782b2bc50d63133d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e347c91e271c6caaede3cd9a43e87b2</data>
