      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cumberland Mountains are a geographic feature marking the border of Kentucky and a significant landmark in the region.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cumberland Mountains are referenced as Tom Ditamus's original home and the destination he intends to travel to.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-308dc1f4e23e0e8a33feabd4ae43b18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-416151ab22ab2af93343eed774c95e2c</data>
