    <node id="Cabin">
      <data key="d0">Cabin</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The cabin is located on the Mississippi shore and represents a sign of civilization in the area.&lt;SEP&gt;The cabin is a simple dwelling Tom built on a tract of land where he lived with his family amidst struggles with poverty.&lt;SEP&gt;The cabin serves as the setting for the confrontation between Don Carlo and Brindle Bill.&lt;SEP&gt;The cabin is where the Fairfield sisters are located, facing harsh weather conditions without their father.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51ac45ec6721641ae16ac8fcb28ed74f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f402c259d546a1b4619eed5b798473c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9652a353e171cb5644db94f8db65753c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c437983d26451567a1e6bf0d1cd6f13e</data>
