      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Snow is the weather condition impacting the characters, creating challenges for Roxie as she seeks help.&lt;SEP&gt;Snow is a form of precipitation that covers the ground and creates white conditions in the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Snow is mentioned as falling outside the cottage, contributing to the scene's atmosphere.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51ac45ec6721641ae16ac8fcb28ed74f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad738bff487d23177d83fb82c2acac31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3612e7c996c6ca62cbb14dfd7b5263</data>
