      <data key="d2">Jim is the son of Aunt Patsy's deceased brother and is depicted as a poor boy seeking help from his wealthy aunt.&lt;SEP&gt;Jim is a crow who is initially frightened by the hawk and reluctant to come out of hiding.</data>
