      <data key="d2">The Simon Estate is the subject of the legal contest that Cousin Cæsar and the Carlo family are involved in.&lt;SEP&gt;The Simon estate is a property subject to legal challenges during the war, particularly involving Roxie Daymon and Cæsar Simon.</data>
