    <node id="Dan Carlo">
      <data key="d0">Dan Carlo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dan Carlo is the second boy, described as the Prodigal, who is born to be a rake and grows up alongside Don.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Carlo is Don Carlo’s brother and business partner, described as a friend of Brindle Bill who struggles with financial responsibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Carlo is another name referenced for Don Carlo, indicating his role in the narrative.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-029587962a0e769bf41beb4d2b181466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9652a353e171cb5644db94f8db65753c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a9445e78fa0e5990fbfc82fd7af0897</data>
