      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Simon's wife is described as a woman of few words with a strong presence in the neighborhood, opposing Brindle Bill's influence.&lt;SEP&gt;Simon's wife is depicted as a calculating woman who foresees trouble and intervenes during the conflict.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-029587962a0e769bf41beb4d2b181466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9652a353e171cb5644db94f8db65753c</data>
