    </node>
    <node id="Alonzo Phelps">
      <data key="d0">Alonzo Phelps</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Alonzo Phelps is a character who was executed for murder, and his dead body becomes a central point of the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Alonzo Phelps was a man whose papers were involved in the confession related to the murder case and were discovered after his death.&lt;SEP&gt;Alonzo Phelps is referenced negatively as a brave man who defied authority and represented a defiant spirit.&lt;SEP&gt;Alonzo Phelps is mentioned as having concealed important papers that affected the Lasco family's fortune.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-029587962a0e769bf41beb4d2b181466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f402c259d546a1b4619eed5b798473c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de2fcc61f99e91491ef81fa40580ae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d6ba5697f9f6ac8decb2198a361839d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
