      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Half-Way Castle is a location mentioned as a place of deposit for the dead and dying.&lt;SEP&gt;The Half-Way Castle is described as a historical brick house on the Ohio River, significant for its associations with Don Carlo.</data>
