      <data key="d0">Thinking Part of the Brain</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">This part of the brain is responsible for conscious thought and requires rest to function optimally.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a2b65dd2ccf6640dc6d501c52589484</data>
