    <node id="Grape-Juice">
      <data key="d0">Grape-Juice</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">Grape-juice is a liquid extracted from grapes, which can undergo fermentation to make alcoholic beverages.&lt;SEP&gt;Grape-juice is the liquid extracted from grapes, which undergoes a transformation when left standing, potentially turning into alcoholic wine.</data>
