    <node id="Starch">
      <data key="d0">Starch</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Starch is a carbohydrate found in grains, which can be transformed into sugar during the process of fermentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Starch is a carbohydrate found in grains that can be transformed into sugar when plants begin to sprout.&lt;SEP&gt;Starch is a carbohydrate that must be converted into sugar before it can be utilized by the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Starch is a carbohydrate found in many foods that needs to be converted into sugar for absorption into the blood.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d170d1426917b3639e7243e4aade782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b83f16f525fc1670d5a9242f36cd37</data>
