    <node id="Five Senses">
      <data key="d0">Five Senses</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The five senses are sight, touch, taste, smell, and hearing, which are the primary means through which humans perceive the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Five Senses consist of touch, taste, sight, smell, and hearing, which are vital for perceiving the world.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e22299aaf0c9c5e28f9fc9822446874d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3</data>
