    <node id="Salt">
      <data key="d0">Salt</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Salt is a mineral needed by animals and humans for dietary purposes, often supplemented in food preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt is a mineral essential for various bodily functions and is commonly included in meals for flavor.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt is used in superstitions and rituals aimed at protecting individuals from evil spirits in various cultures.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt is found in lakes and is a resource that has been exported from Morocco to Timbuctoo.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-efb927db7ea2bc4669beaaff8354b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb3f38fdfb7168489cd1fb4adcb2515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8990e51d89971d42dec976410186259</data>
