    <node id="Teeth">
      <data key="d0">Teeth</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Teeth are organic structures in the mouth that serve different functions such as cutting and grinding food.&lt;SEP&gt;Teeth are structures in the mouth that play a crucial role in food processing and can be affected by substances like tobacco.</data>
