    <node id="Stomach">
      <data key="d0">Stomach</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The stomach is a muscular organ in the abdomen that processes and breaks down food.&lt;SEP&gt;The stomach is a muscular bag that prepares gastric juice for digestion and transforms food into a fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;The stomach is an organ that processes food and interacts with gastric juice for digestion.&lt;SEP&gt;The stomach is an organ that processes food by mixing it with gastric juice to facilitate digestion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-efb927db7ea2bc4669beaaff8354b755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339a04378219e12fdd299ea57c43f944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f4c8f69196485bd4b711834dcd13e48</data>
