    <node id="Gastric Juice">
      <data key="d0">Gastric Juice</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Gastric juice is a digestive liquid produced by the stomach lining to aid in food breakdown.&lt;SEP&gt;Gastric juice is a digestive fluid secreted in the stomach that aids in breaking down food.&lt;SEP&gt;Gastric juice is a digestive fluid secreted by the stomach to aid in breaking down food.</data>
