    <node id="Bones">
      <data key="d0">Bones</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Bones are structural elements of the body that change with age, becoming more brittle and requiring careful consideration in youth.&lt;SEP&gt;Bones are the structural components of the skeleton, with approximately two hundred in the human body of varying sizes.&lt;SEP&gt;Bones are the structural components of the skeletal system that provide support and protect vital organs in the body.</data>
