      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Foot care is discussed in relation to healthy footwear, emphasizing the importance of not wearing tight shoes that can cause discomfort and health issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5ca6e973ad64937ab7bcd5ec67b32e10</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624491</data>
