    <node id="Youth">
      <data key="d0">Youth</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Youth refers to young people who are at a crucial stage of development and are mentioned in relation to the effects of tobacco and other health considerations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5ca6e973ad64937ab7bcd5ec67b32e10</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624491</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Skin">
      <data key="d0">Skin</data>
      <data key="d1">organ</data>
      <data key="d2">The skin is the outer protective layer of the body, playing a crucial role in protection, sensation, and temperature regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The skin is an organ that functions in perspiration, waste removal, and protecting the body, playing a critical role in maintaining health.&lt;SEP&gt;The skin is the outer covering of the body that carries away waste matter and is involved in regulating temperature through perspiration.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-339a04378219e12fdd299ea57c43f944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1925755a5c65f004018f45749c7912</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624491</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Nails">
      <data key="d0">Nails</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Nails are protective coverings at the ends of fingers, serving as shields for sensitive areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Nails grow from the skin and serve as shields to protect the tips of fingers and toes.&lt;SEP&gt;Nails are referenced within the context of imported goods into Morocco.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1925755a5c65f004018f45749c7912&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d121b85033bc8ae8ffcb392dcbbcf78</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763626578</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Perspiration">
      <data key="d0">Perspiration</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Perspiration is the process of sweat excretion through the skin, crucial for waste removal and body temperature regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Perspiration is the process through which the body releases waste matter and water through tiny openings in the skin.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1925755a5c65f004018f45749c7912</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624491</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Waste Matter">
      <data key="d0">Waste Matter</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Waste matter refers to the byproducts expelled from the body, associated with perspiration and requiring regular removal for health.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624491</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Rubber Boots">
      <data key="d0">Rubber Boots</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Rubber boots are footwear that can cause discomfort by trapping perspiration, affecting foot health indoors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-306d5de2eae0665c92137b63fb6d96d3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624491</data>
