    <node id="Barley">
      <data key="d0">Barley</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Barley is a type of grain that is processed by brewers to convert its starch into sugar and is used to produce beer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624492</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Malt">
      <data key="d0">Malt</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Malt is sprouted grain, specifically barley, that has undergone a process to convert starch into sugar, used in beer production.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624492</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Brewer">
      <data key="d0">Brewer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A brewer is an individual who produces beer by transforming barley and its starch into sugar and then into alcohol.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624492</data>
