    <node id="Hops">
      <data key="d0">Hops</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Hops are flowers used in brewing to provide flavor, bitterness, and aroma to beer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624492</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Brandy">
      <data key="d0">Brandy</data>
      <data key="d1">product</data>
      <data key="d2">Brandy is a strong alcoholic drink produced by distilling wine and usually contains a higher concentration of alcohol.&lt;SEP&gt;Brandy is a type of distilled alcoholic beverage made from fermented fruit juice, typically grapes, and contains a high alcohol content.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c99f53308a3eca211c2bfef8bf90</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624492</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Rum">
      <data key="d0">Rum</data>
      <data key="d1">product</data>
      <data key="d2">Rum is a distilled alcoholic beverage made from sugarcane byproducts, such as molasses or sugarcane juice.&lt;SEP&gt;Rum is a distilled alcoholic beverage made from sugarcane byproducts and is known for its high alcohol content.&lt;SEP&gt;Rum is a distilled liquor containing a high percentage of alcohol, traditionally provided to sailors for morale but ultimately found not to enhance strength.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38509fbb14988b3d2417deb93ee40233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c99f53308a3eca211c2bfef8bf90</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763624492</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Whiskey">
      <data key="d0">Whiskey</data>
      <data key="d1">product</data>
      <data key="d2">Whiskey is a distilled alcoholic beverage made from fermented grain mash, including barley, corn, rye, and wheat.&lt;SEP&gt;Whiskey is a distilled alcoholic beverage made from fermented grain mash and has a significant alcohol content.&lt;SEP&gt;Whiskey is found in the text and is described as wretched, yet it is a source of amusement for Rags as he reflects on the police's failure to notice it.&lt;SEP&gt;Whiskey is used by Rags to moisten the food he prepares for the baby, although it is not suitable for infants.&lt;SEP&gt;Whiskey is a drink offered by Cissy to Masterton to help him feel better after his injury.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c99f53308a3eca211c2bfef8bf90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-148090a281e6ca8aa50cefa760874cb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a2a2485bcb7c681b0e3c67f960ece4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8125a827c1ae26a6b606adacd1ab3c01</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625236</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Gin">
      <data key="d0">Gin</data>
      <data key="d1">product</data>
      <data key="d2">Gin is a distilled alcoholic beverage that derives its primary flavor from juniper berries and is produced from various grains.&lt;SEP&gt;Gin is a distilled alcoholic beverage flavored with juniper berries and other botanicals and has a high alcohol concentration.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c99f53308a3eca211c2bfef8bf90</data>
