    <node id="Distilling">
      <data key="d0">Distilling</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Distilling is the process of purifying a liquid by heating it to create vapor and then cooling it to collect the liquid, commonly used to produce alcoholic beverages.&lt;SEP&gt;Distilling is a method used to separate alcohol from beverages by heating to create vapor and then collecting the condensed liquid.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31526a8f34a79f3f95e4cc8ce251e822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c622c99f53308a3eca211c2bfef8bf90</data>
