      <data key="d0">Dry Cracker</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">A dry cracker, primarily made of starch, demonstrates how saliva can convert starch into sugar as it is chewed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6</data>
