    <node id="Blood">
      <data key="d0">Blood</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Blood is a bodily fluid that transports nutrients from digested food to various parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood is a vital fluid that carries nutrients and oxygen to the body and removes waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood is a vital fluid in the body responsible for transporting nutrients and oxygen to cells and removing waste products.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood is a vital fluid mentioned concerning its role in warming the body and its flow rate in children versus older individuals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c40e9d9d6bed631bcdf0022bea513804&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec816dcf44e2fe3a4afba7c6692bba3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1925755a5c65f004018f45749c7912</data>
