    <node id="Muscle">
      <data key="d0">Muscle</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Muscles are tissues in the body that enable movement by contracting and relaxing to operate joints.&lt;SEP&gt;Muscle tissue in the body is built and maintained through the nutrients provided by food.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20452cd28a7a0227706cdf094ea3c581</data>
