    <node id="Milk">
      <data key="d0">Milk</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Milk is described as the best kind of food that can contribute to the formation of muscle, fat, and bones.&lt;SEP&gt;Milk is a nutrient-rich liquid food produced by mammals, often included in diets for its nutritional benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Milk is identified as a preferred nourishment for babies, which Rags seeks but is unable to provide.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b83f16f525fc1670d5a9242f36cd37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-148090a281e6ca8aa50cefa760874cb8</data>
