    <node id="Fat">
      <data key="d0">Fat</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Fat is essential for keeping the body warm and comfortable, derived from specific fat-making foods.&lt;SEP&gt;Fat is a macronutrient that provides energy and supports various bodily functions, included in meals for heat and nourishment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-476f39fcc8c0c7619821c2b1143970d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67b83f16f525fc1670d5a9242f36cd37</data>
