    <node id="Greely Party">
      <data key="d0">Greely Party</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Greely Party refers to a group of Arctic explorers who experienced starvation and extreme cold while trapped in ice.&lt;SEP&gt;The Greely party consisted of twenty-six men who were stranded in the Arctic seas, suffering from starvation and extreme cold.</data>
