    <node id="Lungs">
      <data key="d0">Lungs</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The lungs are essential organs in the chest that facilitate breathing by exchanging oxygen and carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;The lungs are organs that allow the exchange of oxygen and carbon dioxide while breathing.&lt;SEP&gt;The lungs are vital organs responsible for breathing, continuously working both day and night to purify the blood and provide oxygen to the body.</data>
