    <node id="Chest">
      <data key="d0">Chest</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The chest is a part of the body that houses vital organs, including the heart and lungs, protected by rib bones.&lt;SEP&gt;The chest is a part of the human body that houses vital organs such as the heart and lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;The chest is the part of the body where the heart and lungs are located, protected by the ribs and other bones.</data>
