      <data key="d2">Standish is Ted's brother, who unexpectedly arrives at the restaurant, causing panic for Ted and the girl.&lt;SEP&gt;Standish is a character who is concerned about the marriage of his brother and Mrs. Standish and takes action to ensure their wedding is properly arranged.&lt;SEP&gt;Standish is mentioned as having an older brother who is racing around Chicago, used in a comparison by Van Bibber.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-510759579f956294cdeeaa5d655b240a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdabf392a8dc10b75e57591c9eaef5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce275f5f1e049ce82f2c5c025f7d225</data>
