    <node id="Hefflefinger">
      <data key="d0">Hefflefinger</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hefflefinger is a character who has been sent for by Gallegher to assist in the arrest of a criminal.&lt;SEP&gt;Hefflefinger is a character who considers a proposal and agrees unconditionally, indicating cooperation in a plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Hefflefinger is a character who initially shows a willingness to intervene in the fight but is held back by Gallegher.&lt;SEP&gt;Hefflefinger is a detective involved in the arrest plan for Hade, responding to Mr. Dwyer's proposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Hefflefinger is presented as a character who attempts to escape and negotiate with the detective amid the turmoil.&lt;SEP&gt;Hefflefinger is a character involved in the arrest and capture of Arlie Lane, showing a sense of duty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e245282ab23d3c2de534d9a0d931dd59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdb1784d5abfa2c6e504b83145f474b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb89e395db2f7954657670627549f945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a32ef2ecc49d1b8a9ea8225e7531152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fe4a7525b3a2c7a921bd4c70b6ec23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0</data>
