      <data key="d0">Mr. Dwyer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Dwyer is the sporting editor who communicates the urgency of capturing the criminal Hade and offers a monetary reward for a discreet arrest.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Dwyer is a character involved in a plan concerning a detective and a fight, noted for his thoroughbred sport.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Dwyer is a character who is anxious about the timing of a fight and the potential of police action.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Dwyer is a correspondent caught in the arrest situation, trying to argue for his freedom and that of the other correspondents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e245282ab23d3c2de534d9a0d931dd59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdb1784d5abfa2c6e504b83145f474b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb89e395db2f7954657670627549f945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0</data>
