    <node id="Keppler">
      <data key="d0">Keppler</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Keppler is a character who expresses disgust toward Mr. Carleton and provides information about him to Gallegher.&lt;SEP&gt;Keppler is identified as Gallegher's occasional playmate, who provides insider knowledge about the cock-fight.&lt;SEP&gt;Keppler is a character who welcomes Mr. Dwyer warmly and oversees the entrance to a venue for a fight.&lt;SEP&gt;Keppler is mentioned as Gallegher's father, who is being arrested.&lt;SEP&gt;Keppler is Gallegher's father, who is in police custody and is being taken away by the officers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e245282ab23d3c2de534d9a0d931dd59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdb1784d5abfa2c6e504b83145f474b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fe4a7525b3a2c7a921bd4c70b6ec23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6133dbc706b714aa574e1c7d296379a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0e16494586d22295a6c919157d0e2d6</data>
