      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Detective is involved in the operation, relying on cooperation from other characters to fulfill a task.&lt;SEP&gt;The Detective is a law enforcement officer pursuing the apprehension of Hade, employing authority and negotiation tactics during the arrest.</data>
