    <node id="Fight">
      <data key="d0">Fight</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Fight is a boxing match that serves as a plot point regarding Mr. Carleton's fear and Gallegher's investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;The fight is an event during which Hade is expected to be among the spectators and is the planned location for his covert arrest.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fight is the central event that the characters are preparing for, implying a gathering of spectators.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fight is an intense and chaotic conflict involving two men, noted as being one of the most brutal in the country.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e245282ab23d3c2de534d9a0d931dd59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a32ef2ecc49d1b8a9ea8225e7531152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fe4a7525b3a2c7a921bd4c70b6ec23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0</data>
