    <node id="Hade">
      <data key="d0">Hade</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Hade is the suspected murderer whom Gallegher intends to have arrested by Hefflefinger.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is referenced as a murderer, whose likeness is noted in the stranger Gallegher observes.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is a noted criminal known as the Burrbank murderer, who is the target of the arrest plan during a fight.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is a character present in the crowd, visibly anxious and hiding his face under a cap, fearing danger.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is depicted as a desperate individual during a chaotic scene who appeals to the detective to let him go.&lt;SEP&gt;Hade is mentioned as a character whose courage might falter, affecting the plan concerning the fight.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e245282ab23d3c2de534d9a0d931dd59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb89e395db2f7954657670627549f945&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a32ef2ecc49d1b8a9ea8225e7531152&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fe4a7525b3a2c7a921bd4c70b6ec23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81bf1c32ffdd709a383d099e353fcd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0e16494586d22295a6c919157d0e2d6</data>
