    <node id="Raegen">
      <data key="d0">Raegen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Raegen is a character who experiences intense emotions and has a profound encounter with a baby, leading to a moment of reflection and connection.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is a character being pursued by law enforcement and is desperate to find refuge from capture.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is a young giant who mocks another character and comments on the situation regarding the baby's parents being imprisoned.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is a character who experiences a mix of pride, self-importance, remorse, and responsibility while dealing with the aftermath of an incident involving McGonegal.&lt;SEP&gt;Raegen is a character who has a sense of bravado and a connection to a child, expressing defiance and complexity in his decisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74d8118154ac2504a29e5978404009a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61dde207aadfc85a27cb8a00cafa88c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b764a3bbaaf870d7b877a3d4dd4fea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a2a2485bcb7c681b0e3c67f960ece4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7617cb6098946fe96b78f351798eb36</data>
