    <node id="Rags">
      <data key="d0">Rags</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Rags is a character trying to evade capture while reflecting on his past experiences and current predicament in a dark building.&lt;SEP&gt;Rags is a character who interacts with the baby Marg'ret and displays a feeling of inadequacy and compassion during their encounter.&lt;SEP&gt;Rags is a character who feels guilty and anxious about the baby's needs while trying to care for her in a difficult situation.&lt;SEP&gt;Rags is a character who cares for a baby in a deserted tenement, experiencing fear and uncertainty for her well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;Rags is another name for Raegen, who battles feelings of guilt and concern for the baby while contemplating his situation after the incident.&lt;SEP&gt;Rags is the name of the young man with a white, haggard face who brings the sick baby to the station-house and displays a desperate demeanor.&lt;SEP&gt;Rags is a character who shows care for a child and has a complex emotional response to her situation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74d8118154ac2504a29e5978404009a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61dde207aadfc85a27cb8a00cafa88c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76e55fc95e998e6380cab5e4a733a154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-148090a281e6ca8aa50cefa760874cb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b764a3bbaaf870d7b877a3d4dd4fea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a2a2485bcb7c681b0e3c67f960ece4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7617cb6098946fe96b78f351798eb36</data>
