    <node id="Siren">
      <data key="d0">Siren</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Siren is a horse owned by Lord Norton, significant in the context of gambling and races that Young Harringford supports.&lt;SEP&gt;Siren is a racehorse that wins a race, noted for her beauty and athletic capability.</data>
