      <data key="d0">Young Harringford</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Young Harringford is a character who grapples with the consequences of his gambling and lost fortune and is described as the eldest son of the Harringfords of Surrey.&lt;SEP&gt;Young Harringford experiences a sense of elation when he is recognized for winning at the races.</data>
