    <node id="Cecil">
      <data key="d0">Cecil</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cecil is a character who receives commendation for his success and is seen discussing his winnings with his peers.&lt;SEP&gt;Cecil is the first-born son of the writer who is being addressed in a heartfelt letter, conveying the father's deep feelings and regrets.&lt;SEP&gt;Cecil is an old man who speaks with grave politeness to the young Frenchman, attempting to convince him to consider the consequences of his gambling.&lt;SEP&gt;Cecil is a character who expresses a desire to take his servant home and feels a sense of peace after a moment of turmoil.</data>
