    <node id="Henry Burgoyne">
      <data key="d0">Henry Burgoyne</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Henry Burgoyne is recognized as Judge Burgoyne, known for his friendship with Lewis L. Lockwood during their childhood.&lt;SEP&gt;Henry Burgoyne is referred to as Judge Burgoyne and has a close friendship with Mr. Lockwood, rooted in their shared past.&lt;SEP&gt;Henry Burgoyne is Mr. Lockwood's old friend with whom he shared a significant bond in the past.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-df3ab379d978e8868fa159875d29e651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b88ca63b45e5694f82ee06a9a84cf2b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c3a3ec136285934c71e2ff0108d5976</data>
