    <node id="Mr. Lockwood">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Lockwood</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Lockwood is a character who has a long-standing friendship with Henry Burgoyne and is depicted as having shared experiences with him.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Lockwood is a character who visits to thank Miss Catherwaight for the return of a medal and has a history of misunderstanding with her mother.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Lockwood is a lawyer who reflects on his past friendship and carries an emotional burden regarding his relationships.</data>
