      <data key="d2">Miss Catherwaight is a socially prominent character who is described as clever but cynical and has a collection of honors.&lt;SEP&gt;Miss Catherwaight is a character who collects items and seeks information regarding a silver medal she found.&lt;SEP&gt;Miss Catherwaight is a collector of medals with complex stories, known for her unique hobby of gathering dishonored honors.&lt;SEP&gt;Miss Catherwaight is a character who interacts with young Latimer and expresses curiosity about a woman connected to Mr. Lockwood and Henry Burgoyne.&lt;SEP&gt;Miss Catherwaight is a character who is concerned about a past misunderstanding between her mother and Mr. Lockwood and feels troubled by the situation.&lt;SEP&gt;Miss Catherwaight is portrayed as a cynical young woman who plays a role in reconnecting old friends and reflects on her mother's influence.</data>
