      <data key="d0">Monte Carlo</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Monte Carlo is the place where Young Harringford, known as the "Goodwood Plunger," visits with a different mindset.&lt;SEP&gt;Monte Carlo is a city known for its casinos and gambling activities, referenced as a location where a character is metaphorically waiting for the lights to go out.&lt;SEP&gt;Monte Carlo is the location where the Goodwood Plunger is situated, characterized by its gambling tables and social scene.&lt;SEP&gt;Monte Carlo is the location where Harringford plans to resolve his financial issues and is associated with his past experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;Monte Carlo is the setting of the story, known for its gambling and luxurious atmosphere.</data>
