    <node id="Latimer">
      <data key="d0">Latimer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Latimer is a young man who has a respectful relationship with the Bishop, visiting him frequently to discuss personal matters.&lt;SEP&gt;Latimer is a young man who has a conversation with the Bishop regarding his past and his intentions towards Ellen, the Bishop's daughter.&lt;SEP&gt;Latimer is a young man engaged in a conversation regarding his potential marriage to Ellen and reflects on hypothetical life situations.&lt;SEP&gt;Latimer is a suitor who expresses his feelings of love towards Ellen and faces a challenging conversation regarding their relationship with her father, the bishop.&lt;SEP&gt;Latimer is a character who expresses defiance and addresses his struggles and sacrifices regarding a past temptation during a conversation with others.</data>
