      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ellen is the Bishop's daughter, whose future happiness and potential marriage are the subjects of concern for her father.&lt;SEP&gt;Ellen is the daughter of the bishop and the woman whom Latimer is considering marrying.&lt;SEP&gt;Ellen is the daughter of the bishop who experiences emotional turmoil regarding her relationship with Latimer and is conflicted about her feelings.&lt;SEP&gt;Ellen is a woman being addressed by Latimer, who represents a contrasting viewpoint regarding love and relationships.</data>
