      <data key="d2">The Catholic Convent School is an educational institution mentioned as the place where Flo is to be enrolled.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d549e03c2c739d89ecf816cae677d05</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625201</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="San Francisco">
      <data key="d0">San Francisco</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">San Francisco is the city to which Edward Brice travels after his adventure and the place where his successful reporting occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;San Francisco is mentioned as a location relevant to Mrs. Tarbox’s decision regarding Flo's schooling.&lt;SEP&gt;San Francisco is where Montagu Trixit is currently away attending to business.&lt;SEP&gt;San Francisco is the city Bray plans to visit in relation to his connection with Eugenia and the note.&lt;SEP&gt;San Francisco is mentioned as the location of Mr. Bilson's upcoming marriage.&lt;SEP&gt;San Francisco is the city where Mr. Calton intends to seek medical care.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d549e03c2c739d89ecf816cae677d05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6e9a94b0aa47b1329998e9479c1189b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343469de09660053c0e80621f41c713b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cecaf8705a36ced04ac0a85e9fbe1431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62f7c229133b785c33c0752beee30042&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a3a55a4716fe7da650a25825cbe8a5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
