      <data key="d0">Timber Lands</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Timber lands refer to plots of land used for timber production and are mentioned in the context of Mr. Tarbox's business dealings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d549e03c2c739d89ecf816cae677d05</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
