    <node id="The Handkerchief">
      <data key="d0">The Handkerchief</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Handkerchief is a personal item that Brice gave to Flo, which is later returned to him, symbolizing her remembrance of him.&lt;SEP&gt;The handkerchief is an item mentioned as being sent by Mr. Tarbox to Brice, symbolizing a connection and communication.&lt;SEP&gt;The Handkerchief is a silk bandanna used by Bray to secure himself and Eugenia together for safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d549e03c2c739d89ecf816cae677d05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed354bb280cbffcac2022b4b1028429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c2f9673888c529900ab3645a73c1a5</data>
