    <node id="Faulkner">
      <data key="d0">Faulkner</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Faulkner is John Fleming's partner in the mining business and interacts with a woman looking for John.&lt;SEP&gt;Faulkner is Fleming's partner who conveys a theory about the letter Fleming received, involving his personal life.&lt;SEP&gt;Faulkner is a character who comments on Jack's engagement and the circumstances surrounding it.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c87d89cd1180b8d6a006229057edd6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-465f5ac022d97e69f2dc45fc7598aa7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb9da5c2b7a4ec99cfef1dba35a808b</data>
