    <node id="Chris">
      <data key="d0">Chris</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Chris is a character who speaks positively about Frida's character and expresses admiration for her.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is Mr. Calton's brother who is engaged to Frida Jansen and is characterized as charming but easily influenced.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is a young man seeking Miss Trotter's help regarding his relationship with Frida and expresses emotional vulnerability.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is a young man engaged in a conversation about Frida, displaying nervous agitation and later a calm demeanor.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is a man who experienced disappointment due to Miss Jansen's rejection and has a complicated relationship with Miss Trotter and Mr. Bilson.&lt;SEP&gt;Chris is Mr. Calton's brother who is experiencing a change in demeanor and health, prompting concern from others.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-369a75ce4a9aaf2cf4882dd927c2352f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343469de09660053c0e80621f41c713b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2949837deae0d2af6b85bc72ecfa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7d20169574265502212f8d8141c5d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed17775cbe8d000774a8baf77b6324bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ef285556657679cada764bf06d06980</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625204</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Frida">
      <data key="d0">Frida</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Frida is the girl engaged to Chris, described as a servant, and is largely the subject of the conflict between the brothers.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida is a young woman of interest in a romantic situation who is described as high-spirited and attractive.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida is a young girl characterized by her smart pink calico gown and long yellow braids, evoking attention from others.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida is a woman associated with Chris and mentioned in relation to his feelings toward Miss Trotter and Mr. Bilson.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida is mentioned as a girl whom Mr. Bilson pretended to be in love with, but he admits he did not truly care for her.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-369a75ce4a9aaf2cf4882dd927c2352f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343469de09660053c0e80621f41c713b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34009f4313fe490d580935f9ef87ff52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ef285556657679cada764bf06d06980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d18b6fa9a2e2b728d65fdd7990b785f6</data>
