      <data key="d0">Poor Chris</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Poor Chris is a character who experiences disappointment and discomfiture due to his feelings for Miss Trotter and the rejection by Frida.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-369a75ce4a9aaf2cf4882dd927c2352f</data>
