    <node id="Montagu Trixit">
      <data key="d0">Montagu Trixit</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Montagu Trixit is referred to as a prominent figure in finance, known for his successful speculations in the money market.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is Cissy Trixit's father, implicated in a financial scandal involving a bank defalcation and subsequently absconded.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is a disgraced banker involved in a scandal concerning defalcations and securities.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is the individual being sought after by law enforcement, indicating potential criminal activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Montagu Trixit is a character described as keen-faced and resolute, who expresses concern for Masterton and has a steady demeanor regarding family matters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a6e9a94b0aa47b1329998e9479c1189b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1374a82b81b5bf5cc42271a4aaa04ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad738bff487d23177d83fb82c2acac31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528da169951df090df4de0824ef7109b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d33f750152b448ae4f9c436cea1e2ac</data>
