    </node>
    <node id="Mr. Windibrook">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Windibrook</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Windibrook is a character who exhibits heartiness and engages in conversation about Montagu Trixit’s financial success.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Windibrook is a reverend gentleman who attempts to persuade Cissy to leave her home and discusses her father's alleged wrongdoings.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Windibrook is portrayed as a socially aware character who interacts with Cissy and reflects on various social issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a6e9a94b0aa47b1329998e9479c1189b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fed08294c7c286ca4d4684d894e58fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e5a1f05827b42a336baccdd4933d843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4445c33b34de7a646c3ea3917fa7ec89</data>
