      <data key="d0">Mrs. Windibrook</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mrs. Windibrook is a character who converses with Cissy and shares her perspective on social matters, particularly regarding her husband and their life.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Windibrook is a character who recounts a story about her children and reflects on social interactions and appearances.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. Windibrook is mentioned as a person who wishes to invite Cissy to stay with her during uncertain times.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a6e9a94b0aa47b1329998e9479c1189b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fed08294c7c286ca4d4684d894e58fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e5a1f05827b42a336baccdd4933d843</data>
