      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Excelsior Bank is the financial institution associated with Johnson, who is mentioned in context regarding requests for funding.&lt;SEP&gt;Excelsior Bank is a financial institution in San Francisco linked to Montagu Trixit and the scandal.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a6e9a94b0aa47b1329998e9479c1189b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528da169951df090df4de0824ef7109b</data>
