    <node id="Fleming">
      <data key="d0">Fleming</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Fleming is a prospector who is lost in the woods and seeks to borrow a pan for washing dirt to look for gold.&lt;SEP&gt;Fleming is portrayed as a prospector who interacts with a young woman and seeks to prove his reliability in returning a borrowed pan.&lt;SEP&gt;Fleming is a character who receives a letter that reveals unexpected good fortune related to gold found in a pan.&lt;SEP&gt;Fleming is a character who is involved in mining, experiencing both disappointment and a sense of relief regarding his discoveries.&lt;SEP&gt;Fleming is a young man who is searching for gold and has a budding romantic interest in Tinka.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d0516950847d3af3cc640125f4b233d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f63b767c145ecd1c5412e2a9760c7ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-465f5ac022d97e69f2dc45fc7598aa7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfe5e597e938a83f367d9ee15997a5a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1556645e734e01c75f40b96c3891db6a</data>
