    <node id="The Cabin">
      <data key="d0">The Cabin</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cabin is described as a four-room, unpainted, redwood boarded structure that serves as a shelter for the characters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cabin is referred to as a dwelling where Snapshot Harry is believed to live with his sister and daughter.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cabin is where Brice and Snapshot Harry interact and is described as having neatness, comfort, and picturesque elements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cabin is a remote structure where the girl lives, surrounded by animal pelts and where Fleming stops to inquire for directions.&lt;SEP&gt;The cabin is the place where the girl resides and where the interactions between Fleming and the girl take place.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cabin is the residence associated with Katinka and serves as a backdrop for her interaction with Fleming.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cabin is the home of the Macarthy family where the events unfold surrounding Eileen and the mysterious occurrences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d0516950847d3af3cc640125f4b233d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05353b2557d1d709496b03e000178076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f63b767c145ecd1c5412e2a9760c7ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1556645e734e01c75f40b96c3891db6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877fe45c6401558fe8c7151af1610858&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7afa2615c5868318d15a4ab2c224c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18e461c485518cf17be5255f813a6f1</data>
