    <node id="Eugenia">
      <data key="d0">Eugenia</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Eugenia is a character mentioned by name, indicating she is significant to the context of the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is a character who appears composed despite the concern of her family and shows gratitude towards Bray for his assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is a character who experienced an accident that leads to concerns from Bray and others.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is mentioned in relation to a fall that reveals hidden gold and affects the actions of Bray and Parkhurst.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is a character whose note influences Bray and who he seeks after discovering the note.&lt;SEP&gt;Eugenia is a character who interacts with Edmund Bray in the garden after an unexpected encounter.</data>
