    <node id="Masterton">
      <data key="d0">Masterton</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Masterton is a passenger in a vehicle who expresses critical observations during a snowstorm and exhibits a sense of relief as conditions improve.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character who has conflicted feelings about his mission and reflects on his relationship with Cissy and her father's disgrace.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character who is surprised by the mention of Jake Poole and is seeking Montagu Trixit.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character who is injured and expresses admiration for Cissy's bravery while on a mission to meet her father.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a horseman who is trying to pursue the fugitive while facing challenges in the snow.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character who is seeking a fugitive and exhibits imaginative and superstitious qualities during his adventure.&lt;SEP&gt;Masterton is a character who reflects on his perceptions of Cissy, shows a sense of respect towards her, and acknowledges her bravery.</data>
