    <node id="Colonel Starbottle">
      <data key="d0">Colonel Starbottle</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Colonel Starbottle is a character involved in a horse riding accident, which raises questions about the circumstances.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is depicted as a prominent figure associated with the Democracy and is a subject of inquiry regarding his injuries.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is a central character who experienced an accident and expressed indignation about the circumstances surrounding it.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is a character who was involved in an accident and is referenced in relation to the protagonist's reporting activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is mentioned as a potential admirer of Senora Ramierez, representing a romantic competition in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Colonel Starbottle is a character who experienced an attack from a horse and is part of a narrative involving conflict and recollection.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5ed4a41d002be4d709987578e79d2381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c3192b9c02efed1ebf7f051668ef4ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb288cc5cdf5e2f7303baa299bb0ad65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d150a10447892f2c120d9177a582b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39facf182f4a5fa24e4d960518506e65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95e6739a3f9c1faec768c8e1da6afbee</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
