      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Flo">
      <data key="d0">Flo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Flo, also known as Flora, is a young girl characterized by her beauty and audacious behavior, which captures the attention of her audience and fellow travelers. She is notably related to Snapshot Harry, being his niece, and is often seen engaging with Brice, who expresses concern over her tendency to wander out of bounds. This behavior sometimes leads to embarrassing moments for others, which Flo appears to enjoy.

Her interactions are marked by a playful demeanor, and she exhibits a mix of curiosity and fear during various adventures, such as hiking. This duality of character adds depth to her personality, as she navigates her surroundings and relationships. The influence of external characters, particularly Mr. Tarbox, affects her circumstances, indicating that her life is intertwined with broader events and decisions made by those around her.

Additionally, there are concerns regarding her well-being, as she has been placed under the care of her uncle, Harry Dimwood, and is mentioned to have later been sent to a convent school. This detail suggests that Flo's spirited nature contrasts with the more structured and possibly restrictive environment of a convent education, highlighting a tension between her free-spirited behavior and the expectations placed upon her.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d549e03c2c739d89ecf816cae677d05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4e0e93af7a65231c6de3fff16732002&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31bf429f0dc25fb5648441a98c5b3697&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756f3fee704ba50d913f51c963d929b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed354bb280cbffcac2022b4b1028429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7ff57f304f2f9a7115f81e63308f19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7abe56fa54a521b5e22094fb8e7a464b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adcbf578ddc135aad9c7e04e8b9b6a8c</data>
