    <node id="Ramierez">
      <data key="d0">Ramierez</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ramierez is a Spanish woman connected to Colonel Starbottle, who is suggested to have a potential motive related to jealousy.&lt;SEP&gt;Ramierez is the character who owns the fonda and plays a significant role in managing interactions with the editor and his guests.&lt;SEP&gt;Ramierez refers to a family or household, with connections to Cota and the unfolding events surrounding Richards.&lt;SEP&gt;Ramierez is mentioned as the Mexican tenant of the old Spanish landlord, indicating a historical context relevant to the narrative.</data>
