    <node id="Mustang">
      <data key="d0">Mustang</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mustang is a tethered horse found by Masterton that he intends to use for pursuing the fugitive.&lt;SEP&gt;The mustang belongs to Ramierez and is mentioned as being ridden by Colonel Starbottle at the time of an incident.&lt;SEP&gt;The mustang is a horse that Colonel Starbottle attempted to ride, which ultimately resulted in his fall and subsequent injury.</data>
