    <node id="Mr. Parmlee">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Parmlee</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Parmlee is noted as a Northern gentleman who assisted Colonel Starbottle after his fall.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Parmlee is mentioned as a person with whom Colonel Starbottle discussed the choking sensation he experienced during his accident.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5ed4a41d002be4d709987578e79d2381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c3192b9c02efed1ebf7f051668ef4ed</data>
