      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Cissy">
      <data key="d0">Cissy</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cissy is a prominent character depicted as the belle of Canada City and the daughter of Montagu Trixit, who serves as the city's principal banker. She embodies a blend of youthful exuberance and vanity, displaying traits such as childlike imperiousness and audacious rebellion. Despite her beauty, characterized by a pretty and flushed yet defiant face, Cissy reveals her complexities through her social interactions and emotional responses.

Cissy seems largely unaware of her father's business dealings and the ramifications of his actions, adding a layer of innocence to her character. When confronted with the harsh reality that her father's house is no longer hers, she has a strong emotional reaction, indicating a deep connection to her family's status. This pride in her father's position persists, even in the face of his disgrace.

Her behavior showcases impatience and determination, particularly during discussions about color choices or when engaging with Mr. Windibrook about her father's situation. Cissy exhibits courageous traits, having traveled alone to see her father, reflecting her resourcefulness and resolve. She also expresses indignation regarding the prospect of returning to Canada City and showcases aspirations to head to Sacramento instead.

Overall, Cissy is portrayed as a young, determined girl who balances pride and audacity with a longing for connection and a strong sense of self, navigating her identity amidst familial challenges and societal expectations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c87d89cd1180b8d6a006229057edd6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6e9a94b0aa47b1329998e9479c1189b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1374a82b81b5bf5cc42271a4aaa04ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fed08294c7c286ca4d4684d894e58fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528da169951df090df4de0824ef7109b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8125a827c1ae26a6b606adacd1ab3c01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f28d427b11836c753976864f6f1ca0b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e5a1f05827b42a336baccdd4933d843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c46a50cbc624aabf5a4e28b143cd34f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95e6739a3f9c1faec768c8e1da6afbee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7644b64b0700c83f42a8a01e553a0f0e</data>
