      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Bray is a character who helps a lady after she has fallen, showing concern for her well-being while also revealing his own vulnerability.&lt;SEP&gt;Bray is a character involved in assisting Eugenia and navigating a dangerous trail.&lt;SEP&gt;Bray is a character who assists Eugenia during a challenging moment and reflects on his feelings toward her amidst the familial tension surrounding them.&lt;SEP&gt;Bray is a miner who feels guilty about delaying negotiations due to his interactions with a woman.&lt;SEP&gt;Bray is a character who has complex feelings about Eugenia and shows concern for her condition after an accident.&lt;SEP&gt;Bray is a character who exhibits conflicting feelings while prospecting on the hillside, particularly in relation to Eugenia's fall.&lt;SEP&gt;Bray is a character who discovers a note and contemplates its significance, revealing a connection to someone named Eugenia.</data>
