    <node id="Mr. Calton">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Calton</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Calton is a patient who is recovering and shows a shy gratitude towards Miss Trotter and an affection for Frida Jansen.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is portrayed as a concerned brother who wishes to intervene in his brother's romantic intentions, believing that his brother is not making a wise choice in his engagement.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is the elder brother who expresses concerns about his brother's engagement and seeks Miss Trotter's support against it.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is a character who expresses concern for his brother and tries to influence Miss Trotter's actions regarding him.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is a character mentioned to be vacating his rooms and is under the care of a specialist in San Francisco.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Calton is the current husband of Mrs. Calton, described as jolly but somewhat spoiled by women.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1f2949837deae0d2af6b85bc72ecfa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7d20169574265502212f8d8141c5d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed17775cbe8d000774a8baf77b6324bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a3a55a4716fe7da650a25825cbe8a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e9467a128fbb05bbbd0b3f83043bf0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34009f4313fe490d580935f9ef87ff52</data>
