    <node id="Frida Jansen">
      <data key="d0">Frida Jansen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Frida Jansen is a foreign chambermaid noted for her gentle and sympathetic manner, assigned to look after a patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Frida Jansen is depicted as a yellow-haired foreigner who is engaged to Mr. Calton's brother and works in the house as a caretaker.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1f2949837deae0d2af6b85bc72ecfa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed17775cbe8d000774a8baf77b6324bb</data>
