    <node id="Mr. Bilson">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Bilson</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mr. Bilson is characterized as the owner and proprietor of the Summit House, a hotel that plays a significant role in his life. Following the death of his wife, he takes on a housekeeper, indicating a period of personal transition and the need for support in managing his household and business.

Within the context of his involvement with the hotel's operations, Mr. Bilson is depicted as someone who engages with his staff and guests, notably showing delight over a watch received by his employee, Miss Trotter. This watch serves as a means for him to discuss and showcase the purported healing powers of the Summit Hotel, suggesting that he is not only attentive to personal relationships but also to the hotel's reputation and allure.

Furthermore, Mr. Bilson is noted for his authoritative role in discussions related to employment, particularly concerning Miss Trotter, and he is observed with a sense of influence in the matters surrounding potential engagements, which plays into the dynamics of relationships within the storyline. He expresses his upcoming marriage to Miss Jansen, indicating a new chapter in his life, and plans to leave the management of the Summit Hotel in Miss Trotter’s hands.

However, Mr. Bilson also exhibits moments of bitterness regarding personal matters, hinting at conflicts concerning marriage and expectations tied to Miss Trotter. His character is multi-faceted, having both a professional and emotional spectrum that shapes his interactions with those around him. As such, Mr. Bilson navigates both the operational aspects of the Summit House and his personal relationships, reflecting the complexities of a man confronting change in both his business and personal life.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-369a75ce4a9aaf2cf4882dd927c2352f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61d5043e124aeb47926ce7d455548eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343469de09660053c0e80621f41c713b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2949837deae0d2af6b85bc72ecfa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed17775cbe8d000774a8baf77b6324bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90a3a55a4716fe7da650a25825cbe8a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34009f4313fe490d580935f9ef87ff52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d18b6fa9a2e2b728d65fdd7990b785f6</data>
