      <data key="d2">Starbottle is mentioned in a context that suggests he is involved in a mystery surrounding attacks, contrasting with the lighter themes of familial relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;Starbottle is referenced as a gallant character who recently escaped from a dangerous event involving the devil.</data>
