    <node id="Richards">
      <data key="d0">Richards</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Richards is a character who recounts his experience of being attacked and expresses reluctance to involve law enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;Richards is a character who expresses skepticism about being robbed and displays interest in a girl he describes admiringly.&lt;SEP&gt;Richards is a foreman who expresses a growing affection for Cota and has been involved in the printing process during her visit.&lt;SEP&gt;Richards is a character who provides enthusiastic commentary on Cota's skills and likens her to an American girl.&lt;SEP&gt;Richards is associated with the same mysterious events as Starbottle, indicating a shared narrative thread.&lt;SEP&gt;Richards is a character reflecting on his prior experiences, including an attack and his interactions with Colonel Starbottle.&lt;SEP&gt;Richards is another character who shows seriousness about the story of the devil and the associated dangers, hinting at his own secret.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a98afa31aca72fe4aab8a13ac827087&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da89bc3630f36b6cbbe16af85499c868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-983c3121bab55d6241eb5cc8fc2c7e8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f0e749dd81bb72653818dcda1429c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb288cc5cdf5e2f7303baa299bb0ad65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d150a10447892f2c120d9177a582b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39facf182f4a5fa24e4d960518506e65</data>
