    <node id="Cota">
      <data key="d0">Cota</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cota is a young girl who exhibits skill in riding a horse bareback and displays a playful demeanor towards Mr. Grey.&lt;SEP&gt;Cota is described as a beautiful character, daughter of Senora Ramierez, with an anonymous association to the Ramierez family.&lt;SEP&gt;Cota is a person associated with a horse that plays a central role in the conflict, particularly regarding her emotional reaction to its death.&lt;SEP&gt;Cota is a character whose allure causes trouble for others, particularly relating to a cursed mustang.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a98afa31aca72fe4aab8a13ac827087&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da89bc3630f36b6cbbe16af85499c868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-983c3121bab55d6241eb5cc8fc2c7e8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb288cc5cdf5e2f7303baa299bb0ad65</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
