      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">A hawk is a bird of prey that was observed by Ned Bray flying lazily above the canyon, suggesting its presence in the mountainous area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hawk is a predator that chases Pigeon Pretty and is eventually captured by Bruin.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hawk, referred to as Ger-Falcon, is a proud bird who reflects on his noble ancestry and current predicament.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hawk is a bird that also accompanies the Hermit, perched on his shoulder opposite the Crow.&lt;SEP&gt;The hawk observes the gathering, contributing to the discussion about the source of a noise.&lt;SEP&gt;The hawk is a bird of prey that seizes its prey with one claw while holding onto the ground with the other.</data>
