    <node id="The Grandmother">
      <data key="d0">The Grandmother</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Grandmother is a character who enjoys the assistance of her forest friends and comes out for supper.&lt;SEP&gt;The Grandmother supports Bruin, expressing gratitude for his protective nature and kind heart.&lt;SEP&gt;The Grandmother quotes a line of poetry that mentions "the lowing herd," contributing to the discussion.&lt;SEP&gt;The grandmother is actively engaged in baking and preparing food for the upcoming event.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6f7adebfdec41855a49926f0ef0c9df6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60d4926e5d4ac6ded55aa7e91fca4c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771de78b693da0d88850589600bace97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6778bb1c4c17f23f0cc54a25751bc2f8</data>
