    </node>
    <node id="The Raccoon">
      <data key="d0">The Raccoon</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Raccoon is a character who takes pride in his work and engages in discussions with Toto and Bruin.&lt;SEP&gt;The Raccoon engages in discussions with Toto and Miss Mary, and seeks to understand Miss Mary's past.&lt;SEP&gt;The Raccoon is a silent observer of the robber's actions, lying hidden under the table.&lt;SEP&gt;The Raccoon listens to the discussion and expresses agreement with the points made, showing elegance in demeanor.&lt;SEP&gt;The raccoon is involved in arranging decorations and sharing stories about honey-hunting.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6f7adebfdec41855a49926f0ef0c9df6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60d4926e5d4ac6ded55aa7e91fca4c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a372fe9a6fbcab1dde3e0bf0d1e5c883&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771de78b693da0d88850589600bace97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e1e1c80122eed47e47fa346fe42be29</data>
