    <node id="Bossy">
      <data key="d0">Bossy</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Bossy is the lost calf of the Red Cow, whom she believes to have become a moon-calf on the moon.&lt;SEP&gt;Bossy is the lost calf of the Young Cow, whom she believes has been taken to the moon.</data>
