    <node id="Grandmother">
      <data key="d0">Grandmother</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Grandmother is a caring figure who looks after the animals and engages in storytelling while knitting.&lt;SEP&gt;The grandmother is a character who explains cultural details to Bruin and is responsible for the care of the household.&lt;SEP&gt;The Grandmother expresses concern for the mess created by Bruin and the ruined custard pie.&lt;SEP&gt;The grandmother is a family member who is peacefully napping in her room during the events.&lt;SEP&gt;The Grandmother is a character who shows concern and admiration for the other characters, especially for Toto.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d3e57d404581a83d442385fc9e650dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02eb71062b272bf903fae543230157a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3612e7c996c6ca62cbb14dfd7b5263&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-218b41b3055def40ede38f5d844e91d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd1416667b27714cea22c448d2c7894</data>
