    </node>
    <node id="Wood-Pigeon">
      <data key="d0">Wood-Pigeon</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Wood-Pigeon is an animal that finds comfort by perching with others during cold weather.&lt;SEP&gt;The wood-pigeon acts as a mediator, calling Bruin and Toto to re-enter the cave and comforting the hermit.&lt;SEP&gt;The Wood-Pigeon is characterized by its elegant appearance and presence in the kitchen.&lt;SEP&gt;The wood-pigeon is a character that expresses affection for the other characters and shares a sentiment of love and companionship.&lt;SEP&gt;The wood-pigeon shows kindness by freeing the woodchuck and engaging in the merriment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d3e57d404581a83d442385fc9e650dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02eb71062b272bf903fae543230157a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8d967fb6a3f6684383c4141e9bfb45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-678eca288ef7c7d22d1d4c106619b015&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd1416667b27714cea22c448d2c7894</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625585</data>
