      <data key="d0">Cupboard</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cupboard is a quaint piece of furniture near the fireplace that houses Chucky and ginger-jars.&lt;SEP&gt;The cupboard is where DW53 stored the piece of pie that he later found missing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d3e57d404581a83d442385fc9e650dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-216931ed57c995344f647fe87af541bd</data>
