    <node id="Chop-Chin">
      <data key="d0">Chop-Chin</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Chop-Chin is a twelve-year-old boy who aspires to become a sweeper like his father and helps his mother with household chores.&lt;SEP&gt;Chop-Chin is a twelve-year-old boy with aspirations to become a sweeper in the Imperial court-yard.&lt;SEP&gt;Chop-Chin is the son of Ly-Chee, who experiences deep concern for his father's fate and seeks a way to save him.&lt;SEP&gt;Chop-Chin is a boy who climbs a golden pedestal to take the Holy Dragon from its stand during a nighttime adventure.&lt;SEP&gt;Chop-Chin is a young boy who carries a bronze bowl to the Temple and seeks the prayers of the priests for Tong-Ki-Tcheng's recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Chop-Chin is a boy who carries the Celestial Footstool and communicates with the sentinel about his task.&lt;SEP&gt;Chop-Chin is the son of Ly-Chee who is appointed as the Second Sweeper and is involved in carrying out a bold venture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d3e57d404581a83d442385fc9e650dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1c80cac977c30ca82e1b9af698fb201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379dcea462e81fbf4e3f1167499c4c9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57350e9ef876aa02f2e4a0422b1ab48d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f9814d06b58178385c8b7cffd803ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759c07b9e02ea8da79b447394f2f4c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667660461b3e82515e6fd43c059be5a6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
