    <node id="High Cellarer">
      <data key="d0">High Cellarer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The High Cellarer is an officer of King Sligo, characterized as the thief who attempts to steal from the king.&lt;SEP&gt;The High Cellarer is a character who attempts to steal treasure from the King's treasure-chamber while disguising his intentions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3f95c6e33fe89f14cf74854d84f63b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bd2042c0644a13aac0fecc3b7e7699a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625587</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Treasure-Chamber">
      <data key="d0">Treasure-Chamber</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Treasure-Chamber is where King Sligo keeps his treasure and is the target of the High Cellarer's theft.&lt;SEP&gt;The Treasure-Chamber is a secret room containing gold and jewels that King Sligo seeks to protect.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3f95c6e33fe89f14cf74854d84f63b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bd2042c0644a13aac0fecc3b7e7699a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625587</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Sapphires">
      <data key="d0">Sapphires</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Sapphires are valuable gems that the High Cellarer attempts to steal from the treasure-chamber.&lt;SEP&gt;Sapphires are valuable gems presented by the Robber Chieftain to the Princess in exchange for her help.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3f95c6e33fe89f14cf74854d84f63b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-586a7611f02b1deff7ed6b0d6bdd65af</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625588</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Crown">
      <data key="d0">Crown</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The crown is a royal symbol worn by King Sligo, where he later places a piece of coal embedded in sapphires.&lt;SEP&gt;The Crown is a ceremonial item that has been prepared for the new king after the old monarch's death.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3f95c6e33fe89f14cf74854d84f63b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-506f129a6a5da52f9bd4973893d49e50</data>
