    <node id="Saki-Pan">
      <data key="d0">Saki-Pan</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Saki-Pan represents the temple authorities, with priests like Nai-Ping serving its rituals and responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Saki-Pan is referenced as the temple where the priests are located, who express anguish over the absence of the Golden Dragon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d1c80cac977c30ca82e1b9af698fb201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dc6e32918330eb85b6be8174ed5395a</data>
