    <node id="Wah-Song">
      <data key="d0">Wah-Song</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wah-Song is the Emperor of China who experiences a terrifying dream and has interactions with a Golden Dragon.&lt;SEP&gt;Wah-Song is the Emperor who faces commands from the Golden Dragon regarding the fate of Ly-Chee.&lt;SEP&gt;Wah-Song is the Celestial Emperor who undergoes a transformation after a period of seclusion and renouncement of food.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-379dcea462e81fbf4e3f1167499c4c9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dc6e32918330eb85b6be8174ed5395a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57350e9ef876aa02f2e4a0422b1ab48d</data>
