    <node id="Golden Dragon">
      <data key="d0">Golden Dragon</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Golden Dragon is a sacred idol that is referenced in the context of seeking mercy for Ly-Chee's life.&lt;SEP&gt;The Golden Dragon is a supernatural being that appears in Wah-Song's dream and confronts him with a stern message.&lt;SEP&gt;The Golden Dragon is a powerful being that commands the Emperor to pardon Ly-Chee and provide him with rewards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Golden Dragon is a significant mythical being that the priests of the Saki-Pan worship and celebrate upon its return to the Temple.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-379dcea462e81fbf4e3f1167499c4c9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dc6e32918330eb85b6be8174ed5395a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57350e9ef876aa02f2e4a0422b1ab48d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759c07b9e02ea8da79b447394f2f4c45</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
