    <node id="Short-Tail No. 73">
      <data key="d0">Short-Tail No. 73</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Short-Tail No. 73 is the same as the Little Comet, who is experiencing feelings of confusion and indignation regarding travel restrictions imposed by the Comet Master.&lt;SEP&gt;Short-Tail No. 73 is a comet that has been devoured by the Sun, marking its end.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b84f4e93e76fa38e1e70383218e0788b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26eeb163c449b14e147fabcfe98a220a</data>
