    <node id="Sun">
      <data key="d0">Sun</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sun is depicted as a bright and alluring celestial body that draws the Little Comet closer, ultimately leading to a tragic outcome.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sun is a celestial body that is known to consume comets, as mentioned in the context of Short-Tail No. 73.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b84f4e93e76fa38e1e70383218e0788b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26eeb163c449b14e147fabcfe98a220a</data>
