    <node id="Comet Master">
      <data key="d0">Comet Master</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Comet Master is a character who oversees the comets, giving them orders and managing their travel.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comet Master is an authoritative figure dictating rules to comets, leading to the Little Comet's hesitation in speaking to others.&lt;SEP&gt;The Comet Master is an authoritative figure responsible for managing the comets and giving them instructions, including the fate of Short-Tail No. 73.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b84f4e93e76fa38e1e70383218e0788b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26eeb163c449b14e147fabcfe98a220a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8ad11358294f1889279ffec7807bc4</data>
