    <node id="DW53">
      <data key="d0">DW53</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">DW53 is a character who feels discomfort related to his past actions and the laughter of Toto.&lt;SEP&gt;DW53 is a raccoon who feels melancholy due to losing a piece of pie that he had stored.&lt;SEP&gt;DW53 is a character involved in the conflict and interactions between Toto and Klawtobitz, noting events during their adventure.&lt;SEP&gt;DW53 is an astute character who observes Bruin's mistake and practices the jumping trick correctly after seeing Toto perform it.&lt;SEP&gt;DW53 is a character participating in decorating the kitchen and assisting in gathering greenery for the festive event.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b60d4926e5d4ac6ded55aa7e91fca4c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771de78b693da0d88850589600bace97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-216931ed57c995344f647fe87af541bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6778bb1c4c17f23f0cc54a25751bc2f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5e6743d54bfa5b3f1b9509aacd347e</data>
