      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Planet Bungo is mentioned as a celestial body that greets the curiosity of Short-Tail Comet No. 73, though he is instructed to avoid it.&lt;SEP&gt;Planet Bungo is mentioned as an undesirable destination containing a reform school for unruly meteors.</data>
