    <node id="Eileen Macarthy">
      <data key="d0">Eileen Macarthy</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Eileen Macarthy is another name for Eily, who seeks to have diamonds and pearls that drop from her mouth when she speaks.&lt;SEP&gt;Eileen Macarthy, also called Eily, is a girl who interacts with a Green Man in the woods and displays kindness.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63e172b463b651297a4b51743b0d92c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06483977a7363972851107fedf6ac233</data>
