    <node id="Green Man">
      <data key="d0">Green Man</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Green Man is a tiny man in light green clothing who is freed from a net by Eileen Macarthy and thanks her for her kindness.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Man is a fairy who possesses the power to grant wishes and interacts with Eily, offering her a choice for her wish.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Man is a mythical figure who grants Eily a fairy gift and interacts with her, revealing that he has not spoken to a mortal child in two hundred years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63e172b463b651297a4b51743b0d92c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06483977a7363972851107fedf6ac233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35079c89721b697b8c8d0e998801c8a3</data>
