    <node id="Pigeon Pretty">
      <data key="d0">Pigeon Pretty</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Pigeon Pretty is a character that expresses affection for Bruin and reassures him about his size and strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Pigeon Pretty is a bird who flies into the cave to help the hermit recover by using dried leaves.&lt;SEP&gt;Pigeon Pretty is a wood-pigeon who is chased by the hawk and faints in front of Bruin.&lt;SEP&gt;Pigeon Pretty is a gentle bird who intercedes on behalf of the hawk, suggesting kindness and compassion.&lt;SEP&gt;Pigeon Pretty is another character who shows interest in the events and news shared by Toto and Bruin.&lt;SEP&gt;Pigeon Pretty is another character referenced by Toto, highlighting the characters of stories that he enjoys.&lt;SEP&gt;Pigeon Pretty is a bird assisting in dusting the ornaments for the event.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63e172b463b651297a4b51743b0d92c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2d18b61665def22c8f765c51d5d1fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a12948208c13074a50572b428e264d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771de78b693da0d88850589600bace97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c686441b3937cff685f4451d4cd9685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ac5ac6267351fae8bc7baf5c96a3714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6778bb1c4c17f23f0cc54a25751bc2f8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625592</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Raccoon">
      <data key="d0">Raccoon</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Raccoon is a fictional animal character that plays a significant role in various social interactions among forest creatures. This character is often depicted joyfully recounting experiences and engaging in dialogues that touch on themes of friendship, societal norms, and curiosity about the world.

In one narrative, the Raccoon interacts with a tea-kettle and a character named Toto, showcasing a playful nature. It is characterized by a penchant for sitting on a hassock and proudly displaying its tail. The Raccoon is also portrayed as a witness to a conflict, encouraging a friendly gathering afterward, indicating its social nature and desire for community. Furthermore, it expresses a strong aversion to harming other creatures, highlighting a compassionate side.

Throughout its interactions, the Raccoon exhibits a skeptical attitude, particularly during discussions about comets, where it questions Toto’s explanations. This characteristic adds a layer of depth to its personality, showcasing curiosity paired with discernment. The Raccoon also takes an active role in conversations related to dietary preferences, offering assistance to another character, Miss Mary, which reflects its caring disposition.

In the context of gatherings, the Raccoon invites others to share joyful experiences in the forest, displaying its eagerness to foster companionship. It participates in communal meals, reacting thoughtfully to comments from a character referred to as the Hermit and maintaining a sense of humor throughout exchanges related to honey and bees.

Despite its friendly and humorous demeanor, the Raccoon is occasionally depicted as uneasy or restless, suggesting complexity in its character. Overall, the Raccoon serves as an engaging and multifaceted character that enriches the narrative through its interactions and perspectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d3e57d404581a83d442385fc9e650dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed8ae0075c4582a8dd2392029c8ddfae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99224c8c1fbad67820c6ae2260eff2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8d967fb6a3f6684383c4141e9bfb45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89037da3a2e5920f7e8990667d3b252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677597ec1ef3e633af604717fda976b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-696f4ed37bc2689c89ed042ecf2ec6d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-678eca288ef7c7d22d1d4c106619b015&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91c4a284dc9ce506ed9cd886b83df824&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-218b41b3055def40ede38f5d844e91d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd1416667b27714cea22c448d2c7894&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5e6743d54bfa5b3f1b9509aacd347e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3612e7c996c6ca62cbb14dfd7b5263</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625592</data>
