    </node>
    <node id="The Hermit">
      <data key="d0">The Hermit</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Hermit is a character who lives in a cave and is currently unable to move due to an injury.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hermit is an old man, the master of the Crow, who is sick and unable to take care of himself.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hermit is an old man who experiences a fainting spell due to the unexpected situation involving Toto and Bruin.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hermit is characterized by his serious demeanor, participates in conversations, and responds to Bruin's inquiries regarding digging.&lt;SEP&gt;The hermit is a kind individual who offers to feed Mr. Ger-Falcon during winter and cares for his animals.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hermit is an old character who visits with animals and discusses changes in the weather and season.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be2d18b61665def22c8f765c51d5d1fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89037da3a2e5920f7e8990667d3b252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a69e187e3b23aa9bc91e07518123699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c686441b3937cff685f4451d4cd9685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ac5ac6267351fae8bc7baf5c96a3714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51c0ae512a1dc43eac54573c59477cb0</data>
