      <data key="d0">The Castle</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The castle is mentioned in the context of defending against an enemy, adding a whimsical backdrop to the story.&lt;SEP&gt;The castle refers to the home or dwelling defended by Toto during a robbery attempt, as mentioned in the narrative.</data>
