    <node id="Emperor">
      <data key="d0">Emperor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Emperor is the monarch who interacts with the Golden Dragon and faces the consequences of his decisions regarding Ly-Chee.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emperor of Morocco is described as a powerful individual with despotism over his subjects and is responsible for judicial decisions affecting subjects, including foreigners.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emperor is the ruler who resides partly in Morocco and manages diplomatic relations and internal order.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emperor is referenced as a figure to whom the Governor owes a duty regarding the Consul's safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-57350e9ef876aa02f2e4a0422b1ab48d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-203f252ae42306fa9f42171f8e2f0f23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c246ad7923d08e2ef2366af23b4c19f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9af5b64614e29079b8b6802af2587be</data>
