    <node id="Cottage">
      <data key="d0">Cottage</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cottage is the setting described, where the events of Toto's Merry Winter take place, featuring a warm interior and a fireplace.&lt;SEP&gt;The cottage is the setting where the characters interact, sleep, and share stories.&lt;SEP&gt;The cottage is mentioned as a place where Cracker has experiences and interacts with others.&lt;SEP&gt;The cottage is a quiet home where family members are present but largely unaware of the happenings outside.&lt;SEP&gt;The cottage serves as the gathering place for the animals, where farewells are exchanged.&lt;SEP&gt;The cottage is where characters sought shelter to dry their clothes, characterized by cleanliness and hospitality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-02eb71062b272bf903fae543230157a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8d967fb6a3f6684383c4141e9bfb45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3612e7c996c6ca62cbb14dfd7b5263&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677597ec1ef3e633af604717fda976b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09793d37fba2e0aa20e755731a38abb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a287228f598fefb3952d1a82454d23b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
