    <node id="Eileen">
      <data key="d0">Eileen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Eileen is a young girl who gathers sticks from the forest and experiences a transformative event where objects unexpectedly emerge from her mouth.&lt;SEP&gt;Eileen is a child who experiences fear and grief as she is taken by Dr. O'Shaughnessy.&lt;SEP&gt;Eileen is a character who finds herself in a peculiar situation, being held in a room and tasked with speaking until the room is full.&lt;SEP&gt;Eileen is a fairy-gifted child who is burdened by the task of filling a room with jewels that fall from her lips.&lt;SEP&gt;Eileen is the character in whose name Mrs. O'Shaughnessy is keeping watch while Doctor O'Shaughnessy is away.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6382719bf2a33d3d4896d4297865f815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a96c6566abc9d6c8f4e98b738e911a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18e461c485518cf17be5255f813a6f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c208d3742c721b6f2059142bc06cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd206869da90eebb876c5d939eb3db11</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625596</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Mrs. O'Shaughnessy">
      <data key="d0">Mrs. O'Shaughnessy</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mrs. O'Shaughnessy is Dr. O'Shaughnessy's wife, who is surprised by the arrival of Eileen.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. O'Shaughnessy is the doctor's wife, who is bewildered by her husband's talk and is assigned to help keep Eileen engaged in conversation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. O'Shaughnessy is the doctor's wife, who pursues jewels falling from Eileen's lips with eagerness and serves her food.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. O'Shaughnessy is a character who appears to be dozing off while Eily recounts stories about her surroundings.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. O'Shaughnessy is the wife of Dr. O'Shaughnessy, who panics when she realizes a child has gone missing.&lt;SEP&gt;Mrs. O'Shaughnessy is a woman frightened by the sight of treasures and is responsible for keeping Eily company while awaiting her husband.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6382719bf2a33d3d4896d4297865f815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a96c6566abc9d6c8f4e98b738e911a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eebe7d0e7c476207c5a2e37fa90ec16a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35079c89721b697b8c8d0e998801c8a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04c208d3742c721b6f2059142bc06cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd206869da90eebb876c5d939eb3db11</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763625596</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Toto">
      <data key="d0">Toto</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Toto is a multi-faceted character appearing in various narratives and interactions primarily centered around themes of friendship, adventure, and community involvement. He is depicted as a small boy who engages with a range of characters including Bruin the bear, DW53, and other animals, displaying a blend of playful behavior and genuine care for those around him. Toto's interactions often reflect a sense of warmth and camaraderie, whether he is partaking in playful activities like building snow forts, dancing, or participating in gatherings and celebrations.

In his role with Bruin, Toto exhibits a supportive personality, teaching Bruin how to jump and dance while also being attentive to his wellbeing. He often expresses sentiments of concern for Bruin, especially during challenging situations, showcasing depth in their friendship. Toto's compassionate nature extends beyond Bruin, as he engages in conversations with various characters, including an old lady for whom he was a beloved presence and a hermit with whom he shares stories and knowledge.

Toto's adventures also involve lighthearted moments, such as preparing for festive events, gathering fresh eggs, and engaging in storytelling sessions about fairy tales. He exhibits curiosity and inquiry, whether asking about the needs of others, such as delivering food to Baldhead, or discussing topics like comets and the intelligence of cows. Toto's playful demeanor is highlighted by his ability to maintain a cheerful attitude even in the midst of narrative conflicts, such as the story of an attempted robbery and his interactions involving social dynamics with the raccoon and other animals.

In summary, Toto is a character rich in complexity, embodying friendship, loyalty, and compassion while actively participating in a variety of playful and serious situations throughout his adventures. His interactions not only reflect his joyous spirit but also underline the importance of connection and understanding in the narratives he inhabits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6f7adebfdec41855a49926f0ef0c9df6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d3e57d404581a83d442385fc9e650dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed8ae0075c4582a8dd2392029c8ddfae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f95c6e33fe89f14cf74854d84f63b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b84f4e93e76fa38e1e70383218e0788b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b60d4926e5d4ac6ded55aa7e91fca4c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63e172b463b651297a4b51743b0d92c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2d18b61665def22c8f765c51d5d1fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02eb71062b272bf903fae543230157a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99224c8c1fbad67820c6ae2260eff2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f9814d06b58178385c8b7cffd803ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8d967fb6a3f6684383c4141e9bfb45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a372fe9a6fbcab1dde3e0bf0d1e5c883&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a12948208c13074a50572b428e264d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89037da3a2e5920f7e8990667d3b252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771de78b693da0d88850589600bace97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03560b66e85f3d2c8750033a19ea401c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e1e1c80122eed47e47fa346fe42be29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3612e7c996c6ca62cbb14dfd7b5263&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a69e187e3b23aa9bc91e07518123699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c686441b3937cff685f4451d4cd9685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-741254ee870941013c032a0acf8e5a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-216931ed57c995344f647fe87af541bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b75467e15c21b353927fc372b7848e8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677597ec1ef3e633af604717fda976b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ac5ac6267351fae8bc7baf5c96a3714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-696f4ed37bc2689c89ed042ecf2ec6d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e64bd1d5284c29e6cb96bd7c0d5fdad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09793d37fba2e0aa20e755731a38abb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-678eca288ef7c7d22d1d4c106619b015&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91c775951405f76d18f8b6972a487cd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91c4a284dc9ce506ed9cd886b83df824&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-218b41b3055def40ede38f5d844e91d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd1416667b27714cea22c448d2c7894&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51c0ae512a1dc43eac54573c59477cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6778bb1c4c17f23f0cc54a25751bc2f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5e6743d54bfa5b3f1b9509aacd347e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b24f2b68a542e5127bd458a14221bb2e</data>
