      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Phelim is Eileen's brother, who excitedly discovers the shining objects that come from Eileen's mouth.&lt;SEP&gt;Phelim is Eileen's younger brother, whom she worries about as she is taken away.&lt;SEP&gt;Phelim is a character who calls attention to Dr. O'Shaughnessy as he drives past the Macarthy household.&lt;SEP&gt;Phelim is mentioned as Eileen's family member, whom she wishes to see again.</data>
