      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Squeak is a little brown mouse with bright black eyes, adventurous and curious about exploring the kitchen.&lt;SEP&gt;Squeak is a mouse involved in a funny escapade with his companion, Scrabble, who tries to take food.</data>
