      <data key="d2">Scrabble is a little brown mouse who accompanies Squeak and is equally curious and playful.&lt;SEP&gt;Scrabble is a small brown mouse who reacts with horror at the idea of moving and shows concern for safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Scrabble is a mouse who accompanies Squeak in their nocturnal adventure to take squash pie.</data>
