    <node id="Dr. O'Shaughnessy">
      <data key="d0">Dr. O'Shaughnessy</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dr. O'Shaughnessy is a doctor who examines the situation regarding Eily and concludes that she is not in possession of real jewels.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. O'Shaughnessy is a doctor who intends to help Eileen but has a cold demeanor, causing her fear.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. O'Shaughnessy is depicted as a man who experiences horror and dismay upon discovering an unsettling scene in Eily's room.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1a96c6566abc9d6c8f4e98b738e911a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-741254ee870941013c032a0acf8e5a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09ec85f1d57b3ac80db5f54db6bb6f2</data>
