      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Honor Macarthy is Eileen's mother, addressing concerns about her daughter's unusual condition and fearing that Eileen is bewitched.&lt;SEP&gt;Honor Macarthy is Eileen's mother, concerned for her child's safety and well-being.</data>
