    <node id="Miss Mary">
      <data key="d0">Miss Mary</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Miss Mary is a parrot characterized by her multifaceted experiences and interactions in her narrative. She vividly recounts her father's experiences in China, reflecting on his legacy and imparting important lessons. Throughout her adventures, Miss Mary showcases a range of emotions and relationships with other characters, particularly her friends, such as a raccoon and a wood-pigeon.

In her personal history, Miss Mary shares a poignant recollection of losing feathers and the significance of her past with the raccoon, who has played a pivotal role in her life by saving her at one point. This gratitude highlights the strong bonds she forms, as she expresses it not only through memories but also through her active participation in conversations about animals and storytelling.

Miss Mary also observes her environment keenly, reacting with indignation and confidence when witnessing the actions of a robber from her vantage point at the window. In social settings, she becomes a target of playful antics from Cracker during a dance, which demonstrates her ability to engage with those around her in light-hearted moments. Additionally, she shows concern for her friend the wood-pigeon, illustrating her caring nature.

Her contributions to the narrative are significant, as she is often acknowledged honorably and recognized proudly as "Lady Parrot." Miss Mary's involvement extends to helping during preparations, such as dusting ornaments, further underlining her role in her community. Through these varied interactions and experiences, Miss Mary emerges as a central figure whose life is woven with adventure, friendship, and reflection.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63e172b463b651297a4b51743b0d92c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02eb71062b272bf903fae543230157a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99224c8c1fbad67820c6ae2260eff2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a372fe9a6fbcab1dde3e0bf0d1e5c883&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-771de78b693da0d88850589600bace97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03560b66e85f3d2c8750033a19ea401c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e1e1c80122eed47e47fa346fe42be29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3612e7c996c6ca62cbb14dfd7b5263&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6778bb1c4c17f23f0cc54a25751bc2f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b24f2b68a542e5127bd458a14221bb2e</data>
