    <node id="Rotta">
      <data key="d0">Rotta</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Rotta, also known as the Rote, is a medieval stringed instrument played by twanging and bowing its strings.&lt;SEP&gt;The rotta is an ancient stringed instrument mentioned as having similarities to the lyre and used in historical contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8e481d0b0dc9178db4c1b9a451a72ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6073fe712a13c2a8fa88a32fa74f3062</data>
