    <node id="King David">
      <data key="d0">King David</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">King David is a biblical figure known for his association with the Kinnor, which is considered an ancient stringed instrument.&lt;SEP&gt;King David is depicted as playing the harp in various manuscripts, symbolizing a historical and cultural connection to music.&lt;SEP&gt;King David is a biblical figure illustrated playing the rotta in ancient manuscripts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8e481d0b0dc9178db4c1b9a451a72ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6073fe712a13c2a8fa88a32fa74f3062&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ba8bec314d618fd6ba2fced04ef111</data>
