    <node id="British Museum">
      <data key="d0">British Museum</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The British Museum houses significant artifacts, including fragments of frescoes representing Egyptian musical instruments discovered in tombs.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum houses several ancient coins depicting lyres and other artifacts from the time of Judas Maccabæus.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum houses various ancient Egyptian musical artifacts, including cymbals and bells.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum houses a fragment of a Greek lyre found in a tomb near Athens, showcasing ancient musical artifacts.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum is home to a mosaic figure of a Roman girl playing the tibia, discovered in 1823.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum houses ancient artifacts including bone-flutes from archaeological discoveries.&lt;SEP&gt;The British Museum is home to a manuscript that features an interesting representation of the rotta.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8e481d0b0dc9178db4c1b9a451a72ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d034b0ebc70d115fe140d386b94caa9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fea727469cc8526b5cd257ed6247a09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aef18eb73774c5f975cff80e5f2ce51f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-409162d6c592b356035008418a8c62af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ba8bec314d618fd6ba2fced04ef111&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c32645e26c49665a71ca04b6c2eea85</data>
