    <node id="Phoenicians">
      <data key="d0">Phoenicians</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Phoenicians colonized Sardinia at an early period, introducing unique instruments like the Lionedda or Launedda.&lt;SEP&gt;Phoenicians were ancient maritime traders from the region of modern-day Lebanon, credited with establishing Carthage.&lt;SEP&gt;The Phoenicians, also known as Carthaginians, were the original rulers of North Africa before the Romans.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d034b0ebc70d115fe140d386b94caa9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73f52bfe54d47067a25b5b0c44706763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777</data>
