      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Foung-Hoang is a miraculous bird in Chinese tradition believed to have inspired the musical scale.&lt;SEP&gt;Foung-Hoang is a mythical bird in Chinese tradition associated with the origin of their musical scale.</data>
