      <data key="d2">The dulcimer is a musical instrument seen as a prototype for the pianoforte and was known to early Arab and Persian cultures.&lt;SEP&gt;The dulcimer is a stringed musical instrument, although details of its construction are unclear from the bas-reliefs.</data>
