    <node id="Queen Elizabeth">
      <data key="d0">Queen Elizabeth</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Queen Elizabeth is historically significant in the context of musical instruments, as she presided over a time when specific instruments were in common use in England.&lt;SEP&gt;Queen Elizabeth is referenced as a historical figure during whose reign many old instruments were in common use in England.&lt;SEP&gt;Queen Elizabeth is referenced for her time and policies regarding young noblemen in naval service.&lt;SEP&gt;Queen Elizabeth is a historical figure associated with the time when the Delabole Quarries were first worked.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95a9160a14d7266e2100e2d55ebcd715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0658b2c968fe6ee5f181166477508b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8a70ed68b8ad9957789f681884b2ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-322cff857c0beb5c471bdf49a8426f1d</data>
