      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ixtlilxochitl is a native of Mexico, of royal descent, who lived in the beginning of the seventeenth century and wrote a historical essay discussing musical instruments.&lt;SEP&gt;Ixtlilxochitl is a historical figure of royal descent who documented the musical practices in Mexico during the seventeenth century.</data>
