    <node id="Peruvians">
      <data key="d0">Peruvians</data>
      <data key="d1">people</data>
      <data key="d2">The Peruvians refer to the indigenous people of Peru, recognized for their cultural heritage and contributions to music.&lt;SEP&gt;The Peruvians are a group known for their historical musical practices and the use of instruments like bells in their culture.&lt;SEP&gt;Peruvians are a group of people who historically celebrated public occasions with music and dancing, and honored the dead through solemn feasts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73ed7c284b3a9d9caa2237f4d2af971d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc505eeb3cd53b0544dd308adf0587ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93589ec60a74676e9a13006653f3b90f</data>
