    <node id="Jobel">
      <data key="d0">Jobel</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Jobel is speculated to refer to a loud trumpet blast or a musical sound, with speculation on its relation to Jubal, the inventor of musical instruments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7da70d39d1688e8eb35f0af080c5cf6</data>
