    <node id="Jubal">
      <data key="d0">Jubal</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Jubal is mentioned in the Bible as the inventor of the Kinnor, signifying its historical importance in music.&lt;SEP&gt;Jubal is mentioned in the Bible as the father of all who handle harp and organ, recognized as a significant figure in the context of musical invention.&lt;SEP&gt;Jubal is referenced as a figure related to early music and instrument development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7da70d39d1688e8eb35f0af080c5cf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662dfab4657790a73298dc9f0446a502&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ba8bec314d618fd6ba2fced04ef111</data>
