    <node id="Harps">
      <data key="d0">Harps</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Harps were variously shaped string instruments used by the Egyptians, with notable elegance and decoration, including sizes up to six and a half feet high.&lt;SEP&gt;Harps are stringed instruments noted for their elegance, suggested to be as significant as the lyre in musical contexts.</data>
