    <node id="Tamboura">
      <data key="d0">Tamboura</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The tamboura is recognized as a larger harp, noted for its significance in the context of musical instruments in ancient cultures.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tamboura is a long-necked lute that is favored in Middle Eastern music.&lt;SEP&gt;The tamboura is a kind of lute with a long neck and is considered one of the favorite stringed instruments.&lt;SEP&gt;Tamboura is noted as a type of stringed instrument referenced in various contexts.</data>
