      <data key="d0">Hydraulos</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Hydraulos was a water-powered wind instrument used in ancient Greece, similar to the hydraulic organ of the Romans.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydraulos is identified as a hydraulic organ, significant in the history of musical instruments.</data>
