      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kinnor, the favorite instrument of King David, is likely a type of lyre or small triangular harp mentioned in the Bible.&lt;SEP&gt;Kinnor is associated with ancient Hebrew musical traditions.</data>
