    <node id="Lute">
      <data key="d0">Lute</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Lute is highlighted as a popular instrument that evolved over centuries, known for its complex string arrangements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lute is a stringed musical instrument characterized by its various sizes used for different performance purposes, such as the treble-lute and bass-lute.&lt;SEP&gt;Lute is a stringed musical instrument with varieties from Chinese, Persian, Moorish, and Elizabethan traditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lute is a musical instrument played by the narrator in the garden.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-662dfab4657790a73298dc9f0446a502&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7452f67f575388f5344a993822f4062&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001c1f1b3eee1ad8a7fbb7cf02acea78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8a70ed68b8ad9957789f681884b2ba</data>
