      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Nareda is the inventor of the vina, a principal national instrument of Hindustan, in Brahmin mythology.&lt;SEP&gt;Nareda is recognized as the giver of water and the ruler of the clouds in ancient traditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Nareda is noted as an inventor of Hindu instruments.</data>
