      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Exeter Cathedral is a notable location in England known for having one of the largest and finest peals of bells.&lt;SEP&gt;Exeter Cathedral is the setting that features the Minstrels’ Gallery, an architectural element displaying sculptures of musicians.</data>
