    <node id="Te-Tchung">
      <data key="d0">Te-Tchung</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The _té-tchung_ is a specific type of ancient Chinese bell made of copper alloy, primarily used in musical contexts.</data>
