    <node id="Hiuen-Tchung">
      <data key="d0">Hiuen-Tchung</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The _hiuen-tchung_ is an antique instrument included in ancient musical practices during Confucius's time.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hiuen-Tchung is an ancient Chinese musical instrument, included with the antique instruments at the time of Confucius, with a peculiar oval shape and significant ornamentation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b0d3d720b9e8db10b828dd12d97de70e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afd96cea5225608d5415480cf74f1ac5</data>
