    <node id="Saracens">
      <data key="d0">Saracens</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Saracens introduced various musical instruments into Spain, which were later adapted by the locals.&lt;SEP&gt;Saracens is a term used in Europe for Arabian warriors, whose exact etymology is obscure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4512b69e3496f492631c7653788034d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777</data>
