    <node id="Spain">
      <data key="d0">Spain</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Spain is mentioned as a context for the use of certain musical instruments during the twelfth century.&lt;SEP&gt;Spain is mentioned as the country associated with the additional fortification of the Zaffarinds or Jafarines isles.&lt;SEP&gt;Spain is a country that took control of Ceuta after the death of Don Sebastian and retained it until Portugal regained independence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-001c1f1b3eee1ad8a7fbb7cf02acea78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d034b0ebc70d115fe140d386b94caa9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c31ea51debe67089624a49cd283a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6706573dac6e75677a74dc1ef5caf318</data>
