    <node id="Ghafsa">
      <data key="d0">Ghafsa</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Ghafsa is a town mentioned in the text, likely reflecting a geographic and cultural context in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghafsa is a location mentioned during the tour, noted for its geographical features and hot streams containing fish.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghafsa is a town characterized by its hot and mineral springs but has a reputation for being dirty and filled with rubbish.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghafsa is a town where an old Kasbah is located, noted for its dilapidated state.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghafsa is a place from which water is sourced for drinking, mentioned in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghafsa is a location mentioned in the context of a journey and adverse weather.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghafsa is an ancient city in Tunisia, historically significant for its defenses and agricultural contributions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-712990bb2ebe5d62b532d770bfe4b95c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdfdc15ee78020d5a5e9bc96f2c72f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57f75296e95e08ee42b21dc84299286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39746a374c565c0e58462818e02e77f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96b49b26c3ab3e73c7183507f22ac2e9</data>
