      <data key="d0">Atlas Mountains</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The Atlas Mountains are a geographical feature in Morocco, associated with the region's tribes and natural resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlas Mountains are a mountain range in North Africa, known for their high peaks and cultural significance to the Berber people.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlas Mountains are a significant mountain range in Morocco, characterized by high peaks and vast terrain.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlas Mountains are a significant geological feature in Morocco where gold is found.&lt;SEP&gt;The Atlas Mountains are located near Morocco and influence the climate and air quality of the region.</data>
