      <data key="d2">Timbuctoo is a city in Mali that was historically considered within the authority claims of the Shereefs.&lt;SEP&gt;Timbuctoo is a historical trade location where salt from Morocco has been exported.&lt;SEP&gt;Timbuctoo is a destination for caravans that leave from Fez, representing significant trade routes in Africa.&lt;SEP&gt;Timbuctoo is mentioned as part of the trade routes extending from Morocco into the interior regions.</data>
