    <node id="Muley Abd Errahman">
      <data key="d0">Muley Abd Errahman</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Muley Abd Errahman is a Shereefian monarch mentioned in the text with a description of his character and personal appearances.&lt;SEP&gt;Muley Abd Errahman is a prince of the Shereefian dynasty, chosen for the throne and known for his conservative governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Muley Abd Errahman is a historical figure associated with the Shereefian Monarchs in Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Muley Abd Errahman is the nephew of Muley Suleiman and was declared the legitimate successor of the Shereefs.&lt;SEP&gt;Muley Abd Errahman is the Sultan who pursues a pacific policy with the assistance of his vizier, Bouseilam.&lt;SEP&gt;Muley Abd Errahman was a nephew of Muley Suleiman, noted in the genealogy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73c170ba2d6f65788ae52ee29483e59d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feec165bb57c6356de7d23684253d46b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dcfd21521e87c975db82bce68bfa5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f075dca5ffdfa89a91a9f3f686330e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d2e2382323fa2c2ced43dc3587ea2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0feaae427cf9b154a9a737a238afba</data>
