      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Empire of Morocco is the overarching political entity described in the text with a history of dynasties.&lt;SEP&gt;The Empire of Morocco is the historical empire where the Shereefian rulers exercised their authority and governance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Empire of Morocco is referenced in political relations and treaties with Britain, particularly regarding trade and piracy.</data>
