    <node id="Sous">
      <data key="d0">Sous</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Sous is mentioned among the distinguished places in the kingdom of Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Sous is a province near the sea, known for the temple dedicated to the prophet Jonas.&lt;SEP&gt;Sous is a region in Morocco rich in agriculture and historical towns, including major reference points like the Sous River.&lt;SEP&gt;Sous is mentioned as a location related to the slave trade and has historical connections.</data>
