    <node id="Tafilett">
      <data key="d0">Tafilett</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tafilett is a group of towns or villages in the southeast of the Atlas that once formed an independent kingdom.&lt;SEP&gt;Tafilett is a region connected by road to Aghmat, near a river sharing its name.&lt;SEP&gt;Tafilett is listed as one of the significant locations in the Moroccan kingdom.&lt;SEP&gt;Tafilett is a region in Morocco known for its extensive date plantations similar to those in the Jereed.</data>
