    <node id="Efza">
      <data key="d0">Efza</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Efza is a smaller town and suburb divided from Tefza by the river Derna, inhabited by Berbers.&lt;SEP&gt;Efza is noted as a smaller town that serves as a suburb of Tefza.</data>
