      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Islamism is noted as a unifying force against perceived enemies, particularly in the context of the Sultan's influence.&lt;SEP&gt;Islamism refers to the ideological belief and political movements associated with the Islamic faith.</data>
