      <data key="d0">Maroquine Empire</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maroquine Empire refers to the historical Muslim kingdom encompassing present-day Morocco and surrounding areas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Maroquine Empire is a historical entity associated with the governance and political authority in Morocco, particularly during the Islamic era.</data>
