    <node id="Fez">
      <data key="d0">Fez</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Fez is a city located in Morocco, known for its rich history and cultural significance. Historically, Fez has been a major Islamic city and was once the capital of a realm, serving as a reference point for distances to other locations. During the reign of Muley Suleiman, it was hailed as an imperial city.

The city is renowned for its ancient architecture, including significant public buildings that reflect its historical prominence, although many are in a state of decay. Fez has a disaffected population and is recognized for its educational institutions, including traditional mosques and universities that have contributed to its reputation as a center of arts and learning.

As one of the prominent cities in North Africa, Fez boasts a complex demographic landscape and is noted for its notable architecture and urban development. Despite facing challenges, it remains an important historical and cultural site within Morocco, reflecting the city's legacy as a hub of knowledge and a significant settlement among the Moors throughout history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-78c973a4a4c99e07c3571a6d29d1779d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f075dca5ffdfa89a91a9f3f686330e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97d99746fa60d96d3fbab1f89af585c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ee1dd105b3b5398ba93ec7c92e6dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45af3d0999432adf74bdb708ed276f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b31b92f9b032efc61f97bef8d8b3ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3032c2aaf4f583ac650213201f7041d7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
