    <node id="Sidi Mohammed">
      <data key="d0">Sidi Mohammed</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sidi Mohammed is the son of Muley Abd Errahman and the Governor of Fez.&lt;SEP&gt;Sidi Mohammed is a historical figure who lived in the 18th century and is mentioned as a predecessor associated with the Shereefian line.&lt;SEP&gt;Sidi Mohammed died in 1789.&lt;SEP&gt;Sidi Mohammed was a historical figure who conceived the idea of building a city at Fidallah.&lt;SEP&gt;Sidi Mohammed is the Bey of the Camp, who hosted tourists and provided guidance during their expedition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c02e1fb091464c03ab00842920bc21f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feec165bb57c6356de7d23684253d46b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dcfd21521e87c975db82bce68bfa5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f075dca5ffdfa89a91a9f3f686330e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96b49b26c3ab3e73c7183507f22ac2e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f946791371663ec7aa99ab19596abfd1</data>
