    <node id="Turks">
      <data key="d0">Turks</data>
      <data key="d1">people</data>
      <data key="d2">Turks are a group of people primarily associated with Turkey and recognized for their distinct culture and history.&lt;SEP&gt;The Turks are individuals guarding the Kasbah at Ghafsa, characterized by their broken-down appearance.&lt;SEP&gt;Turks are referenced as some individuals who died from the cold.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdfdc15ee78020d5a5e9bc96f2c72f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d3ba708724915d4c95066561027635</data>
