      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Boab is a man who receives treatment from the dervish and pays a fee for the services rendered.&lt;SEP&gt;The Boab is a local man who describes his family life, religious practices regarding marriage, and domestic concerns to the tourists.</data>
