      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">Jerboahs are animals similar to guinea pigs, characterized by their sandy color and fine texture.&lt;SEP&gt;Jerboahs are small rodents that inhabit the region near Tunis and are noted for their resemblance to rats.</data>
