    <node id="Kaed">
      <data key="d0">Kaed</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kaed is depicted as an elderly man who is ill and weeping due to the reunion with his son, who serves as a commander in the camp's guards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Kaed is a venerable man described as a perfect picture of a patriarch from ancient Scriptural times, hosting visitors in his home.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8afc94ee00703bc5476d62e021e1994c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232907dd57f71debadc62dcfe71c8543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25c04a34bdc315c8eeefbaa0ff20978</data>
