    <node id="Toser">
      <data key="d0">Toser</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Toser is a town characterized by mud and brick huts and is described as having an assemblage of small dimensions, surrounded by a landscape that includes a rocky mountain and an irrigation spring called Meshra.&lt;SEP&gt;Toser serves as the head-quarters of the camp in the Jereed, where the narrator describes their arrival and the environment surrounding it.&lt;SEP&gt;Toser is a town where the narrator observes the local conditions, including the prevalence of diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;Toser is another location mentioned in proximity to Nefta, associated with local duck shooting.&lt;SEP&gt;Toser is a location referenced by the travelers during their hunting expedition.&lt;SEP&gt;Toser is a location mentioned as part of travel distances.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e8dad715690b2fe96271b7494f7f290&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fb77c42a6cfd618f0d29c057ae2768&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fdfdc15ee78020d5a5e9bc96f2c72f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1030072f07138e17f0700081a9158b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54d2a15489fc52241d68e4fa40e99203&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86994d5a5ba62d67eaecd5aaeeb5aab4</data>
