    <node id="Date-Trees">
      <data key="d0">Date-Trees</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Date-trees are prominent in Toser, providing fruit that is considered of fine quality and playing a significant role in the local economy and diet.&lt;SEP&gt;Date-trees are mentioned as being prevalent in the region around Dra-el-Hammah and Toser, contributing to the local environment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e8dad715690b2fe96271b7494f7f290&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f6546f0663eb9c1877a5075f89012f</data>
