    <node id="North Africa">
      <data key="d0">North Africa</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">North Africa is a regional area that includes various countries, notably Morocco, which is discussed in the historical context.&lt;SEP&gt;North Africa refers to the region comprising various countries and historical tribes, known for its diverse inhabitants and ancient history.&lt;SEP&gt;North Africa is a region that includes countries like Morocco, Algeria, Tunisia, Libya, and Egypt, known for its diverse cultures and histories.&lt;SEP&gt;North Africa is a geographical region that includes countries along the northern coast of the African continent, characterized by varied climates and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;North Africa is a geographical region known for its climate and agriculture, particularly the cultivation of date-palms.&lt;SEP&gt;North Africa is a vast region mentioned in the context of travel and environment suitable for certain activities.</data>
