    <node id="Shereefs">
      <data key="d0">Shereefs</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Shereefs are the current ruling dynasty in Morocco, having reigned for over three centuries since the mid-seventeenth century.&lt;SEP&gt;Shereefs are descendants of the Prophet and members of a historical class in Morocco with claims to the throne.&lt;SEP&gt;Shereefs are a group that, in historical context, exercise nominal sovereignty in Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Shereefs refer to a lineage of rulers in Morocco characterized by their African heritage.&lt;SEP&gt;Shereefs are historically significant figures in Morocco, specifically in the context of the region's governance and lineage.&lt;SEP&gt;The Shereefs are a lineage in Morocco, descended from the Prophet, holding a unique position of authority.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73f52bfe54d47067a25b5b0c44706763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dcfd21521e87c975db82bce68bfa5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97d99746fa60d96d3fbab1f89af585c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d2e2382323fa2c2ced43dc3587ea2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67512ea13edfd2cab9973f3ae5f8c75d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d121b85033bc8ae8ffcb392dcbbcf78</data>
