    <node id="Carthage">
      <data key="d0">Carthage</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Carthage was an ancient city and civilization located in North Africa, known for its conflicts with Rome.&lt;SEP&gt;Carthage is an ancient city established around 820 years before the Common Era and significant in the history of North Africa.&lt;SEP&gt;Carthage is a historical location referenced in the context of local religious sacrificial practices.</data>
