    <node id="Moor">
      <data key="d0">Moor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Moor refers to members of a North African ethnic group, characterized by their cultural practices regarding beauty standards for women.&lt;SEP&gt;Moors are the inhabitants of Morocco, often depicted in this context as having different legal treatments and cultural practices compared to Europeans.&lt;SEP&gt;Moor is a term used by Romans to describe indigenous tribes of North Africa, often used interchangeably with Berbers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Moors refer to a group of indigenous people in North Africa, often associated with the Berbers and later with the Arabs who invaded Spain.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73f52bfe54d47067a25b5b0c44706763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8990e51d89971d42dec976410186259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9af5b64614e29079b8b6802af2587be</data>
