      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Talent is a strong city and capital of the province of Sous-el-Aksa, characterized by its strategic location and historical significance.&lt;SEP&gt;Talent is a site on the declivity of a hill, known as the residence of the prince Emir Hasham.</data>
