      <data key="d2">The Sheikh is a leader governing the Shelouhs in Shtouka, with a degree of independence from Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sheikh is a leader installed in the context of the Bey's administration, providing authority over the officers who received presents on the occasion.</data>
