      <data key="d0">Wheat-Flour Granulated</data>
      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">Wheat-flour granulated is a nutritive preparation that can be eaten with or without meat and vegetables. When the grains are large, it is specifically called hamza.</data>
