      <data key="d1">food</data>
      <data key="d2">Hamza is a traditional dish in Barbary made from wheat-flour granulated and steamed, noted for its nutritional value.&lt;SEP&gt;Hamza refers to wheat-flour granulated preparation with large grains.</data>
