    <node id="Princesse de Conti">
      <data key="d0">Princesse de Conti</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Princesse de Conti is a historical figure who was the natural daughter of Louis XIV and was approached for marriage by Muley Ismail.&lt;SEP&gt;Princesse de Conti is the natural daughter of the Grand Monarch and Mademoiselle de la Valliere, who was proposed for marriage by the Sultan through his ambassador.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f075dca5ffdfa89a91a9f3f686330e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0feaae427cf9b154a9a737a238afba</data>
