    <node id="Gomera">
      <data key="d0">Gomera</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Gomera, also known as Badis, is a city on the continent opposite Penon de Velez, with historical significance.&lt;SEP&gt;Gomera, also known as Badis and associated with historical contexts, is described as a city that may have been significant in various eras.</data>
