      <data key="d0">Hasbat</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Hasbat is the province that contains Tetuan, described as large and rich.&lt;SEP&gt;Hasbat is the province where the ancient city of Arzila, or Asila, is located.</data>
