      <data key="d0">Ben-Hamed</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ben-Hamed is an influential Arab family associated with the conquest of Ceuta.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ben-Hamed is a powerful Arab family known for conquering Ceuta and establishing control in the region.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c196bdb46661c725027c238489650eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c31ea51debe67089624a49cd283a6</data>
