    <node id="Mohammed Edris">
      <data key="d0">Mohammed Edris</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mohammed Edris is a historic figure from the Ben-Hamed family known for invading Spain and becoming King of Cordova.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohammed Edris is a notable figure from the Ben-Hamed family who invaded Spain and was proclaimed King of Cordova in A.D. 1000.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c196bdb46661c725027c238489650eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c31ea51debe67089624a49cd283a6</data>
