    <node id="Arabians">
      <data key="d0">Arabians</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The Arabians were the descendants of the original invaders from Arabia into North Africa, who succeeded the Romans and Vandals.&lt;SEP&gt;Arabians refer to a group of people often associated with the Arabian Peninsula, characterized by their culture and historical significance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d3ba708724915d4c95066561027635</data>
