    </node>
    <node id="Kairwan">
      <data key="d0">Kairwan</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Kairwan was a city in North Africa that served as the seat of government for the Caliph Kaim before moving to Cairo.&lt;SEP&gt;Kairwan is a city that the travelers rode to, known for being clean but with many houses in ruins.&lt;SEP&gt;Kairwan is a place where the Bey administers justice and conducts governmental duties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4cbd510e5f844be534e59040af85f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25c04a34bdc315c8eeefbaa0ff20978&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232907dd57f71debadc62dcfe71c8543</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
