    <node id="Maroquine Court">
      <data key="d0">Maroquine Court</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Maroquine Court is referenced as a place of anecdotes involving interactions between individuals, including a Sultan and a doctor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Maroquine Court is the royal court of Morocco where events involving the Sultan and ministers take place.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8990e51d89971d42dec976410186259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d2e2382323fa2c2ced43dc3587ea2a6</data>
