    <node id="Cohen">
      <data key="d0">Cohen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Cohen is referenced as a friend who shares anecdotes about the Maroquine Court, contributing to the narrative of social dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;Cohen is described as a quack who shared anecdotes at the Maroquine Court and was consulted on a medical case related to the harem.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8990e51d89971d42dec976410186259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d2e2382323fa2c2ced43dc3587ea2a6</data>
