    <node id="Vizier">
      <data key="d0">Vizier</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Vizier is described as a court official who humorously struts around in the royal gardens wearing Dr. Brown's cocked hat.&lt;SEP&gt;The Vizier is a minister at the Maroquine Court who humorously attempts to impress the Sultan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8990e51d89971d42dec976410186259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d2e2382323fa2c2ced43dc3587ea2a6</data>
