    <node id="Mount Atlas">
      <data key="d0">Mount Atlas</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Mount Atlas is a mountain range in Morocco, serving as a geographical reference for surrounding locations.&lt;SEP&gt;Mount Atlas is a prominent mountain in the Atlantique system, renowned for its historical significance.&lt;SEP&gt;Mount Atlas is described as significant in relation to the sun at noon and is linked to greatness or might.</data>
