    <node id="Tangier">
      <data key="d0">Tangier</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tangier is a city that was bombarded by the French during the conflict affecting Mogador.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is a location that was occupied by England, relevant to the history of relations with the Moors of Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is a city in Morocco where Count Hemo de Graeberg served as Consul.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is also noted for being a frequented town in Morocco.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is a port city that engages in trade with Gibraltar and has a significant commercial exchange.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is a city that has historical significance and has been described in relation to European influence.&lt;SEP&gt;Tangier is mentioned in the context of business affairs discussed at the office.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2d548d08b4129bfc47eab34719160b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4996254e95ccc6b78afba2bb6b96949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6706573dac6e75677a74dc1ef5caf318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0feaae427cf9b154a9a737a238afba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e746cb1e34dcaeb58ddb7736aa554abf</data>
