      <data key="d0">Arzila</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Arzila, also known as Asila, is an ancient Berber city located on the Atlantic coast and was previously fortified by the Portuguese.&lt;SEP&gt;Arzila is a place that was sacked in 936 and remained uninhabited for twenty years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b1b63bc45a96581a48ba223c8d48c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c31ea51debe67089624a49cd283a6</data>
