      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mequinez is a royal city known for its history, large population, and its strategic location near Fez, established by the Berber tribe of Meknasab.&lt;SEP&gt;Mequinez is described as a strong place of the Empire and an emporium of arms.&lt;SEP&gt;Mequinez is referred to as a city known for its olive production.</data>
