      <data key="d0">Fronga</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Fronga is a town densely populated by Shelouhs and Jews, located about fifteen miles from the Atlas range on a fertile plain.&lt;SEP&gt;Fronga is a densely populated town, primarily inhabited by Shelouhs and Jews, situated about fifteen miles from the Atlas range, known for its fertile plains.</data>
