    <node id="Renegades">
      <data key="d0">Renegades</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Renegades are individuals who change their religion, particularly from English to Moorish, and face legal repercussions under Moorish law.&lt;SEP&gt;Renegades refer to individuals who abandon or reject allegiance to a particular group or cause, particularly in the context of historical conquests.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f9af5b64614e29079b8b6802af2587be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d3ba708724915d4c95066561027635</data>
