    <node id="Portugal">
      <data key="d0">Portugal</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Portugal is a European country that conquered Ceuta on August 21, 1415, marking it the first place they occupied in Africa.&lt;SEP&gt;Portugal is referenced as the destination for preparations involving my Lord of Sandwich.</data>
