      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Don Sebastian was a historical figure associated with Portugal whose death in 1578 led to Portugal's colonies passing into Spain's power.&lt;SEP&gt;Don Sebastian is the prince associated with the Portuguese nobility who perished alongside Muley Moluc.</data>
