    <node id="Noah Topping">
      <data key="d0">Noah Topping</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Noah Topping is a character in "Dandy Dick," portrayed as a constable at St. Marvell's.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is portrayed as a rural Police Constable with a fierce demeanor and is described physically with red hair and ill-fitting clothes.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is a police constable mentioned in relation to his work and the handling of a prisoner in St. Marvells.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is a character who is married to Hannah Topping and expresses rage over his circumstances.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is introduced as Hannah's husband, who is mentioned in relation to Durnstone.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping is a police officer who expresses pride in the strict conduct of his police station and deals with various characters within a police station context.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Topping enters the scene seeking a man who escaped his custody, indicating a law enforcement role.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f87fddca66673ee08a52eb11ebbc03dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-406730a86493e16f65817908a0bead18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de37e70a12227d78dd4e8b830ac40b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9adb1b7231075c5bd3151775f9ce69c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5935cd19a49d869dfe9b8b95e3558c7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f6232d66db0520c4e8b57318171b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdfaa450fecffba6a5f866eaa6aeec0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1763626845</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
