      <data key="d0">Dean of St. Marvell's</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dean of St. Marvell's, played by John Clayton in "Dandy Dick," is a central character representing dignity and decorum.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f87fddca66673ee08a52eb11ebbc03dd</data>
