    <node id="Georgiana Tidman">
      <data key="d0">Georgiana Tidman</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Georgiana Tidman is a character in "Dandy Dick," depicted as a widow and the Dean's sister.&lt;SEP&gt;Georgiana Tidman is the Dean's widowed sister who is coming to live with the family, expected to help reduce expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;Georgiana Tidman is a jovial and noisy woman with a masculine appearance, known for her horse racing background and familial ties.&lt;SEP&gt;Georgiana Tidman is a character who enters the scene with Salome and Sheba, revealing her relationship to The Dean.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f87fddca66673ee08a52eb11ebbc03dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea62626f9134cd6522f82d474b2c357b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3c3f1e54f2cd94a7ba1914df2ac61e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af1eb7dd19180841d20fad29810d6539</data>
