      <data key="d2">The Deanery is referenced as the residence where the characters meet and interact.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is the setting where scenes take place, featuring characters sharing tea and discussing their dinner.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is the residence of The Dean, where characters interact and express their emotions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is the residence of The Dean, which is mentioned as being threatened by various issues, including the presence of certain horses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery refers to the residence or administrative offices related to The Dean, where he manages his duties and concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is the residence or office of The Dean, to which Noah intends to go after his duties.</data>
