      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tarver is a character who expresses disconcertment and humor in the context of dining arrangements.&lt;SEP&gt;Tarver is a character who is involved in the rescue efforts and discusses the situation with other characters.&lt;SEP&gt;Tarver is mentioned in the context of the group with Blore, Sheba, and Salome.&lt;SEP&gt;Tarver is a field-marshal who is confronted by Georgiana, indicating his military status.&lt;SEP&gt;Tarver is a character who expresses excitement about being accepted by someone and is eager to see the Dean.&lt;SEP&gt;Tarver is a character present in the scene, seen entering with the Dean and participating in the conversation.</data>
