    <node id="Durnstone">
      <data key="d0">Durnstone</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Durnstone is a location of notable significance within its narrative context, featuring in various events and interactions among characters. It is identified as the starting point from which Major Tarver and Mr. Darbey traveled to visit the Dean, highlighting its role in facilitating important social connections. Additionally, Durnstone is mentioned in the context of evening dining arrangements, suggesting its relevance to the local social scene.

The Wheatsheaf inn, situated in Durnstone, serves as a notable landmark and the site of Georgiana Tidman's recent stay. This suggests that Durnstone may function as a hub for visitors and guests. Furthermore, the location plays a role in discussions surrounding military assistance, implying a deeper connection to themes of security and support within the surrounding community.

Durnstone also emerges as a destination in various plot points, such as being where Noah intends to take a man and where he plans to report the Dean's disappearance. This connection to law enforcement and prisoner transport indicates a complex relationship with authority and crime. The presence of a police station further underscores Durnstone’s significance in maintaining order and providing a backdrop for narrative developments.

Moreover, Durnstone recently hosted a fancy masked ball, events that may have social and financial implications, reflecting societal dynamics at play. Overall, Durnstone can be characterized as a multifaceted location where social, legal, and military narratives converge, influencing the lives and actions of its characters in various ways.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-406730a86493e16f65817908a0bead18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de37e70a12227d78dd4e8b830ac40b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9adb1b7231075c5bd3151775f9ce69c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d690635b31230e7613331edb68d7205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3c3f1e54f2cd94a7ba1914df2ac61e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e596e9ce7637f90613b8207baadae53e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5935cd19a49d869dfe9b8b95e3558c7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f6232d66db0520c4e8b57318171b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe1560cf60e9d4a7338b3d121ff45e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee051bd08ba32e2c7f5e0938dbbc6c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95bebed720934a7d07e65bb3901bf810&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2c82e11dcce129d5615a4deb4b0724</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
