      <data key="d2">Hatcham is a groom who gives updates on the horse Dandy and expresses concern about its tail.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a character mentioned as the person running Dandy Dick up and down the lane to keep the horse warm after the fire incident.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is depicted as a servant who runs in with important information regarding a villain.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is characterized by his enthusiastic cheering and participation in the events surrounding the Dean.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a character who brings an important document of analysis to Sir Tristram and demonstrates an air of concern.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a character who enters and addresses Sir Tristram while carrying a paper regarding a chemist's analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Hatcham is a character mentioned as having secured someone the night before, providing details about the situation.</data>
