      <data key="d2">The Deanery is where significant events unfold, and it serves as the home for Georgiana, Hannah, Salome, and Sheba.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is a place associated with the Dean, indicating a specific location within an administrative or religious context.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deanery is referenced as a significant location where much of the dialogue takes place.</data>
