    <node id="Major Tarver">
      <data key="d0">Major Tarver</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Major Tarver is a character experiencing health issues and engaging in light-hearted conversations with Salome and the others.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is a middle-aged officer who visits Salome and Sheba, displaying a mix of excitement and depression.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is a character who proposed attending the fancy dress masked ball and was involved with Salome and Sheba.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is characterized as not being very conversational and as someone who suffers from indigestion.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is a character mentioned in the conversation who is described as not being very conversational.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is a character who is in a weak state and is brought to the Deanery by Mr. Darbey.&lt;SEP&gt;Major Tarver is one of the individuals mentioned as potentially proposing to Salome and Sheba.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51763246a424f17d012c8a8c92b9dd07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797a0e01fc6bbbd28cfe260a566d2a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b102270ef0e98eb298e79412603ac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd7991bf11c9a900752c7c353a0990c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39786c205992e5e0d95dca55454814f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95bebed720934a7d07e65bb3901bf810&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdfaa450fecffba6a5f866eaa6aeec0</data>
