    <node id="Georgiana">
      <data key="d0">Georgiana</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Georgiana is a multifaceted character who engages deeply in various conversations and challenges related to both personal relationships and the broader context of horse racing. She reflects on her past racing experiences and often discusses sports and life changes, particularly with The Dean, showcasing her ability to engage thoughtfully in significant dialogues.

In her interactions, Georgiana demonstrates her knowledge of horse racing, speaking with figures such as Sir Tristram and discussing plans associated with the sport. Her familial connections are also pivotal; she is the aunt of Sheba and Salome and is approached by them for financial assistance, revealing her involvement in horse betting. Additionally, Georgiana acts as a source of financial guidance for The Dean, playfully suggesting ways to raise money through gambling, indicating her supportive and caring demeanor.

Georgiana’s character is marked by her determination and strength, especially illustrated during the rescue efforts at The Swan Inn. She exhibits a deep concern for the welfare of others, particularly for Tristram and a character named Dandy, expressing affection and care. However, her emotional landscape includes feelings of loneliness and misfortune, particularly regarding her affections for Dandy.

Throughout the narrative, Georgiana takes on an authoritative role, questioning decisions made by others, particularly those relating to children. Her familial concerns extend to her brother, Dr. Jedd, whose mysterious disappearance prompts her to visit the police station. In her quest for understanding, Georgiana expresses curiosity and worry about various situations, including the fate of a man taken by Noah and her distress regarding an incident involving Strychnine.

Overall, Georgiana emerges as a confident and concerned character who balances her involvement in horse racing with significant emotional ties to her family and friends, showcasing her complexity and depth throughout various interactions and events.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1f4fbe7f763ab4a0c366e0536ed6f49e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bf94783f183c51cfeb7911ef8186ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a623d5c8d4e641231b09b42787ad809b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51763246a424f17d012c8a8c92b9dd07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbd76b6f2049550600c7b5f2e214524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b102270ef0e98eb298e79412603ac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dd7991bf11c9a900752c7c353a0990c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1005fe668029a3498fae762b9e2347d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59edcbf702bf09e6c7842114ee9fee90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c9d5647c1407e2585c351081e7eb47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3037df50481adaea6024d7ae1774bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e596e9ce7637f90613b8207baadae53e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5935cd19a49d869dfe9b8b95e3558c7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe1560cf60e9d4a7338b3d121ff45e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee051bd08ba32e2c7f5e0938dbbc6c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b0199cb2086a0bf36a1dde1fbe62d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4d7bb5676e6bc4c87b3981f6f0ae16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2c82e11dcce129d5615a4deb4b0724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdfaa450fecffba6a5f866eaa6aeec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852d4b6446a1278be5194702894654c2</data>
