    <node id="Blore">
      <data key="d0">Blore</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Blore is characterized as a devoted servant who plays a significant role within the household, particularly in relation to The Dean. He displays qualities of a manager and often expresses his frustrations, indicating a complex dynamic with the household's activities. Blore interacts with several other characters, including Salome, Sheba, Major Tarver, and Mr. Darbey, where he fulfills various duties such as providing service and offering commentary on the events around him.

In addition to performing household chores like removing tea trays, Blore also communicates significant news, such as the crisis involving the fire at The Swan Inn. His character is revealed to have a multifaceted relationship with The Dean; he is not only a devoted servant but also engages in conversations that reflect on The Dean's behavior and involves himself in medical tasks related to him. His loyalty is also highlighted by his willingness to assist with situations affecting The Dean and Georgiana.

Blore's involvement goes beyond basic servitude. He is noted to have awareness of household rules and engages in discussions about social matters, including interactions with Hannah regarding local issues, the police, and even a prisoner. This points to a breadth of involvement in both personal and community matters, reflecting his integration into the social fabric of the story.

Moreover, Blore is depicted as someone who grapples with ethical dilemmas, as evidenced by his contemplation of using poison in a particular context and his loyalty to The Dean during accusations of tampering with a mixture intended for Dandy Dick. This suggests that his character can navigate complex situations that test his allegiance and moral fiber, revealing a depth that transcends his role as just a servant.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1f4fbe7f763ab4a0c366e0536ed6f49e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de37e70a12227d78dd4e8b830ac40b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bf94783f183c51cfeb7911ef8186ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a623d5c8d4e641231b09b42787ad809b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9adb1b7231075c5bd3151775f9ce69c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50b102270ef0e98eb298e79412603ac2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1005fe668029a3498fae762b9e2347d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea62626f9134cd6522f82d474b2c357b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39786c205992e5e0d95dca55454814f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee051bd08ba32e2c7f5e0938dbbc6c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893320667c086c5f7bc12fc4874ac8b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95bebed720934a7d07e65bb3901bf810&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdfaa450fecffba6a5f866eaa6aeec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-852d4b6446a1278be5194702894654c2</data>
