      <data key="d2">Marazion is a town in Cornwall that had captured the interest of the narrator and companions for its history and beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;Marazion is a small town in Cornwall known for its picturesque surroundings and proximity to St. Michael's Mount.&lt;SEP&gt;Marazion is a nearby location with a contrasting environment and is mentioned in relation to the activity of its visitors.&lt;SEP&gt;Marazion is a town mentioned as being near to Land's End, referenced during the narrator's journey.&lt;SEP&gt;Marazion is a town in Cornwall, England, where the arrival of a princess is anticipated, prompting interest from the local populace.&lt;SEP&gt;Marazion is described as the location of a mild little station where a crowd has gathered to await an event.</data>
