    <node id="Lizard">
      <data key="d0">Lizard</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Lizard is noted as a recommended sight-seeing destination, described as potentially better than Land's End.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a geographical reference mentioned as a point near where the characters are traveling.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard is referenced in the context of a storm in the text, embodying the ferocity and chaos of the weather experienced.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a place noted for longevity, where several deaths at over a hundred years old are recorded.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a coastal area in Cornwall known for its beauty and archaeological sites.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is a geographic location known for its dangerous cliffs and association with maritime incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard is an area in Cornwall referenced during the characters' visit and planned excursions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b37d7eb87d239e5e28288c02a976c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe99e4059d4a83bdd69b8d710ad9ca66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88bb0742ed8d4804fc66811c924845ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c1cd94b8b0a4c57576d20936affb7f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9744909492c02bf3c9b5f954e5e18588&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5836d0924804112ead175776cdcd9ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d2731c78f5f53bb6ab7e2954c093064</data>
