    <node id="Landewednack">
      <data key="d0">Landewednack</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Landewednack is a parish known for its ancient church, referred to as "the white-roofed church of St. Wednack," and is located in Cornwall.&lt;SEP&gt;Landewednack is a location where the harvest festival is held, inviting the public to participate.&lt;SEP&gt;Landewednack is referenced in relation to the Church and is part of the drive through Lizard Town.</data>
