    <node id="Lizard Town">
      <data key="d0">Lizard Town</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Lizard Town is a town located near the Lizard Peninsula where the travelers are heading, known for its white-painted houses and shops.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a location mentioned as part of the characters' journey through the countryside.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a nearby area to Cadgwith, known for its community interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a relatively modern settlement that belongs to the parish of Landewednack, known for its distinctive local population and coastal surroundings.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is mentioned as the origin of a couple taking their evening stroll along the cliffs.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a place where the characters observe young people wandering under the moonlight.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a bright little town in Cornwall mentioned during the characters' drive, highlighting its charm and scenery.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b37d7eb87d239e5e28288c02a976c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79c397e03eded0bedcfd22c948ef8967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b147dfcab79c75ec8a9092c688ad363d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9947d8e5a23dab49c88d36cae1db57a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0cc4adb1d182cba3feb57248b5f290&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2a4525b14048f3353d702b98f67ccda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfcfaae8c46b24eac1b42d9fe626fd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f749ef842a6b7afcee9121c9350e439</data>
