      <data key="d0">Mullion</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Mullion is another destination mentioned in Charles's detailed plan to cater to the ladies during their outing.&lt;SEP&gt;Mullion is a locality that was considered as a stop on the way to Penzance, featuring an old church.&lt;SEP&gt;Mullion is a location associated with the tradition of longevity and the ghost of Reverend Flavel.</data>
