    </node>
    <node id="Cornwall">
      <data key="d0">Cornwall</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Cornwall is a region in England, specifically located in the southwest, renowned for its picturesque coastline and scenic landscapes. The area is characterized by rugged cliffs, sandy beaches, and charming rural environments, making it a popular destination for travelers seeking adventure and exploration. Cornwall is often depicted as a risky yet alluring coast, rich in historical and mythical significance, contributing to its appeal as a site of interest for many.

The scenic beauty of Cornwall is complemented by its cultural and historical depth, which includes local traditions, communities, and notable events such as harvest festivals. These cultural elements provide context to narratives set in the region, often highlighting sentiments and stories tied to the area's unique character. The region's mining history is also a significant aspect of its identity, along with its religious-minded community, which shapes its social fabric.

Cornwall's significance extends beyond its natural attractions, as it serves as the backdrop for various narratives, illustrating both the rural charm and community spirit of its inhabitants. The region's reputation as a site of boating excursions and coastal legends further enhances its allure, making it a focal point for personal journeys and reflections. Overall, Cornwall emerges as a vibrant and historically rich region, integral to the settings and themes in the narratives that reference it.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b37d7eb87d239e5e28288c02a976c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412525aa2850ddcda626495405c2c4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0acdfa773f8af706f91ebb20b7581863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9567484ec2e94de37ab803e0df4f01d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-954cde81659c45a63d9688ff1660cf5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe99e4059d4a83bdd69b8d710ad9ca66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88bb0742ed8d4804fc66811c924845ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad935363bd1f002bacc611b031c99cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d970d400c7e2e3d42bc4de363f798b2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7588957ea7d271bfdda9ca4a517733ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c806b84743a90dfbb4163c33c2229a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9744909492c02bf3c9b5f954e5e18588&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73be86d35f5dd3c806476e4e7c02d004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f749ef842a6b7afcee9121c9350e439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b244aae51773bf1f2438d4305c91ceec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0cc4adb1d182cba3feb57248b5f290&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013f67bf042c7366daa951d89bffb75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b07f91a63f12116362cc5c772cacd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d2731c78f5f53bb6ab7e2954c093064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79c397e03eded0bedcfd22c948ef8967</data>
