      <data key="d0">Falmouth</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Falmouth is the location mentioned as being accessible from Gerrans by boat.&lt;SEP&gt;Falmouth is a location referenced as the starting point for travel to The Lizard.&lt;SEP&gt;Falmouth is referenced as a location from which pic-nic parties travel to Mullion Cove.&lt;SEP&gt;Falmouth is a town referenced as the destination for transportation on Sunday morning.&lt;SEP&gt;Falmouth is a town referenced as a destination for returning to civilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Falmouth is a port town in Cornwall, mentioned as a destination for the journey planned by the narrator.</data>
