    <node id="Tintagel">
      <data key="d0">Tintagel</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tintagel is known as the birthplace of King Arthur and a destination mentioned in the journey.&lt;SEP&gt;Tintagel is the castle where Uther Pendragon besieged Ygrayne and where Arthur was conceived.&lt;SEP&gt;Tintagel is a historic site associated with legends of King Arthur, featuring ancient ruins and a significant sense of mystery.&lt;SEP&gt;Tintagel is a historic site in Cornwall, known for its sea-caves and connection to King Arthur.&lt;SEP&gt;Tintagel is a historical site associated with King Arthur, characterized by its fortress ruins and scenic views.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73be86d35f5dd3c806476e4e7c02d004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c40a925861c89aa50e0fdf703fdaf56f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f14dbef413cc17a6b6cd1e7d1b659eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b07f91a63f12116362cc5c772cacd1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a64b7ad3d05ef11eb080f1a8e10aa6ae</data>
