    <edge source="Salome" target="Sheba">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Salome and Sheba are depicted as sisters who share a deep emotional connection marked by trust, affection, and camaraderie. Their relationship is characterized by open communication, as seen in their discussions about their family, particularly concerning their father and aunt. This close bond becomes particularly evident during conversations about their concerns, which include financial worries and the challenges posed by the military’s actions.

Throughout these exchanges, Salome and Sheba exemplify a supportive and collaborative dynamic. They engage in playful interactions and work together to address their emotional and situational struggles. Their loyalty to one another is a recurring theme, as they defend their choices and express solidarity amid shared discontent regarding their circumstances.

Moreover, their ability to react to unfolding events together illustrates the strength of their sisterly bond. Salome and Sheba’s relationship is defined not only by their discussions and plans but also by their mutual support for one another in times of worry, particularly in relation to their father’s situation. Overall, their connection reflects a resilient partnership as they navigate personal and familial challenges together.</data>
      <data key="d9">defense,emotional support,family interaction,friendship,loyalty,planning,shared emotional experience,shared grievances,shared humor,sibling interaction,sibling relationship,siblings,sisterhood,sisterly bond,support,trust</data>
